<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Alkitab Bahasa Ansus</book>
  <para style="ide">65001 - Unicode (UTF-8)</para>
  <para style="h">LUKAS</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lukasi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Lukasi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk.</para>
  <para style="mt2">ARERA WEWENG WE</para>
  <para style="mt1">LUKASI soi</para>
  <para style="is">Kawio aduna</para>
  <para style="im">Weraung arera piboki na Rukasi weroana we Yesusi, I wo we Mananu periri we Sen derekamana we nyontarai Israeli kong we tata kuira.</para>
  <para style="ip">Na weraung nini Rukasi soi topino, Sen Duainunung Mamarangpai domu Yesusi we wiwua Arera Piboki na Allai wu nyontarai engkiaripi kong we endidiwa pa ya. Dea tato wepiboki na weraung Rukasi nei, we retenang na rirangpea repa we Yesusi riama. Interi we disuira wau tato we Yesusi piowari wieita to rora-marising. Interi Rukasi tato soi weraung pea, anompei buku Rasuri. Buku nana sopang kakera, parari Akama Kerestenpai wewa ma rieraipa. Rabuang kodu kong wonang (mendeo tarai weraung nei ungne) yoni arari parari pi we pau we wataina weraung nini paiki. Parari: arari rarung mampang kong we eteung pieung werama na awe Yesusi nyani meituturi pa. Yesusi nyai na Sen nemanu na wekumaipa, kong sosiau we nyontarai Samaria weanewiwu kong kumai wenyai. Weraung nini weroang kangkuna tato we tandau, Sen Allai Duainunung Mamarang, wawing wau engkonta na mariwa we Yesusi donawau ma tiang tato wau na Allai.</para>
  <para style="is">Weraung Rukasi taraipina</para>
  <para style="ip">Repa 1:1-4</para>
  <para style="ip">Yoanesi Pembabtisi kong Yesusi umbejadi sisu umbe kumaipa 1:5-2:52</para>
  <para style="ip">Mariwa Yoanesi Pembatisi 3:1-20</para>
  <para style="ip">Etupi raweing Yesusi kong nyombatang wadi souri 3:21-4:13</para>
  <para style="ip">Mariwa Yesusi na nyontarai Galilea enemadu 4:14-9:50</para>
  <para style="ip">Rana Galilea to Yerusalem 9:51-19:27</para>
  <para style="ip">Arimunggu we menaing na Yerusalem rurangpa 19:28-23:36</para>
  <para style="ip">Yesusi tewa warui kaida denyawi kong piowari rora-marising 24:1-53.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s">Kawio retenang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Theopilus au we moi, yau Lukasi etoi arera nina we au, wo nyontarai madu eserai imbaro entoi pitau we Yesusi nyari dona na tane pandurapa. <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />Parari we entopana we tata na we pampong, we endeoa na endekami na we weesayau Allai ne Arera <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Topiyana ma aneutatua pitaubai wawau na we mai na retenangpa, imbaro ekutu we etoi kepana na we mai we au. <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />Imbaro anemuaoa we pitaubai we etintanyau au yana wepitarai toapeina.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Werangdoana we Yoanisi ingkai nyani dawini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Na awe Herodesi we mananu baba na Yudea, nyontarai Imami pei anong pei Zakariai ria na marandang Imami Abiai. I ne wawini tato ria na Imami baba Haruni ne mandarong pai we anong pei Elisabeti.<verse eid="LUK 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Asaru mamo umai na Allai renapa. Kong urong parari pitau we Allai dona, mae urong sasari wa. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Mana une kumai pei wa, wo Elisabeti anekarawai kong piana asaru umbe paituangto.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Na a peana, Abiai ne marandang wadi etadu esanomi mae Zakariai we anong riu pi we imami na we Allai renawau. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Mae a we engkai aikara parari we Imami etona pa, imbaro kemang Imami matei we riupi, andi aikara deduti, imbaro ingkai yuara nyunung pikika kemenyani na Allai ne Manu Mamarang rarongpa. Impaina Zakariai andi deduta pa. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Na a yani Zakariai yua nyunung pikika na Sen ne Manu rarongpa mae nyontarai tau we empandura na riwau kong entandau. <verse eid="LUK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Toyana Seni ne mampang pei, denyawi we Zakariai, doa na wara dowatang na pata we dinunung pikika kemenyani nai wadi. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Zakariai reo mampang wadi pa, tentuma kong metai. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Mana mampang wadi kewio weiya doyo, “Zakaria ye! Remo motaipe, wo piwe tondau weapa piana Seni yepatara mae donato. Mae Elisabeti wawimui, ingkai dawing kumai muang pei we au, mae ingkai wawi anong pei Yoanisi. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Au ingkai morarising kia mae kawasa emararising tutu kumai wadi, na awe nyani miotuturi wane. <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />Wo i ingkai beba na Sen renawau, mae ingkai dunung angguri wa kong wang mamunawa. Mae donung na Sen Duainunung Mamarang, na a retenang nyaina nyani aneaiwawing pa. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />I ingkai dong nyontarai Israeli madu pei entaweri wu Allai, Mamarang enempai. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Mae i ingkai ria pampong Seni, mae ne paya parari nabi Eliai na pampong pa. Imbaro dong tamania esanerarong taweri wu ene kumai kong inyosane na nyontarai we emai wa, wu we esanetatua nyontarai we emai, mae i dong kui marandang we mei pei etamang we Seni. <verse eid="LUK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Interi Zakariai kewio wu mampang wadia doyo, “Topitotoi ingkai parariapa? Wo yau ewe paituangto, neu wawing wanei tato ne ape babaeato.” <verse eid="LUK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Mampang wadi kewio wuria doyo, “Yau Gabrieli. Yau yoana Allai renawau, erupatari diru ayari. Allai demi yau toninama imbaro etopang Arera Weweng nina ne we au.” <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Pitau we etopana ninane ingkai pararia mana anemusara wa, impaina woreng tamung kio a we pitau ninane tawa na wane interi kowio. <verse eid="LUK 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Toyanapa nyontarai tau, etamang Zakariai pampang. Embekaeng wo Zakariai nyai na Allai ne Manu Mamarang rarong woroi kapara. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Meti mari kewio pea wa wu yara wa, mana piana esanetatuata we piana reo pianeato na Manu Mamarang rarong. Interi dong pararia wu yara, wo woretamung. <verse eid="LUK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Toyana piwe riu wau ra kaito, teweri wu manu wanea. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />We pira a pea asaru Wawini Elisabeti deyoape, impaina yembai awaruring i denyawi wa. <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />Doyo, “Nina mamo piwe Sen dona we yau, wo a nei Sen dupi neu mamayane na kawasa endenawau.”<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Werandoana we Yesusi nyani Mariai dawini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Na awe Elisabeti piana deiyoa yembaipe bowonang, interi Sen Allai demi ne mampang Gabrieli riawu bendari koiri na nu Galilea, anong pei Nasareti. <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />Ria wu karawing dina anongpe Mariai. I wo dengkong muang pei wami. Mariai wo weanong we Yusupi, na mandarong Dauti.<verse eid="LUK 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Topiana mampangnei, yua na Mariai ne manunei, riuwara wei doyo, “Tabea! Bodu, Sen ne wewempa, Sen nyai konta au.”<verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Mariai tentuma tarao kawio wau, aneng dutang waweri, kawio pa totoai tonina? <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Mampang nei kewio we Mariai doyo, “Remo motaipe, au bodu weweng kong Allai peidi. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Ingkai boiyoa, buawing kumai muang pei, wauwi anong pei Yesusi. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />I wo ingkai beba, esawi we Allai we tedai raweina ne Kumai, mae Sen Allai doni we mananu parari, ne woriai Dauti. <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Ingkai we mananu baba na Yakupi ne tapung woriai wanea kio woroi-woroi, mae ne Maring pa wata weyuwi sopisoane.”<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Mariai riuwara we mampangpai doyo, “Pitau ninane ingkai topino, wo edidau wami.”<verse eid="LUK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Mampangpai riuwara we Mariai doyo, “Sen Duainunung Mamarang wiao au, paya na Allai dewu au tutu kumai we buawini yanipai, esawi we Kumai Mamarang, Allai Antung. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Mae tarai, Elisabeti nemeta pai tato, dontayoa kumai muang pei na ne awe paituangbau, piana ne yembaipe awaru wonang pinini, we etoyo anekarawai. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Wo na Allai mamo ea taworawa.”<verse eid="LUK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Impaina Mariai doyo, “Toyana mamo, Sen ne woming di yau, we topana pa pararia.” Interi mampang wadi ria warui.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mariai ria piaio Elisabeti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Woroi wami mae Mariai ria wu bendari pei na Yudea na raora we wi pa. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Na yana i yua wu Zakariai ne manu wadi, interi i dong tabea we Elisabeti. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Mae toyana Elisabeti tarao tabea na Mariai, kumai we niai na aneaiwawing pai merarising kong yuira. Mae Elisabeti Sen Duainunung Mamarang niai nai, <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />impaina Elisabeti kewio doyo, “Mariaie! Allai dong beng we au warui wawing neya kuira, mae kumai we buawini pai ingkai dedu muang ria Sen pai. <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Matei di yau, aidonane Sen nyani ria wu yauma pa? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Wo na awe bong tabea pai, kumai we nyai na aneuaiwawing nei yuira mae merarising. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Au bodu wewengpa tutu piana anemusisarao piwe Seni sopana we aupa ingkai taoa.”<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mariai rioi rarung deparanding Allai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Interi Mariai doyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">“Yeparanding Seni na aneurarong nei,<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />Mae yau emararising na duainunung nei tutu Allai neu Mampariri pina,<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />wo I rekakepang nyontarai emayea ne yau!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Na a nei wu a taubai we rama wane dakami tau entopana etoyo, ‘yau emai raweina.’<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />Tutu Allai We Piaya doyao mariwa baba we yau tutu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:49">Anompa wo Mamarang.<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Mae newempa yuwio</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:50">nyontarai we endoa oi paya.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />I deniau paya we dona na warangpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">Mae I sota nyontarai we embesompari.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />I pi mananu wauya warui paya enempa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:52">mae riuwa nyontarai we esaneai waya.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />I dong roweang weweng we nyontarai we embawi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:53">mae demi nyontarai we enepipau paya entaweri na kakawiri.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />I piata ne woming Israeli paya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54">tutu aneao ne apa we doni we ne apusi woriai pai.<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />Seni wo perandeni wa, apa we sopana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:55">topino, aneung Abrami</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:55">tutu ne tapung woriaipai wata weyuwi sopisoane.<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Wepira yembaipe toru Mariai niai kong Elisabeti, interi teweri wu ne manupai ya.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoanis Pembaptisi nyani dawini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Interi a wau ra mai we Elisabeti we do dawing, i tato dawing kumai muang pei. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Impaina manu wararei wauya kong neta mantaung entaraoa we Sen ne weweng pa we Elisabeti, mae ya tato eto emararising konti. <verse eid="LUK 1:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Awe kumai wadi ne a pe injatang pina, nyontarai we empau endama we eto embe sunati<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.59 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sunati mamo muang apai enempa engkuturewuwai parari Arera na Weraung Musaipa </char></note>. Ya esau tamani anong wau na kumai wadi impaina anong Zakariai, <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />mana nyani doyo, “Wengki! I metoni anong pei Yoanisi.”<verse eid="LUK 1:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Weendama paya entopana wei etoyo, “Na mune mandarong paya, nyontarai peiwa anong toyana pa wa.” <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Interi ya etong kamang we kumai wadi tamani we etintutani, tamane nyosanong totoai bona we kumai neipa. <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />I dewa kami we etingtoia, interi entoi kawio wau, “Anongpei Yoanisi.” Mae ya wo esarokutuya na pitau wawau. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Na a yanito Zakaria kewio naria ea, mae deparinding Allai. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Impaina nyontarai taupa ya we enaina raora yani ematai kong entuang esomi we Seni, tutu arera wawau embuwua tate raora wi rewowai Yudea tantenang. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Mae nyontarai paya engkai we entaraoa, esanetatuata kong engkawio etoyo, “Topitotoi we kumai nini?” Tutu Sen warangpa deruari.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zakariai sopang arera na Seni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Zakariai, Yoanisi tamani, Allai Duainunung Mamarang pai yumaoi impaina, i sopang arera na Seni. Kewio doyo,<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />“Mararising we Seni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">Allai nyontarai Israeli!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:68">Wo I riama piata Ne kawasa paya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">kong pikaya.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />I dona we tata Pariri we piaya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:69">na mandarong Dauti, Allai ne woming pai.<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />Na awe rampa piana Allai kewio</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:70">kamana na ne nabi diri ya paya<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />we, warapika tata warui weembemarowa we tata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:71">kong warui nyontarai we emaidi tata ene paya pa.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Allai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72">denyau anerarong we wieng pai we</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72">tantapumi woriaipai, kong ingkai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72">dong parari ne apa Mamarang pai.<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />Apa yani sopani we</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:73">Abrami, tane woriaipai. Allai derekamana we ingkai<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />periri tata warui</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:74">weembemarowa we tata imbaro tantandau wei mae tandeo tamatai wa,<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />anemai tasomi wei mae tambaua anerarong na</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:75">awe tambeng na nunei.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Neu kumaipa au, ingkai esau au we nabi na</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">Allai We Tedairaweina, au etami au</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">pompong Seni we boning rang pai wei.<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />Au ingkai topang</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:77">kamana we kawasa paya, wo Allai ingkai periri ya tutu dupirandeni ya warui sasari enempa.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Impaina, tarai tane Allai</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:78">anewiwu kong</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:78">anemanyayang interi I riama we periri tata.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:78">Parari wo we tepira na ayarima,<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />dong ne wedea wadi we nyontarai wauya engkai we embeng na we</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">berorang kong ematai. I dingtata wu rang wepiboki.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Zakariai ne kumai wadi beba toyei kong anerarong piaya. Mae i nyai na we mapang wau kio awau ramapa, i meti ma denyawi dong parari piwe deduta dona na rai Israeli enerabuang pa.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s">Yesus nyani dawini</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 1:18-25)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />A peana to Kaisar Agustusi woretuwara, entoikamang kawasa na nu Roma tantenang. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Ninane entoikamana retenang na awe Kireniusi we mananu na raora Siria. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Topiana kawasa enda entoikamasa na bendari mantaung enempa.<verse eid="LUK 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Topiyana pa Yusupi donda warui bendari Nasareti na Galilea wu Yudea to <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Betlehemi esawiwe bendari Dauti wo nyani dawini na peina</char></note>bendari Dauti we anong Betlehemi, tutu i mamo na mandarong aiwawing Dauti, <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />imbaro entoikamani kong Mariai weanombei we piana deyoato. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Undara sisu bendari Betlehemi paina, dedu awe Mariai deiwawing. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Ma i dawing kumai muangpei, kumai retenang. Yesani na asung rarai mae doni wiana wonyai piaung etampi nai wadi, tutu nu pea wea wa na manu endama etena nai pai.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">We etaiwai pieung kong mampang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Na raora Betlehemi mamo, we eteung pieung pea enai na mapang embido taubai pieung eneng na a diru. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Interi Seni ne mampangpei doa tantuma kikeu weya, mae Sen ne wedea wido ya, impaina ematai kia. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Interi mampang wadi kewio wu ya doyo, “Memataiwa tutu tarai yau eweroana we mia kawio mararising baba we kawasa wepau na nunei <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />A nini weperiri mia piana nyani dawini to na bendari Dauti iwo Kristusi, Seni pina. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Mae nini kamang we mia, ingkai metadu kumai mararia pei yesani na asung rarai, mae wiana wonyai pieung etampi nai wadi.” <verse eid="LUK 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Mae tantuma pandura kong mampang wau pitaubai rai rora we etaparanding Allai etoyo, <verse eid="LUK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />“Mararising we Allai na rora wetadai, ma piboki na nunei na raora nyontarai we Allai aneoya.”<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Interi mampang wauya enda warui ya mae entaweri to rora-marising, weeteung pieung ne engkawio waweria wea etoyo, “Mendama tanda to Betlehemi imbaro tandeo pitoi wepi na wana, parari we Seni weroana we tata pa.”<verse eid="LUK 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Interi ya embawoa enda etadu Mariai kong Yusupi kong mararia wadi, we wiana wonyai pieung etampina rarong.<verse eid="LUK 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Na awe ya endeoipa, ya emberoang pitoi aino piana mampang emberoana wea tutu mararia wadi. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Mae nyontarai pitau we entaraoa paya, etakakaera tutu piwe sopana we weeteung pieung wau entopanapa. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Mana Mariai anekakepang kawio pitaubai nina na anerarong mae anetatuata. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Mae weeteung pieung wauya entaweri mae etaparanding kong esomi Sen Allai, tutu pitaubai we entaraoa kong endeoapa kai, parari we mampang pai sopana weya pa.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi esau anongpa oi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Interi Kumaipai ne ape injatoru mamo, ape mai we wesunati mae esawi na anong Yesusi. Anongo mampangpai dona pa na awe Mariai deiyoai wamipa. <verse eid="LUK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Mariai ne awau piakodu ra mai we yoikaru, parari Kawio we Musai soi pa. Impaina Yusupi kong Mariai ungko kumai wadi to Yerusalemi mae uroa tuturi we Seni. <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />Na arera we rana Sen Allai dona we Musai soipa riotu tonina, “Na kumai muang retenang paya, eandi engko ya wu Senpai.” <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Tau we urona nina parari Weraung we Musai soipai. Interi ungko aya mandung kumai pe kodu we pikika parari arerapa. <verse eid="LUK 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Na a yani na Yerusalemi nyontarai pei anong pei Simeoni. I wo anesarao Allai mae mei. Kong demang a we Allai periri Israeli paya. Duainunung Mamarangpai duari, <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />mae Allai Duainunung piana kewio aroana wei, wo i ingkai kedawa wami kio i reo Mampariri we Sen derekamani we riama pai. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Allai Duainunung yiru Simeoni, ria yua na Sen Ne Manu rarongpa. Na a' yani Yusupi kong Mariai ungko Yesusi yua wu Sen ne manu rarongpa kuira, we uroa tuturi we Seni parari kamang weraung Musai soipa. <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Interi Simeoni yideu kumai wadi mae deparinding Allai doyo,<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />“Seni, Au piana bong parari arera topana pa to,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">impaina pika yau ekada na wemai.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Wo Mampariri ria na Au pa ma nei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:30">ereuwoi na reukami neu ne to.<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />Weperiri piana kemani we kawasa we pau na nunei,<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />parariapi dea we Allai doni wedea we marandang wenari warui Israeli.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">Kong kia dea we Nemu nyontarai Israeli paya.”<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Mae tamani kong nyani usarokutuya untarao piwe Simeoni sopana we Kumai wadi. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Simeoni tendau waro Allai myuang ya, mae kewio we Mariai doyo, “Allai piana diri Kumainei we dona mamo, nyontarai Israeli ne ea ya etadu we moyawa mae eaya etadu we weweng. I perari kamang we rana Allai we disua nyontarai etosara ya, mae ingkai nyontarai peaya embatetari, <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />interi kawasa nei kuira, esaneaoa we pi nyontarai esanetatuapa mamo moyawa. Kong Maria au, anemurarong tekakutu parari sondu diang anemurarompai.” <verse eid="LUK 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Na yana tato nabi wawing pei Anong pei Hanai. Tamani anompei Fanueli, na mandarong Aseri. Hanai nini wepaituang sera. Didaua ne puda pe boitu, ne muangpai keda warui. <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />Interi nina i ne pudape piamanua ea manua (84) mana wekabong. I wo diru raida mamo, pika Allai Ne Manu wadi wa. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Na a yani i ria to yana dong taparanding Allai, mae kewio pararia we kumai wadi we nyontarai tau we etamang we awe Allai periri Yerusalemi pa.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Taweri to Nasareti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Yusupi kong Mariai urong pararia kuira kai, arera we na weraung Musai soi ma etong pararia. Interi entaweri naria ea wu bendari enainai na Nasareti, na raora Galilea. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Kumai wadi beba topong mae piaya kaiketara, donung na anetatuatapa kong Allai ne weweng pa wata konti.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus ne pudape uraea kodu na Allai Ne Manu rarong pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Puda dediru Yesusi inyani, tamani enda to Yerusalemi na a Paska pai, imbaromi etong anani baba esaneao Sen Allai kio rai Israeli paya emati warui raora Mesiri pai. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Toyana Yesusi piana ne puda dediru uraya kodu, itongda wu Yerusalemi na a' Paska parari ayanapa. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />A' wawau ra kai ma itoro itontaweri, mana Yesusi nyai na Yerusalemi. Inyani, tamani undui nariwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Wo urorato empau paina, andi riadadau dakami we enda kuirapa. Enda a' tantenang pei, interi userai wu uneta mantaung kong aririra wauya. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Toyana uraduti wa paina, untaweri wu Yerusalemi ea userai. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />We pira a botoru uraduti na Sen Ne Manu rarongpa, meoi na kuru akama Yaudi ene rabuang kuira tarao kawio we entopana pa, interi dong autang wu yara. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Kawasa tau we entaraoi, esarokutuya na ne weanetatuata kong wesopana wea na weetutanapa. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Na yana inyani, tamani undeoi, usarokutuya, interi inyani kewio we ne kumai wadi doyo, “Pitoi dona mamo bongtopi wawau we andu pa? Tamamui kong nyau usarokutuya usera au!”<verse eid="LUK 2:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Riuwara wu asarua doyo, “Pitoi musera yau wei pa? Mundui naria wae yau wo enaipi Yai ne Manu neie?.” <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Mana usane tatuata ao piwe Yesusi sopana we asaru pawa.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Interi ria kong asaru enda kuira wu Nasaretia, nyai na umbarararong kio beba. Mana inyani anekakepang pitaupa na anerarong. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Yesusi beba topong, mae anekurayang kia. Mae Sen Allai kong nyontarai tau esaneoikia.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s">Arera na Yoanis Pembaptisi</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 3:1-12; Markusi 1:1-8; Yohanesi 1:19-28)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Na taumi uraya ring na awe kaisar Tiberiusi riu wemananu na Roma pa, Pontiusi Pilatusi we Gubernuri na Yudea, mae Herodesi wemananu baba na Galilea. Pilipusi, Herodesi netapai wemananu na raora Iturea kong Trakhonitisi, mae Lisaniasi wemananu na Abilene. <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />Na a we Hanasi kong Kayafasi umbe Imami Baba pa, Allai kewio we Yoanesi, Zakariai ne kumai pai na raora wemapang wadi. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Interi Yoanisi ria wari raora maria Yordani tantenang kong wiuwu arera na Allai. Yoanisi doyo, “Mesanetaweri warui mene sasaripa mae embebaptisi mia, imbaro Allai dupipira mene sasaripa.” <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Impaina Yoanesi nini di Allai sopang parari na kawio entoi na weraung nabi Yesayai pa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">“Nyontarai pei yau na mapang wane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">boning rangpai we Seni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">nuari rang pai yeriwang we I.<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Berarongpa tuau,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">mae wi rewowai bona tabora.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">Rang we kapipauri bona ariwang kong</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">we wekambirirei pa kowung.<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Impaina nyontarai paya engkai, ingkai endeo pariri we na Allai pa.”<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Nyontarai empau endawu Yoanisi we</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:7">webaptisi ya. Yoanisi kewio we ya doyo, “Miawo nyontarai we memamuna! Mana matei sopana we mia we memati warui mambabati na Allaio ingkai riama wane? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Impaina meto memati warui mambabati na Allai ingkai riama wane mamo, metanyawa na we metonapa piana mesaneng taweri tarai warui mene sasaripa. Mae mendeo mengkawio na mesanerarongpai, ‘Yau yedu mambabati na Allai wa tutu yauwo erana mandarong Abarami nempai’. Yau ekawio we mia tonina: Allai berui riwang kami nina ra we mandarong Abrami! <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Tamangnei piana demang na ai rawongpai we etingdowani to. Aipa totoai dong bong we maipea wa mamo, ingkai endowani mae esoi wu adia wadia.” <verse eid="LUK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Interi nyontarai nea etutang Yoanesi etoyo, “Impaina pipatotoi ingkai amatonapa?”<verse eid="LUK 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />
  </para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:11">Yoanisi daoa weya doyo, “Nyontaraipa matei ne asung pe kodu, mamo dong ei we wekiaripai, mae nyontarai we ne roweang pea mamo wiwo we wekiari roweang pai”.<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />We esau wiwai we Kaisari wauya endawu Yoanisi konta we webaptisi ya. Etutani etoyo, “Yai Kurue, pipatotoi amatonapa?” <verse eid="LUK 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Yoanisi daoa wea doyo, “Mendeo mesau raweina warui we piana Kaisari engkutupa.”<verse eid="LUK 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Nyontarai pimamuna pea konta, ea etutani etoyo, “Impaina ama mamo, pitoai ingkai amatonapa?” Yoanisi daoa wea doyo, “Mendeo memungtati nyontarai pea ea pe mae mendeo metawa ene ra pa pe, kong metimbu nyontarai pea ya na we maiwa pe, metadu pe na mene gajipa mamo piana maia we mia to!”<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Kawasa tau pai etutana waweri ya, we piana Yoanesi nini ene Mananu Mampariri etamamani pai dina pe. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Mana Yoanisi daoa weya doyo, “Yau ewe baptisi mia na maria, mae nyontarai we beba rawei nyau nei ingkai riama. Esepa ne wai sapatu pa mamo emaiwa. I ingkai webaptisi mia na Duainunung Mamarang kong adia. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Na warangpa riu pirindayang pei we dintiri pasibupa ra mamarang. Pasibu ne enduri kuira na manu pai, mana keang tau pai ingkai enunumi na adia we etayoi wa rarong pa!”<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Impaina Yoanisi denyau nyontarai paya na piwe pau ea, na a we wiuwu arera we mai pa. <verse eid="LUK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Mana mananu Herodesi, mananu Galilea wadi, Yoanisi yuari tutu riauwo Herodiasi, neta baba pai wawini, kong we dosaepi pau pea ea. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Impaina Herodesi mananu wadi keou ya, mamo dosaepi memba naria ea na demi ne rai paya entapu Yoanesi mae engkori to wangka rarong pa.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoanisi webaptisi Yesusi</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 3:13-17, Markusi 1:9-11; Yohanesi 1:32-34)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Yoanesi engkori to aitamu rarongpa wami mae, i webaptisi kawasa tau kong Yesusi tato. Mae na a we Yesusi tendau na yana pa, rorapai dererai. <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />Mae Allai Duainunung Mamarang perari aya mandung pei wiama meoi na waradara wadi. Interi yondapui pei wiana rorapai doyo, “Neu Kumaipa Au, Au anewo Au. Kong Au aneurarong wieng we Au.”<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi ne Mandarong pina</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 1:1-17)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Na a retenang we Yesusi meriwapai, tintatuata mamo ne pudape piarea ura. Parari nyontarai etingtatuata wei, mamo tamani di Yusupi. Yusupi tamanidino Eli, <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Eli tamani di Matati, Matati tamani di Lewi, Lewi tamani di Marki, Marki tamani di Yanai, <verse eid="LUK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Yanai tamani di Yusupi, Yusupi tamani di Matatiasi, Matatiasi tamani di Amosi, Amosi tamani di Nahumi, Nahumi tamani di Esiri, Esiri tamani di Nagai, <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />Nagai tamani di Mati, Mati tamani di Matatiasi, Matatiasi tamani di Semei, Semei tamani di Yoseki, Yoseki tamani di Yodai, <verse eid="LUK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Yodai tamani di Yoanani, Yoanani tamani di Resai, Resai tamani di Zerubabeli, Zerubabeli tamani di Sealieri, Sealieri tamani di Neri, <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />Neri tamani di Marki, Marki tamani di Adi, Adi tamani di Kosami, Kosami tamani di Ermadani, Ermadami tamani di Eri, <verse eid="LUK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Eri tamani di Yosuai, Yosuai tamani di Erieseri, Erieseri tamani di Yorami, Yorami tamani di Matati, Matati tamani di Lewi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Lewi tamani di Simoni, Simoni tamani di Yehudai, Yehudai tamani di Yusupi, Yusupi tamani di Yonami, Yonami tamani di Eriakimi, <verse eid="LUK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Eriakimi tamani di Mereai, Mereai tamani di Matatai, Matatai tamani di Natani, Natani tamani di Dauti, <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />Dauti tamani di Yesi, Yesi tamani di Obeti, Obeti tamani di Boasi, Boasi tamani di Salmoni, Salmoni tamani di Nahasoni, <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Nahasoni tamani di Aminadapi, Aminadapi tamani di Admini, Admini tamanidi Arni, Arni tamanidi Eseroni, Eseroni tamani di Peresi, Peresi tamani di Yehudai, <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Yehudai tamani di Yakupi, Yakupi tamani di Isaki, Isaki tamani di Abrahami, Abrahami tamani di Terai, Terai tamani di Nahori, <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Nahori tamani di Seruki, Seruki tamani di Rehui, Rehui tamani di Perehi, Perehi tamani di Eberi, Eberi tamani di Serahi, <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Serahi tamani di Kenani, Kenani tamani di Afahati, Afahati tamani di Semi, Semi tamani di Noaki, Noaki tamani di Lameki, <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Lameki tamani di Metusaraki, Metusaraki tamani di Henoki, Henoki tamani di Yereti, Yereti tamani di Mahalaleri, Mahalaleri tamani di Kenani, <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Kenani tamani di Enosi, Enosi tamani di Seti, Seti tamani Adami, Adami tamani di Sen Allai.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s">Nyombatang aneangkari' Yesusi</para>
  <para style="r">(Mat 4:1-22; Mrk 1:12-13)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Na awe Yesusi teweri warui maria Yordani, Sen Allai ne Duainunung Mamarang yumaoi tantenang. Mae Duainunung Mamarangpai kiori to raora we mapang pai. <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />Na yana Nyombatangpai aneangkari Yesusi we a pe piakodu. Na a yani I dampi katea wa, impaina wewi kia. <verse eid="LUK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Interi Nyombatang wadi kewio wei doyo, “Au wo Allai Antung diauto? Impaina bomi kaminei we roweang” <verse eid="LUK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Yesusi kewio doyo, “Na Weraung Mamarang wadi soi kamana doyo, ‘Nyontarai wau embeng na roweang pa meari wa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ulangan 8:3</char></note>’” <verse eid="LUK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Interi Nyombatang wadi kio Yesusi to raora wetedai pei, na yana na katangkawio Nyombatang wadi suba anyau mananu taubai we enai na nunei, raora enempa wei. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Nyombatang wadi kewio we Yesusi doyo, “Mananu taubai ene raora wau kong piwe enempa yona kai we Au, tutu taubai ninane etona we yau kong eyona we nyontarai pa matei ea we aneuweni pai. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Impaina Au womi we yau mamo, tau ninane ingkai yona we nemu.” <verse eid="LUK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Mana Yesusi kewio doyo, “Na Weraung Mamarang entoi kamana etoyo, ‘Auwo tuang weapi Sen Allai, mae mantauni auwo womiwei ki!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ulangan 6:13</char></note>’” <verse eid="LUK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Interi Nyombatang wadi kio Yesusi to Yerusalemi mae doni nyaina Allai ne Manu wadi wawuang mae kewio wei doyo, “Au Allai Antung di Au e? Pikara tuawa na nina toungna. <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />Wo entoikamana na Weraung Mamarang wadi tonina, ‘Allai ingkai demi ne mampang paya enduwawing Au na embaramipa na wemai,’ <verse eid="LUK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />mae ya ingkai enduwawing Au na embaramipa, imbaro aemupa ra diang tuba kami wau wa.’” <verse eid="LUK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Yesusi kewio doyo, “Na Weraung Mamarang soikamana tonina, ‘Remo anemuangkari Allai pe.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ulangan 6:16</char></note>” <verse eid="LUK 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Interi Nyombatang wadi aneangkari Yesusia kai na pipatotoi ea, i yutopui warui Yesusi mae demang we a' pea weiya.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi teweri to Galilea riuwa mariwa nempa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mat. 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mrk. 1:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Interi Yesusi teweri to Galilea, mae Allai Duainunung Mamarang yuma oi. Mae embuwua Yesusi na raora yani tantenang. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Na yana Yesusi denyau na nyontarai Yaudi ene manu esomi nai kong nyontarai paya engkai etaparandini.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyontarai we empau entampi Yesusi na Nasareti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat. 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mrk. 6:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Interi Yesusi riato Nasareti, raora we beba nai wadi. Na a sabati Yaudi pai, parari anemai pa, I riato manu nyontarai Yaudi esomi nai pai. I doa we deto Weraung Mamarang, <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />mae etong Weraung na Nabi Yesayai wei. Yepa weraung we esakoyari wadi, I dedu waya we entoi kamana tonina:<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />“Sen Duainunung Mamarang nyai kong Yau,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">wo I piana riuwa Yau we ewuwu arera weweng we nyontarai weengkiaripi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">I demi Yau we ewuwua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">we nyontarai we embana bui ingkai entapira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">mae yong panang we nyontarai endekabe imbaro endeoa naria ea,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">kong yong rang we nyontarai we esaseung.<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />Mae ewuwua a we Sen periri ne kawasa nea, piana ramaneto”.<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Interi Yesusi kiapa weraung wadi taweri, mae doni we weenkawio kamani dosaiwari pai, interi meyoi. Nyontarai tau we na manu Yaudi esomi nai wadi esayori kong entaraoi tutu kawio we sopana waupa. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Yesusi denyau ya mae doyo, “Rirang we nabi Yesayai sopana na pampompa interi mentaroa na a ninane piana yona maito.” <verse eid="LUK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Impaina nyontarai paya kuira esaneato Yesusi mae esaneaeraya tutu kawio we sopana pa weng, impaina etoyo, “I wo Yusupi ne kumai pina ma e?” <verse eid="LUK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Impaina kewio weya doyo, “Nina mamo miawo piana mentopang kawio metingtatuata we Yau tonina, ‘Dokteree! Amantarao bong panangpa we nyontarai peaya to, toyana mamo bong panang we mantau nentaraipai. Pitau we amantarao piwe boni tawa tantuma na bendari Kapernaumi pai, bona na nu mantau nemunei tato’”. <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Interi Yesusi kewio ea mae doyo, “Etopana we mia, tarai nabi pei andi endoaoi na nu nempai wa. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Impaina ekawio we mia, tutu kawio we etonapa nina mai. Na pampong yana na Eliai wiengpa mamo, mamang miunawa na nunei puda pe toru, yembai bowonang ma sisu piwawi baba miungkui raora Israeli pai. Na a yana wawing kabongpa madupei na Israeli. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Toyanapa tato, Sen Allai demi Eliai we Yaei mieari na yanawa. Mana demi ria wu wawing kabong pai na Sarfati na nu Sidoni pai. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Na a pampong Elisai wiengpa mamo nyontarai na Israeli madupei esuipado, mana Elisai dong koiri na ya dedu panangwa, mae Namani nyontarai Siria pai ki andi doni penang pa”. <verse eid="LUK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Nyontarai weempandura na manu esomi nai pai entarao Yesusi kawiopa mamo engkayouwi antumba. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Impaina entawa etoa mae etadawa Yesusi tori mae engkori wu wepampeng pei na nu bendari yani, we engkayai Yesusi na pampengpai. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Mana Yesusi ria na ene madu kuira ria warui ya.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi dong panang we nyontarai we piwiwiowi esapopari.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mrk. 1:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Interi Yesusi riato bendari Kapernaumia na raora Galilea, waro denyau na a sabati Yaudi pai. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Nyontarai paya esaneaera ya tutu kawio anyaupa, tutu kawiopa donung na paya. <verse eid="LUK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Na manu esomi nai pai nyontarai pei andi piwiwiowi esapopari, impaina iwo denana kangkuna. <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />Boe! Yesusi nyontarai Nasareti pa au, pitoi boni we ama na ninapa? Auwo ruama borandeni ama e? Yau wo ereu Au: Auwo Kumai Mamarang ruana na Allai ma pa.” <verse eid="LUK 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Mana Yesusi dedawa piwiwiowi pai doyo, “Aidinau motitori warui!” Impaina piwiwiowi warateta nyontaraipai awau wiata na ene madu kuira, interi metitori mae doni yui wa. <verse eid="LUK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Impaina nyontarai paya kuira esarokutuya, mae engkawio waweria weya etoyo, “Katu taraie! Kawiopa totoai tonina! Wo paya pa nainai paina, kewio dintadawa piwiwiowi paya ematitori.” <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Topiana kawio parari Yesusipa embuwua na raora yani tantenang.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi dong panang we nyontarai empau</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 8:14-17; Markusi 1:29-34)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Interi Yesusi ria warui manu esomi nai pai mae ria wu manu Simoni nempai ya, na yana Simoni neoni netarai kewawora kangkuna impaina etewara we Yesusi imbaro doni penang. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Impaina Yesusi ria doa rurang wawing wadi interi dedawa kawaworapai waruia, toyana uipai menaing warui. Wawingpai tewa kaparia ema wesarawiri ya. <verse eid="LUK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Piana wopai ria do diruto, nyontarai paya kuira engko nyontarai esui ui pampinoma paya wu Yesusi ma, interi riuwa warampa dupiya kaikoya dong ya empanang. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Semi-semi paya emati warui nyontarai we empau paya mae esayau etoyo, “Auwo Sen Allai Antung di Au.” Mana Yesusi kewio miarang ya kong yua ya doyo engkawio wa. Tutu ya endeo we andi wemampariripa.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi wiuwu Kawio Wewengpa we Yudea tantenang</para>
  <para style="r">(Markusi 1:35-39)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Piana raidato interi Yesusi ria wu nupei we menanopi. Mana nyontarai weempau esera Yesusi interi etaduti impaina eto etanangkai Yesusi imbaro reo ria warui ya pe. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Mana Yesusi kewio weya doyo, “Anyau Mamarang parari Allai riu we mananupa, ewuwua na bendari pea tato wo aidona mamo Allai demi Yauto nuneima pa.” <verse eid="LUK 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Na yana Yesusi kewio kakera Kawio Mamarang na manu esomina pa na nu Yudea.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesusi diri we etuaripa ya we retenang</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 4:18-22; Markusi 1:16-20)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />A peana Yesusi doa na kareng ruru na Genesareti, interi nyontarai we empau enduaidora ya we entarao Allai ne Arera pai. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Yesusi reo wa kodu wana kareng yani, we emumpi wauya piana embia warui wa wau to mae enai endoipi ene erangpa. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Yesusi wieita wu wawau ei, Simoni wa nempai, mae demi imbaromi sui wa wadi woroi katea warui kareng wau. Interi I meoi mae denyau nyontarai we empau paya.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Interi I denyaua kai, kewio we Simoni doyo, “Wo wu wekaria wane, interi muna erangpai we topu diang.”<verse eid="LUK 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Simoni doyo, “Kuruie! Piana diru karapai amamariwa taweriwa mana amatadu piewa, mana Yai bomi ama paina ingkai yau emuna erang nei naria ea.” <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Mae interi ya etongpararia mamo ya entapu diang pitaubai, donane erangpai wateabu. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Interi ya engkamang we weempandu ya na wa ea wauya, imbaro ya endama empata ya. Mae ya endama paina, empandura esoni diang to wa kodu wau ra kikeu awira. <verse eid="LUK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Inte Simon Petrusi reopa, suang na Yesusi renawau mae doyo, “Sen rua warui yau, tutu yau wo nyontarai wesasari.”<verse eid="LUK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Tutu i kong nyontarai tau we empandura kongti embekaeng tutu pitaubai diang we entapu pa. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Zebedeusi ne kumai Yakobusi kong Yoanesi, we urarua Simoni urongbekaeng tato. Yesusi kewio we Simoni doyo, “'Remo motaipe, na aneito au ingkai yonau mung erang we topu nyontarai.”<verse eid="LUK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Mae interi ya entui wa wau torei, ya tato empika pitaubai enempa mae etua Yesusi.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi dong panang we nyontarai we yui pado</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat. 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mrk. 1:40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Na a peana Yesusi nyai na bendari pei rarong, na yana nyontarai muang pei netarai donung na ui pado. Inte reo Yesusi, suang yomi wei na renawau mae dewara konti doyo, “Tuane muaya mamo, bong yau epanang.”<verse eid="LUK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Interi Yesusi suwa warang waua riu nyontarai nei inte doyo, “Yau emaya, ingkai ponang.” Na peina to ui pado nyai warui. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Yesusi yua we nyontarai wadi, remo wuwua we eaya pe, interi doyo, “Ruanto, bonyau au we imami pai, inte bong pikika we ponang pa, pikika parari we Musai woretuwarapa. Pikika ninane we kamang weya tutu ponangto.”<verse eid="LUK 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Mana Yesusi ne arera pa muna woroi, impaina dakami tau enda wurima imbaro entaraoi, ma dong panang na ene uipa. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Interi Ria wu nu we mananopi, imbaro tendau.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyontarai piaya we penang</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 9:1-8; Markusi 2:1-12)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Na a peana na Yesusi denyau, nyontarai embe Farisi pitau kong kuru akama Yaudi wau ya emayoi entaraoi. Enda na awa na nu Galilea, na nu Yudea kong na bendari Yerusalemi. Sen ne paya deruari impaina, dong we esui empanang. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Interi nyontarai peaya, engko nyontarai wepiaya na piwe denanaipai, esera imbaro engkori esua etoni wiana Yesusi renapa. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Mana engkori esua wa tutu kawasa tau, impaina engkori embeita na tei wadi wu manu wawongpei.<figure style="fig" alt="orang lumpuh yang dibawah dan membokar atap rumah untuk Yesus sembuhkan dia" file="WA03824b.tif" size="col" ref="5.19">Nyontarai we piaya engkoria esepa randaung we Yesus doni penang</figure></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:19">Interi esepa randaung pei, interi empiri na piwe denanapai, na nyontarai pitau enerabuang randana tate Yesusi renapa. <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Mana Yesusi reo piwe etona wau impaina Yesusi rebau endoaoa wau, mae riuwara wei doyo, “Manetai ye! Nemu sasaripa piana epariri to.” <verse eid="LUK 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Mana nyontarai kuru akama Yaudi, kong nyontarai embe Farisi esanetatuata na esanerarong etoyo, “Nyontarai mateidi kengkani Allai nini ne? Mateidi ne paya we periri sasari warui Sen mantauni ne?”<verse eid="LUK 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Mana piana Yesusi aneao piwe esanetatuata, inte kewio wu yara doyo, “Pitoai mesanetatuata na mesanerarongpa?. <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Totoi mawapa joyo, ‘Nemu sasaripa eparirito,’ ete joyo, ‘Towa ruwa andaung buenanaipai mae rua!’ <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Mana imbaro mendeoa na nunei, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kumai Nyontarai mamo Wang we Yesusi mantauni parari Daniel 7:13-14</char></note>Kumai Nyontarai nei, ne paya we dingperiri sasari.” Impaina Yesusi kewio we nyontarai piaya wadi doyo, “Towato! Ruwa piwe buenanapa, mae toweri wu manu nemupai.”<verse eid="LUK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Na yanapa, nyontarainei tewa na dakami endenawau, interi riuwa piwe denana mae ria wu ne manu wanea mae deparanding Allai.<verse eid="LUK 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Nyontarai tau kuira esarokutuya, interi etaparanding Allai. Kong emataikangkuna mae etoyo, “A nini amandeo pitaubai we dona amasarokutuya.”<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lewi we yau pe we mananu Kaisari dua Yesusi</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 9:9-13; Markusi 2:13-17)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Topiyana Yesusi meti ria warui nu yani mae reo nyontarai pei, nyontarai weyau wiwai we Mananu Kaisari anong pei Lewi, meyoi na manu weyau wiwai nai pai. Yesusi kewio wuria doyo, “Bua Yau.” <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Toyana Lewi tewa doa ria warui pitaupai, interi duari.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Interi Lewi dong anani baba we Yesusi na ne manu wadi. Nyontarai tau we esau wiwai kong we enda kontama empandura etampi kuira kongti. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Nyontarai embe Farisi engkong kuru akama Yaudi etatuwaya we Yesusi ne manarua wauya etoyo, “Pitoi di metampi metunung kong nyontarai esau wiwai kong nyontarai we embesasaripa.”<verse eid="LUK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Interi Yesusi riuwara weya doyo, “Topino nyontarai we esuiwa, eserai we dosa empanangwa mae nyontarai we esui yati esera we dosa empanang. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Era manina era eyau nyontarai we emai wa, mae nyontarai wesasari imbaromi esane taweri warui ene sasaripa.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi ne anyau we tampo we tatampiwa</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 9:14-17; Markusi 2:18-22)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Nyontarai embe Farisi etutang naria wu Yesusi etoyo, “Nyontarai we etua Yoanisi, ea mamo etampiwa kong esomi mantaung, topiana tato we weetua nyontarai Farisi paya, mae we nemu manarua paya etampi kong etunung.”<verse eid="LUK 5:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Yesusi riuwara weya na sosiau wadi doyo, “Mia wo metami dakami etampiwa na munara didau wadi, mae muang we ne munara didau wadi nyai konta e? Toyana wa! <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Mana ingkai a wane rama we ne munara nei engkori warui ya, na yana mamo interi etampi wa.”<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />I sopang nari sosiau pei ea wu yara doyo, “Nyontarai pei wa, we pioabu asung awarung na asung waworu we dingkapioi na asung tawanei. Toyana mamo, asung we waworunei teabu, kong meiwa na asung we tewanei. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Topiyana tato, nyontarai pei yoni angguri waworu wu kaketa we tewa wadi, wo ingkai toyana mamo angguri waworu wadi ingkai yai ma dona kaketa wadi teabu, kong angguri wadi tewowu mae kaketa wadi tekakutu. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Mana angguri we waworu wau wo etoni wiata na kaketa sapi rerawa waworu pino. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Ma nyontarai pei wa, we dunung angguri tawa, kong ane we dunung angguri we waworu, wo ingkai doyo, ‘Angguri tawa pai wieng raweina.’”<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s">Autang parari a we nyontarai Yaudi endupi wa.</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 12:1-8; Markusi 2:23-28)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Na a we nyontarai Yaudi endupiwa, Yesusi kong ne manarua wauya enda na romi pasibu pei. Interi ne manarua wauya etetang pasibu bongbau enkiarai na embarami interi etang tarai wau. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Mana nyontarai embe Farisi peaya etoyo, “Pitoi dona metorobang arera na kamang akama taneng wadi, mae metong piwe esuara na a sabati Yaudi endupi wa nai pai?” <verse eid="LUK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Yesusi doyo, “Miawo metato piwe Dauti dona na pampongpa to, i kong we etuaripa ya embawi paina, <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />i yua na Sen ne Manu Tenda Mamarang wadi rarong, interi kio roti we etona we pikika we Allai mae dang. Interi dong roti pea tato wu ne weetuari wauya we etang. Mana na kamang akama we tata pai, imami ya pino etang roti wawaupe.” <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Interi Yesusi kewio naria doyo, “Kumai Nyontarai nei, ne paya we kiutu pitoai etona na a we Yaudi endupiwanai pai!”<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi dong panang we nyontarai we warado watang penanang</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 12:9-14; Markusi 3:1-6)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Na a we nyontarai Yaudi endupiwa nai pei ea, Yesusi ria denyau na manu esomi nai. Na yana nyontarai we waradowatang penanang pei. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Kuru akama Yaudi paya engkong nyontarai embe Farisi peaya emparama Yesusi pampang, imbaro dong nyontarai pea empanang na a sabati Yaudi pai mamo, etona etimburi we dong sara pi. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Mana Yesusi aneao esanetatuata wau. Impaina kewio we nyontarai we waradowatang penanang wadi doyo, “Towa ruama boana rabuangne!” Impaina nyontarai wadi tewa doa. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Interi Yesusi kewio weya doyo, “Impaina Yutang mia, parari piwe na kamang akamapai mamo, pitoai tatona na a sabati Yahudi pai pa? Tatong wemai ete tatong amuna e? Tampata nyontarai waro embeng ete tatamei ya e?” <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Yesusi rewawaria weya engkai, inte kewio wu nyontarai wadia doyo, “Tuwa waramupai ma.” Nyontarai wadi suwa warang wadia, impaina na tantuma warang wadi penang. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Mana kuru akama wauya engkayoua emati mae, engkawio tatuata we pitoai ingkai etona we Yesusi pa.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi diri ne nyontarai uraya kodu etuari wauya</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 10:1-4; Markusi 3:13-19)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Na a yani Yesusi wieita na wi rewowai wau ei we tendau. Na yana I tendau we Allai na diru tantenang. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Do deidea mamo, Yesusi yau ne manarua wau yama, interi diri esuraya kodu na ya, yatino Yesusi yau ya werasuripa. Ya mamo esanomi pei: <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Simoni we Yesusi yawi we Petrusi, Andariasi neta baba Simoni, Yakobusi, Yoanisi, Pilipusi, kong Bartolomiusi, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Matiusi, Tomasi, Alpeusi ne kumai Yakobusi, kong Simoni (Nyontarai we demuna we Israel wau entori warui Roma wauya), <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />Yakobusi ne kumai Yudasi kong Yudasi Iskarioti we ingkai wio Yesusipa.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi denyau kong dong panang we nyontarai</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 4:23-25)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Interi Yesusi wiana wi rewowai wadi kong ne manarua wauya, embiama etoa na we tabora wau. Na yana tato kawasa tau weetuari wauya, etong pau tato enda na raora Yudea tantenang, na Yerusalemi, na bendari Tirusi kong na Sidoni weketua we kareng wau. <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />Endama eto entarao Yesusi, imbaro Yesusi dong ya empanang warui ui we na yapa. We semi-semi yepopa ya wauya endama tato, Yesusi dong semi-semi sa emanaing warui ya. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Nyontarai we empau endama embawo waweria we etakatui Yesusi, wo paya peai mati warui Yesusi netarai wadi, we dona engkai empanang.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">We etadu we mai kong we etadu manaing pa</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 5:1-12)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Interi Yesusi reoa we ne manarua wauya mae kewio doyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">Nyontarai mene piea wa mia metadu wemaipa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">tutu mia mamo Allai ne nyontarai di mia! <figure style="fig" alt="Yesus duduk mengajar" file="WA03829b.tif" size="col" ref="6.20">Yesusi meoi denyau</figure><verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />We na nina tato membawi pa mia metadu wemai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">mia ingkai memoi waweria!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">We mesai pa mia, metadu wemai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">wo mia ingkai memari!<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />Tutu metua Kumai Nyontarai ne dona mamo nyontarai entatipa mia, etampi mia, engkangkani mia kong entopang kawio maiwa we mia, metadu wemai! <verse eid="LUK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Nabi paya na pampompa tato etadu pi toyanapa. Impaina nyontarai etong mia toyana mamo memararising, wo ingkai metadu wiwai baba na rora-marising.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />Mana mia we mene ra pa memanaing,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">wo metadu mararising na nunei tato, impaina awe rama wane ingkai metadu mararisingwa.<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Mia we memoi na nina pa memanaing tato,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">wo mia ingkai membawi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Mia wememaripa memanaing tato,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">wo mia ingkai mesanerarong papea kong mesai!<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />Mia we nyontarai etaparanding mia pa memanaing tato, wo na pampongpa konta ene mandarong paya etaparanding nabi taraiwa ea toyana.”<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mesanewiwu we embateta we mia paya</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 5:38-48)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />Mana we mentarao Yau na nina ne mia, etopana we mia joyo, “Mesaneo mene marowa wanea, mae metong piboki wu nyontarai esaneung miawa. <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />Metong muang we nyontarai ekangkani mia paya, kong matandau we nyontarai etosaepi we mia paya. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Parari nyontaraipei biapa tarandei dowatang pai mamo, poweriaua biapa tarandei dowiri pai ea. Parari dewa nemu asung pampang pai mamo, bong nemu asung ea pa konta. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Nyontarai pei dutang we piea we au pa mamo, bona wei. Mae nyontarai pei dewa pi nemupa mamo, remo butana we dona taweri we au eampe. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Menari piboki we nyontarai peaya, parari mia mesane we nyontaraipea enari we mia pa.<verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />Parari mesanewiwu we nyontarai we esanewiwu we mia pa mamo, mendeo mesanesara we Allai ingkai myuang mia pe, wo nyontarai embe sasari paya kong esanewiwu nyontarai esanewiwu yapa tato. <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Mae parari metong piboki wu nyontarai etong piboki we mia pa mamo, mendeo mesanesara we Allai ingkai myuang mia pe, wo nyontarai embesasari paya kong etong toyana pa! <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Mae parari metong nyaki pe we nyontarai mesanesa ya we ingkai etona taweri nariaea mamo, mendeo mesanesara we Allai ingkai myuang mia pe. Nyontarai embe sasari pa kong etong nyaki pe we nyontarai embe sasaripa, interi etona taweri naria ea! <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Mana toyana wa! Mia tato mesanewiwu we nyontarai embemarowa we miapa mae metong piboki we ya. Metong nyaki pe weya, mae mendeo mesane we metaduta naria ea pe. Parari toyana mamo, metadu awaweri baba mae mia ingkai mesau Allai we Tedaipai we mene Yai. Wo Allai wadi anerarong wepiboki wu nyontarai enduinariawa we etong piboki, kong wu nyontarai etong pi maiwa ya. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Impaina mesanewiwu we nyontarai, parari mene Yai na rora ne anewiwu nyontaraipa!”<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Remo bimbu nyontarai pe</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 7:1-5)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />Remo bimbu nyontarai pe, imbaro mia tato Allai dimbu mia wa. Remo mambabati nyontarai ea ya pe, imbaro mia tato Allai dong mambabati we mia wa. Metupirandeni nyontarai ea ya imbaro Allai tato dupirandeni mia. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Metong pi pinoma we nyontarai ea ya, imbaro Allai dona pinoma we mia. Pi donapa wawokobu parari inang we entawani na rotang ra biatang pira. Parari we mentatuata we eaya, ingkai Allai dona taweri dintatuata we mia tato.<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Interi Yesusi sopana weya na sosiau nini doyo, “Wawo nyontarai endekabe wauya eting endekabe wauya e? Toyana mamo ingkai asaru kuira untawa aya kambireipei. <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Kumaipei tedai warui ne kurupai wa. Mana kumaio dedu aniau na we mai ria ne kurupai ingkai perari kurui nempai.<verse eid="LUK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />Pitoai mendeo aikeang na nemeta nempai rekamipai, mana airape na rengkami mantaung menempa mendeoa wa? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Topino mia mentopana we meneta menempa ya metoyo, ‘Netapa au ruama ekiapi aikeangpai warui rengkami nemu pai,’ mana airape na rengkami menengpa mendeoiwa? Nyontarai metong sambamboni ne mia! Mengkiapi airape nyai na mendekami pa pampong wo, imbaro mendeoa na wemai aikeang na menetapa endekamipa kong mengkiapira.”<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ai kong ne bongpai</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 12:33-35)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />Ai we piboki pai ne bongpai wieng, toyana tato ai bo moyawa pai ne bongpa moyawa tato. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Aipai rearoani na ne bongpa. Wo papea pai piana webong ara wa, kong nanipung papea pa piana webong angguri wa. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Nyontaraine tatawo tantoa peina. Nyontarai we meipai ingkai nyari piwe mai wo anerarong pai mei. Mana nyontarai we mioyawa ingkai nyari piwe moyawa, wo anerarongpai mioyawa. Tutu we mati na worengpai ra na anerarongpai.<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sosiau parari nyontarai kodu we unari manu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 7: 24-27)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />“Pitoi mesau Yau pampang we mene Seni, mana piwe entopana we miapa metong pararia wa? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Nyontaraipa we riama tarao neu anyaupa kong dong pararia na mai pai mamo, i perari sosiau nini pai. <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />I perari nyontarai we na a we nyari ne manupai mamo, yirai kambirei pa berarong, interi sau manu amangpai na kami. Impaina na a we poa dutu kio manupai, manu medidouwa wo piana sau manupai amangpai na kami. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Mana nyontarai we tarao neu anyaupa kong dong pararia wa, i perari nyontarai wenyari ne manu pai wiata na kakopa wawongpa tato. Impaina poapai riama teterapi manu pai, ingkai manupai metota kangkuna!”<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s">Yesusi dong panang we Yewoi pei ne woming na Kapernaumi.</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 8:5-13; Yohanesi 4:46-53)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Ra sisu Yesusi kewioa kai na kawasa tau endenawau, yua wu Kapernaumi. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Na yana nyontarai yewoi Roma pei ne woming pai we aneoi mantaung, yui era kikeu we keda. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Toyana yewoinei tarao Yesusi paina, demi nyontarai masa Yaudi peaya enda wuria. Etewara imbaro riama dong panang we ne woming wadi. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Enda wu Yesusia, mae etewara kangkuna we dongpata ya, etoyo, “Yewoi nei mei, impaina wento anemoi. <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />Tutu i wo aneo Yahudi ne ama, wo piana piwarang nyari tane manu tasomi nai pa.” <verse eid="LUK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Interi Yesusi ria kong ya enda engkikeu yewoi nei ne manu pai, yewoi nei demi neta neya imbaro entopana wei etoyo, “Tuane remo woseungpe, wo yau emaiwa we ruama wua na neu manunei. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Wo mantau neu wemai peawa we era wu Au ma. Impaina topang kawio katea, mamo neu woming nei penang. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Wo na yau tato etuang we mananu baba mae na warau wawa rai pe yati wane etong tuang we mananu we yaunei. Ingkai ekawio wu rai pei joyo, ‘Rua!’ Wo I ria; mae ingkai etopana we eaya weiya joyo, ‘Ruama!’ I tato riama. Mae ingkai etopang we warau wawa pai joyo, ‘Bong pinini!’ Mamo ingkai dona.” <verse eid="LUK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Yesusi arokutuya tarao Yewoi nei kewio wau, interi dedaiweri wu kawasa tau we etuari wauya, riuwara doyo, “Etopana we mia, sanesara we baba nina yeduta na ea wa, kong na nyontarai Israeli ya tato!.”<verse eid="LUK 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Interi nyontarai wedemi yapa ya entaweri wu ne manu paia, etadu woming wadi piana penang to.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi dong aimiomangpei tewa na Naini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Interi Yesusi ria wu bendari we anong pei Naini. Ne manarua enda kuira konti kong kawasa tau. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Topiana ria kikeu aturarei bendari wadi mamo, nyontarai we keda engkori emati, aimiomang koiri i memeari, inyani we ina, kong nyontarai tau na bendari nei enda etua inanei.<verse eid="LUK 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Ma topiana Sen reo inanei, aneng dutani ma aneoi era, interi kewio awaru doyo, “Remo waipe.” <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Interi ria kikeu kubirinei, dongtui kubirinei, ma wewe enduti wau etoa weta. Inte kewio we aimiomang nei doyo, “Yo towa.” <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Interi aimiomang nei tewa meoi kewio, inte Yesusi doni wu nyania.<verse eid="LUK 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Kawasa pitau ematai esomi Allai etoyo, “Nyontarai nabi baba, Allai ne nabi piana riama nyai na tane pandura nei. Mae Allai piana periri tata we ne nyontarai!”<verse eid="LUK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Interi emwuwu arera we Yesusi na raora Yudea, ra sisu nunei tantenang.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi kong Yoanis Pembaptisi</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 11:2-19)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Na awe Yoanis Pembaptisi dedu arera parari pitau we Yesusi dona tawa tantuma na weetuari wauya, <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />i yau ne manaura umbe kodu na ya, interi demi asaru urutang wu Seni uroyo, “Au mamo Mananu weperiri ingkai ruamapane ete ingkai amatamang nyontaraipei weiya e?” <verse eid="LUK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Impaina nyontarai ne asaru unda sisu Yesusi, ungkawio uroyo, “Yoanis Pembaptisi demi andu urutang we Au, Au ingkai ruamapane ete ingkai amatamang nyontaraipei weiya e?” <verse eid="LUK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Na a wawau Yesusi dong nyontarai madupei empanang na ene ui wepau pa kong dedawa semi-semi mae I dong nyontarai tau we endepipu endena ea. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Inte Yesusi riuwara we asaru doyo, “Mundara muntopana we Yoanis Pembaptisi, pitoai mundeoa kong muntaraoa nina: Nyontarai endepipu endenaria ea, nyontarai empaya etoa enda, nyontarai esui pado empanang, we emparo entaraoa, nyontarai we engkada esuwi, mae nyontarai enepie wa, embuwu Arera Weweng na Senpai weya. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Mae piboki we nyontarai weesaneriru wa we Yau kong we entampi Yau wa. <verse eid="LUK 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Toyana Yoanisi Pembaptisi ne nyontarai we demi asaru wau, untaweri mamo Yesusi kewio we kawasa taupai parari Yoanisi Pembaptisi. Doyo, “Pitoi donane menda wu we mapang<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Raora wekekawiri we woroi, wero maria kong nyontarai pea enai naiwa.</char></note> wane ampa? Mendeo atodidowi we wanang yowaweri towana tonina e? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Ete menda mendeo pio? Mendeo nyontarai we yesung asung remimoma e? Wereria, nyontarai we yesung asung weweng mae nepi, i mamo nu nempei manu mananu baba. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Impaina pitoi dona mamo mendampa? Mendeo nabipei e? Tarai, mana' etopana we mia, nyontarai we menda mendeoi pai, i beba raweina warui Nabi wauya. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Tutu Yoanisi Pembaptisi nini andi Allai kewio parari na Weraung Mamarangpai. Weraung Mamarang wadi riotu topinina,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">‘Mendema, Yau yemi i pempong Au,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:27">i ingkai nyari nemu rang wadi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maleaki 3:1 </char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Etopana we mia joyo, na nyontarai we wawing wauya etawingya na nunei, ei beba raweingna warui Yoanisi Pembaptisi wa. Mana katu we meia raweina na Allai ne maring wane rarong andi beba raweing Yoanisi Pembaptisi pa. <verse eid="LUK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Nyontarai tau kong we esau wiwai paya entarao piwe Yesusi sopana wau. Nyontarai nisati piana endoao Allai wo wepitarai, impaina Yoanisi Pembaptisi piana webaptisi ya. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Mana nyontarai embe Farisi kong kuru akama Yaudi paya emba piwe Allai daoa we ea wau, tutu emaidai Yoanisi Pembaptisi webaptisi yapa. <verse eid="LUK 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Yesusi kewio naria ea doyo, “Na pitoi yoni yintatua nyontarai na a nina ne? Ya emparari pitoi pa? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Ya wo emparari kumai we emayoi na manu awayang, madupei esau waweria weya etoyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">amandora pindotu amandoi rarung mararising we mia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">mana memaidai memayai pe!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">Amandoi rarung wekada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">mana mesai wa!<verse eid="LUK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Yoanisi Pembaptisi riamapa, apea mamo I dampi wa kong dunung angguri wa, mamo metoyo I semi-semi esapopari! <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Kumai Nyontarai riama, I dampi dunung, mamo mia metoyo, ‘Mendeo nyontarai wanei! I dampibarui, meeru, pendura kong we esau wiwai kong nyontarai we embesasari. <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Mana Allai ne wemai pa dea na wepitarai na nyontarai tau we endoaoi paya.”<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi na Simoni ne manu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Nyontarai embe Farisi we ano Simoni, dewa Yesusi dampi konti. Yesusi ria to manu nyontarai nembadi interi meoi dampi. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Na bendari yani pai tato nyontarai wawing we ne sasari pei. Na awe taraoa Yesusi dampi na nyontarai embe Farisi ne manu wadi, i ria wu Yesusi ma, kong kio botori pualami pei donung na maning weairowu. <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />Doana Yesusi karupui kikeu aeng wau mae yai pampang, rekaru wau tawa na Yesusi aeng wau. Interi kiapi Yesusi aeng wau na duangdau wau mae wopeoa kong yeraru na maning weyeirowu wadi. <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Impaina nyontarai embe Farisi we dewa Yesusi wadi reo we towawau. Kewio na anerarong doyo, “Parari nyontarai nini nabi dina keto, reo mateidi wawing nini we dongtuiri kong reo wawing wawadi wieng na sasari rarong!” <verse eid="LUK 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Interi Yesusi kewio we Simoni doyo, “Simoni, pieai yo yaoa we au.” Impaina Simoni doyo, “Yai Kurue! Topana ki.” <verse eid="LUK 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Yesusi doyo, “Nyontarai pe kodu umbenyaki we nyontarai we piata asaru na pe pea. Ei wenyaki pe piaura we kodu ea piaring (500), ei ea ne nyaki pe piakodu ea ura (50). <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Asaru kuira umbaita kai wa une nyaki wau, tutu wenepe wadi dupi randenia. Impaina na nyontarai wau asaru, mateidi aneo raweina nyontarai we piata na pe wadi pa?” <verse eid="LUK 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Simoni doyo, “Yorato nyontarai we ne nyaki pau raweina kong biai baruira wai!” Yesusi doyo, “tarai! We anemuaopa toapeina.” <verse eid="LUK 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Inte Yesusi reo wawing wadi mae kewio wu Simonia doyo, “Remo wawingnei e? Erawu manu nemunei ma, bong maria pea bindoi aeune wa, mana wawing nini piana dupi aeune na rekaru wau, kong kiapira na duangdaungwau. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Au bomang wompemo yauwa, mana wawing nini wopeo aeune taweriwa na katepe ma sisu nina. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Au wi maning na dukaminei wa, mana wawing nini piana wiowu maning we yeirowu na aeune. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Tarai! Dosaiwara baba yana denyawa topino ne sasari we paupa piana Allai dupirandenito! Impaina nyontarai we dupirandeni katea, i ingkai dosaiwara katea tato.” <verse eid="LUK 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Interi Yesusi kewio wu wawing wadi doyo, “Nemu sasaripa piana yupirandenia.” <verse eid="LUK 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Nyontarai we emayoi etampi kong Yesusi wauya engkawio na esanerarong etoyo, “Mateidi nyontarai nini, wo dupirandeni sasari wau?” <verse eid="LUK 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Impaina Yesusi kewio wu wawing wadia doyo, “Au roao Yau, impaina bodu paririto. Toweri na wemai.”<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s">Wawing we endupata Yesusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Woroi wami mae, inte Yesusi ria wari bendari wu bendari pa, na awapei wu awapei ya, imbaro wiuwu Sen ne kawio marising we Sen Allai riu we Mananu. Ne nyontarai esura ea kodu enda konti. <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />Kong wawing peaya, we dosa empanang na ene uipa kong semi-semi. Parari Mariai wawing Magdala we Yesusi dedawa semi-semi boitu warui. <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Yohanai awani Khusai we riupi we Herodesi, Susanai kong wawing peaya ea. Wawing nisa ya endupata Yesusi ne marandang nei na piwe enempa.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sosiau parari nyontarai we riayang pikami</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 13:1-23; Markusi 4:1-20)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Na awe kawasa enda pampang wu Yesusi ma na bendari wau, empandura kong Yesusi, inte sopang sosiau pei ma doyo, <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />“We dong romi pei ria riayang ne pikamipa. Ne eai tawa rurang rangnei impaina nyontarai entatara, kong aya etang nakai. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Eai tawa na kakopa we wekami, tawa mana mamaa, wo dedu maria peawa. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Pikami peai tawa na papea we aisasinai rarong, kamamai kuira mana kepang waweri paina kada. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Ma eai tawa na kakopa weweng, impaina kamamai mae we bong, bong pa mamo piaring raweina. Kewioa ra kai toapeina, interi Yesusi kewio doyo, “We tarangkambirei mamo taramoa.”<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Ne manarua wauya etutani, sosiau nei sopino. <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Interi Yesusi riuwara weya doyo, “Sen Mamarang dong mia metaoa piwe anyuing we Sen Allai riu we Mananupa. Mae we nyontarai peaya, pitau wawau tambuwua na sosiau, imbaro <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesus weroana na weraung Yesaya 6:9, daoa pangpongpa piana parariato</char></note>esayora mana endeoa wa, entaraoa mana esaneaoa wa. <verse eid="LUK 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />Sosiau nei soapei nina, pikami wadi mamo Allai ne Arera pina. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Pikami we tawa rurang rangpai mamo, nyontarai we piana entaraoa Allai ne Arera pa, interi Nyombatang wadi riama kio kawio pa, warui esanerarong, imbaromi endeo endoaoa pe kong etadu paririwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Pikami we tawa na kakopa we wekami mamo, nyontarai we entaraoa Allai ne Arera pai, engko na marising mana kawio wau wewoa na esanerarongba, endoaoa kateaki, na a we piea dauya mamo esutopui. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Pikami we tawa na papea aisasinai mamo, nyontarai we piana entarao kawio wau, mana esaneaeraya we embeng tutu esaneko piwe ene kong mararising na nunei. Tutu tau wawau kepang ya impaina etong bong weweng peawa. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Pikami we tawa na kakopa weweng, parari nyontarai we entarao Allai ne Arera pai, mae anekakepana na anerarong weweng ma we mai. Yati etong pararia sisu embawiong.”<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sosiau parari padamara</para>
  <para style="r">(Markusi 4:21-25)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />Nyontarai pei kiai padamara pei interi kewuni na babeu pei wa, tutu doni wiata na pata pei wawa wa. Mana ingkai dong padamara wadi yawa na rerawuani imbaro nyontarai esua endeoi dea wau. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Pitau we anyuing ingkai ra taparera kong we mawa wa ingkai tantaraoa ra dea kong tasayau wa. <verse eid="LUK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Toyana Neu anyau we mentaraoa mendetatuata aiwara, wo nyontarai we piana etadu anyaupa ya ingkai etaduta pau raweina ea. Mae nyontarai we emba anyaupa ya, maidau we wata ko yapa ingkai engko warui ya tato.<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi nyani kong neta mantaung muang paya</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 12:46-50; Markusi 3:31-35)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Yesusi nyani kong neta mantaung muang pa ya endawuri ma, mana etadutiwa wo kawasa empau kapara. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Interi nyontarai pei kewio wu Yesusi ma doyo, “Yaie, nyamui kong nemeta mantaungpa ya enai riri etoyo esane we etadu au.” <verse eid="LUK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Mana Yesusi kewio weya doyo, “Nyontarai weentarao Allai ne Allai ne Arera wau mae weetong pararia, yati neu inani kong neu neta mantaung.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi dong wanang dowara medori</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 8:23-27; Markusi 4:35-41)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />A peana Yesusi wieita to wa rarong kong ne manarua wauya, interi kewio weya doyo, “Mendama tantampira to ruru dowani.” Interi etapai. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Inte etapai mamo Yesusi dena, interi dowara wia tantuma wu ruru wadia. Impa mamo maria yua na wa rarong wadi mae wa etawira. <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Interi we etuari wauya endama embauni etoyo, “Kuruie, Kuruie tangkadarai!” Interi Yesusi tewa, piayao wanang kong tarowa we dauya wadi. Interi wanang kong tarowa umadori impaina ruru wadi medoria keda. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Interi Yesusi kewio weya Doyo, “Pitoi donane mendoao Yau wa pa?” Impaina ematai mae esarokutuya inte engkawio waweri weya etoyo, “Nyontarai pa matei sonini, wo wanang tutu tarowa untaraoi pa?”<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi dedawa semi-semi warui nyontarai Gerasa pei</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 8:28-34; Markusi 5:1-20)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Yesusi kong we etuari wauya etapai topong ra sisu raora Gerasa na ruru Galilea dowani. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Na a we Yesusi wia wu reireiya, nyontarai muang pei we semi-semi esua nai, ria wu Yesusi ma, i na bendari wadi. Piana manyonapei amakakawiri mae meidai nyai na manu wau, aneweng nyai na i' we na aisata wau. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28-29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28-29" />Semi-semi neya piana enai nai paina, nyontarai etawi warang aeng na wai asaneng, mana pio kakutu waiwau interi semi-semi wauya engkori wu we mapang kakawiri. Nyontarai nei reo Yesusi, interi suang yomi na Yesusi renawau impaina Yesusi dedawa semi-semi wauya warui. Impaina nyontarai nei doyo, “Yesusi, Allai we tedai mantaung Antung, ingkai bong nyau topino? Yewara remo bong nyau eyui kapara pe. <verse eid="LUK 8:28-29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Yesusi dutang wu nyontarai nei, “Anomu pe?” Nyontarai nei kewio doyo, “Anou pei, ‘Legioni,’” wo semi-semi empau esua nai. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Semi-semi wau ya etewara kangkuna, imbaro Yesusi reo dedawa ya wu pampeng we kada wa. <verse eid="LUK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Kikeu na raora wawau, tapui we eserai pi we etang na wi pei. Impaina semi-semi wauya, etewara kangkuna we Yesusi, imbaro Yesusi demi ya esua na tapui wauya. Interi Yesusi rioa oa. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Impaina semi-semi wauya emati warui nyontarai wadi esua na tapui wauya, interi tapui nea etapaiya esaro wu ruru wadi, impaina esarewa engkada.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />We embido tapui wauya endeo pi we toyana pa, impaina etapai interi embuwu kawio wawau na bendari wu awa na raora yana. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Interi nyontarai taupa ya emati, imbaro endeo pi yana. Enda wu Yesusi ma, na yana etadu nyontarai we semi-semi piana endawarui pai, yesuni ea meyoi kikeu Yesusi aeng wau. Piana nyontarai nei anetatuatapa weng eanto, impaina ematai. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Nyontarai we endeo pi wawau embuwua pi we dona mamo nyontarai nei penang. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Interi nyontarai na Gerasa wauya etewara kangkuna, imbaro Yesusi ria warui raora wawadi. Wo ematai kapara. Impaina Yesusi wieita na wa pai inte teweri. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Nyontarai we semi-semi endawarui dewara imbaro dua Yesusi, mana Yesusi demi ria, doyo, <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />“Toweri to! Mae wuwu pitau we Allai dona we aupa.” Interi nyontarai wadi ria wiuwu pitau we Yesusi dona wei na raora bendari yana tantenang.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi dong Yairusi ne kumai tewa mae dong wawing we yui penang.</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 9:18-26; Markusi 5:21-43)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Interi Yesusi teweri na ruru arawa dowani, nyontarai tau etanoni etamani na mararising. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Interi we anong Yairusi riawu Yesusi ma. I mamo wedung na manu Yaudi esomi nai pei. Impaina suang na Yesusi aeng wau, mae dewara konti imbaro Yesusi riawu ne manu wanei, <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />tutu ne kumai wawing nei, i mamo we memeari. Kumai nei tatua puda uraya kodu yuia kikeu keda. Na rang rarong wura to Yairusi ne manupai, nyontarai we pau esambui Yesusi mae embatitetari. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Na yana tato wawing peana we piana puda uraya kodu, yui dawing ria<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ui nini parari wawingbau eneta rababaeara.</char></note> mana dedu panang na ei eawa. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />I sara kikeu Yesusi na karupui, dontui Yesusi asung wopepa mamo, ui ria ne tato manaingpa. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Interi Yesusi doyo, “Matei dontui yaupa?” Mana ei we raupuiwa pa, mamo Petrusi doyo, “Kuruie nyontarai we empau esambura Au mae embatiteta Au.”<verse eid="LUK 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Mana Yesusi doyo, “Ea andi dontui Yau, tutu eruradiduing paya ea tori na neutarai nei.” <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Interi wawing wadi reoa topino piwe dona wau piana dea to. Paina riama mana didora, suang na Yesusi renawau. Inte sopana pararia wu nyontarai wempau endenawau, pitoi donane dekatui Yesusipa, mae ne ui wau panangna peina to.<verse eid="LUK 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Inte Yesusi kewio wuria doyo, “Neu kumai pau roao yau paina ponaang, ruana we piboki.”<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Topiana Yesusi kewio rai, mae nyontarai we etami na Yairusi ne manu pai, kewio wu Yairusi doyo, “Nemu karawingpai kedato, remo woseung Yai Kurui eampe.”<verse eid="LUK 8:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Mana Yesusi taraoa mamo, kewio we Yairusi doyo, “Remo motaipe anemusaraki, mae nemu karawing pai ingkai wiengki.”<verse eid="LUK 8:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Ra sisu Yairusi ne manu wadi, Yesusi doni yua konti wa wo mae Petrusi, Yoanesi, Yakobusi kong inyani, tamani ya ki. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Nyontarai engkai esai mae etaidu we kumai wadi, mana Yesusi doyo, “Mendeo mesaipe, i wo kedawa mae dena.” <verse eid="LUK 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Mana emari Yesusi tutu endeo we kumai wadi piana kedato. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Interi Yesusi riu kumai nei warang wau mae doyo, “Aiwawingpe, towa to.” <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Interi kumai nei ne aseng teweri naria ya, ainato tewara doa. Interi Yesusi demi ya etoni dampi. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Inyani tamani esarokutuya kia, mae Yesusi yuara doyo, “Mendeo membuwu kawio ninape.”<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesusi woretuwa nyontarai uraya kodu we etuari pa ya</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 10:5-15; Markusi 6:7-13)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Yesusi yau ne nyontarai ura ea kodu we etuari wauya ma, interi dong paya weya imbaro etintandawa semi-semi kong etong weesui empanang. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Interi demi ya enda etong weesui empanang mae emberoang parari Allai riu we mananu. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Yesusi kewio weya doyo, “Mengko piea na mene rang rarongpa wa, mengko aisoipe, kaketape, roweangpe, pe kong asung kodupe. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Na totoi ea etewa mia menai na manu yani, menai kio memati warui bendari yani. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Mae na nupa totoi entampi mia mamo, na a we memati warui bendari yani, mentatai wawu na mesaebampa imbaro we kamang weya“. <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />We etua Yesusi etonta, interi enda wu awa pea embuwu Kawio Mararising we rana Sen Allai, kong na paya etadutapa etong we esui empanang.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Herodesi kong Yesusi</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 14:1-12; Markusi 6:14-29)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Na awe Herodesi we mananu riu na maring Galilea, tarao pitau we Yesusi dona tawa tantuma wau, wekaeng wo ea yati etoyo, Yoanisi pembaptisi piana wieng naria ea. <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Nyontarai pea etoyo, nabi Eliai denyawi ea, ea yati etoyo, nyontarai pei na nabi pampongpa we suwi naria ea. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Herodesi doyo, “Woreutuwara paina Yoanisi raukanangpai entekutui to, mana nyontarai pa matei nini ea? Piana tarao kawio madu pei nai.” Toyana Herodesi yera pampang do imbaro reo Yesusi.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi dong nyontarai piaura we ura etampi</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 14:13-21; Markusi 6:30-44; Yohanesi 6:1-14)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Yesusi ne nyontarai uraya kodu entaweri ma entopana we Yesusi pitau we etonapa. Yesusi peraya interi enda kuira mameari wu raora kikeu pea na bendari Betsaida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Mana interi nyontarai tau entarao ya paina, endawu yara. Na wana Yesusi demasa, interi kewio wea topitotoi Sen Mamarang riu we mananu. Mae I tato dong we esui wauya empanang koya.<verse eid="LUK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Wo wadi ria do sawa kikeu to, interi Yesusi ne nyontarai esura ea kodu we enda konti wauya, engkawio wei mae etoyo, “Yaie, raora nini menanopi kapara. Impaina bomi nyontarai nea enda imbaro eserai roweang pea we etang, kong manu we etenana na raora we kikeu ninane to“. <verse eid="LUK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Mana Yesusi doyo, “Miati metongsa etampi pa!” Yesusi ne nyontarai urayakodu wauya etoyo, “Ama amane roweang peawa we amatong dakamitau nini dampi, amane rotipe boring tutu diang kodu. Ingkai amanda amambori roweangbe dakami tau nini e?” <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Muang meari wauya wo empiaura ea piaura we ring (5000). Yesusi demi ne manarua uraya kodu wau ya doyo, “Metami ya emayoi pandura takakutui, madu koiri mamo empiakodu ea ura.” <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Yesusi ne manarua uraea kodu wauya etong parari we Yesusi sopana wau. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Interi Yesusi riu roti bo ring wau, diang kodu wau arota rora peidi, deparanding Mamarang peidi. Sopang piboki we Mamarang peidi interi piobabau roti boring wau tutu diang kodu na warang wau. Interi dona wu ne manarua wauya etingbiwo nyontarai we piau wadi. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Dakamitau wadi dampi kuira mioiwaweria. Interi ne nyontarai uraea kodu we enda konti wauya etongkui roweyang we wata wau. Dedu bayai uraea kodu.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petrusi rioa we Yesusi</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 16:13-28; Markusi 8:27-9:1)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />A peana Yesusi we tendau mameari, nyontarai we etuari wauya enaikonti kikeu Yesusi dutang ya doyo, “We empau wane ya etoyo Yau wo matei di Yau?”<verse eid="LUK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />We etuari wau etoyo, “Ea entopana etoyo Yohanis pembaptisi. Ea ya tato etoyo Eliai, ea ya nariaea etoyo Nabi pampong peana ea andi wieng taweri“.<verse eid="LUK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Yesus dutang doyo, “Mae mia mamo metoyo matei di Yau?” Petrusi doyo, “Auwo mananu we periri Allai derekamana“.<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Interi Yesusi kewio kangkuna we weetuari wauya doyo, “Mendeo memberoang pi nina we matei eampe.”<verse eid="LUK 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi kewio na ne kaidawau</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Mat. 16:21-28</ref>; Mrk. 8:31--9:1)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Yesusi tato doyo, “Kumai Nyontarai <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kumai Nyontarai mamo wang we Yesusi mantauni pina, parari Daniel 7:13-14. </char></note> impaina yedu we moyawa. Mananu wauya mae we embedung we imami wauya sisu kuru akama Yaudi wauya I emuni, mana pira a pe toru ingkai tewa taweri.”<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Interi Yesusi kewio we kawasa weenai wauya doyo, “Nyontarai we eto etua Yaupa ya mamo, empika pitau we enempa mae mantau esado aitaba enempa anemai, mamo esane taweri we esaseung engkadapa wa mae etua Yau. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Tutu we eto etarara embengpa, ingkai embeng pa nai. Mae weetompinong weembempa we Yau ingkai embengki woroi-woroi. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Pitoi ingkai nemuipa, boyo nemu nunei kiai mana donane dumuainunung wadi nyai? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Meto memamaya tutu Yau mae anyau neu wau, Kumai Nyontarai ne Yau tato ingkai emamaya yao miana awe erama wane, tutu paya Yai nempa kong sisu paya mampang we emamarang! <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Mentarao topino na mia we na nina imbe ea yati engkada wami mae endeo Mamarang riu we mananu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi ne tarai dea ra wieria na wi pei</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 27:1-8; Markusi 9:2-8)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Yesusi denyau pitau wa waua kai wepira a pe boitu, kio Petrusi, Yoanisi, kong Yakobusi enda embeita kuira wu wi pei, inte Yesusi tendau na wana. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Yesusi tendau na yana, rekami weiyaea, asung we yesuna ra bua waweria. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Na tantuma nyontarai kodu, nabi Musai kong nabi Eliai ungkawio konti. <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />Unda na rora marising, umbaweria ungkawio kong Yesusi we ne kaida kikeuto na Yerusalemi. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Na a wawau Petrusi kong we empanduya itorena mana na tantuma entawa, endeo Yesusi dea kong nyontarai kodu uroa konti. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Na a we nyontarai ne asaru uro untaweri warui Yesusi pa, Petrusi kewio we Yesusi doyo, “Yai Kuruie, ninane weng we tata. Toyana mamo antonari yawa pe toru, koiri we Au, koiri we Musai, koiri we Eliai.” Petrusi kewio towawau aneaiwara ao pi we sopanapa wa. <verse eid="LUK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Toyana Petrusi kewio rai, mandipi wiama wido ya impaina ematai. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Interi na mandipi wadi rarong, entarao nyondaupui we kewio doyo, “Neu Kumai we yiri pina, mentaraoi.” <verse eid="LUK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Interi nyondaupui nei menaing, endeo Yesusi memeari. Yesusi ne nyontarai toru ne itoru aidin itoru na pitaupa, mana piwe endeoa yanapa embuwua we nyontarai pei wa kio Yesusi nyai kosa wa.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi dong panang we kumai we dedu semi-semi</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 17:14-21; Markusi 9:14-29)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Ayari wadi Yesusi kong weetuari wau itombetoru embia na wi wadi, mae kawasa we empau endawu Yesusi ma. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Muang koiri na kawasa we empau waya yau doyo, “Yai Kuruie, anemberia tutu remo neu kumai nei, i neu kumai koiri pina! <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Aoa semi-semi etoni paina, denanaboa mae netarai wadi tepapari mae worekowowuai. Semi-semi wau etameiri pampang mae emaidai endawaruipe. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Piana yewa we nemu manaura paya we etadawa semi-semi, mana ene paya pea wa.” <verse eid="LUK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Yesusi doyo, “Mia topitotoi pa! Tutu miawo nyontarai we metompampinong mia mae mendoaoa wa! Rasisu totoi Yau enai kong mia mae yemang aiwara we mia? Ko nemu kumaipai ma!” <verse eid="LUK 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Interi kumai wadi ria wu Yesusi, semi-semi wau engkai mae doni netarai wadi tepapari. Mana Yesusi miarang semi-semi wadi riatori paina kumai wadi penang. Interi Yesusi dong kumai wadi teweri wu tamania. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Dakami wauya esarokutuya endeo Allai ne paya we baba wau.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:43">Yesusi kewio nariaea parari ne kaida wau</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(Matiusi 17:22-23; Markusi 9:30-32)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Na awe dakami wadi ria wekaeng endeo piwe dona wau, Yesusi kewio we ne manarua wauya doyo, <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />“Mendekakepang aiwara mae mendeo memparandeng kawio neu ne pe: “Kumai Nyontarai ingkai empikari wu nyontarai we emamunapa embara rarong.” <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Mana we etuari wauya esane aiwarao we sopana wau wa. Tutu pitau wawau Allai denyuina wea imbaromi embekaenawa. Impaina yawo embarui we etutang werieao Yesusi, piwe sopana yana.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matei beba raweina</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 18:1-5; Markusi 9:33-37)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Yesusi ne weetuari pa ya engkayou waweria tutu mateidi beba raweina na ya pa. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Mana Yesusi rebau esanetatuatapa, impaina kio kumai antitui pei mae doni doa rurani. <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />Interi kewio we weetuaripaya doyo, “Nyontarai matei demang we kumai nini na wemai tutu anuopa mamo demang we Yau tato. Mae nyontarai we demang we Yau, demang tato we wedemi Yau pai. Impaina nyontarai we metoyo meia na miapa mamo ingkai andi beba raweina, na Sen renawaupa!”<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyontarai dua Yesusiwa dedawa semi-semi</para>
  <para style="r">(Markusi 9:38-40)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Yoanisi doyo, “Kuruie, amandeo nyontaraipei dedawa semi-semi na anomupa, interi amasua nyontarai wadi, wo i dua tata wa.” <verse eid="LUK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Yesusi kewio we Yoanisi doyo, “Mesuari wa, wo nyontaraipa matei biateta mia wapa, i dongtutu mia.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Awa pei na raora Samaria emaidai etamang we Yesusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Na awe ra kikeu we Yesusi wieita wu rora-marising pa, I mantauni kiutu we riato Yerusalemi, <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />impaina demi mampaing peaya empamponi. Ya enda, interi esua to awa pei na Samaria imbaro etong pitau we etonapa we Yesusi. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Mana nyontarai we na awa pai emaidai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.53 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nyontarai Samaria kong Yahudi embe marowa pampang. Kong nyontarai Samaria. </char></note> etamang we Yesusi, wo piana esaneaoa to tutu Yesusi ria taterapi Yerusalemi. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Impaina na a we Yesusi ne manarua wauya, Yakobusi kong Yoanisi, piana usaneao pi wawau to, impaina ungkawio we Yesusi uroyo, “Sen, bo muaya mamo, tatewa adia pei, wia na rora imbaro dang baboa nyontarai neya e?” <verse eid="LUK 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Yesusi dedaiweri interi miarang Yakobusi kong Yoanisi. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Interi enda wu awa pea naria.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyontarai we esane we etua Yesusi</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 8:19-22)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Impaina Yesusi kong ne weetuari enda pampang wu Yerusalemia, nyontarai pei kewio we Yesusi doyo, “Yai aneu we eyua Yai Au to nupa totoi ea.” <verse eid="LUK 9:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yesusi daoa wei doyo, “Serigala ne kambirei, mae aya embe ene karaini, mana Kumai Nyontarai nei ne nu pea we wiana wa.” <verse eid="LUK 9:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Interi Yesusi kewio we nyontarai pei eya ea doyo, “Bua Yau.” Mana' nyontarai wadi kewio we Yesusi doyo, “Worentuwa yau etaweri pampong wu manu wanea, imbaro yata iyai wo.” <verse eid="LUK 9:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yesusi daoa wei doyo, “Mempika nyontarai we endoaoa wa etata we ingkai engkadapa ya. Mana au, rua mae wuwu kawio pa parari Allai do riu we mananupa.” <verse eid="LUK 9:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Nyontarai pei tato kewio doyo, “Yai, yau aneuwe era kong Au, mana worentuwa yau etaweria imbaro yewara we erane. <verse eid="LUK 9:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yesusi kewio we nyontarai wadi doyo, “Nyontarai we piana do dua Yau, mana retaweri we pitaubai ne we moyawapa mamo yuna wa na Allai riu we mananu wau.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s">Yesusi demi ne nyontaraipa ya embe piatoru ea ura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Toyana Yesusi diri nyontarai piatoru ea ura, interi demi ya embe kai kodu enda pampong I, wu bendari pea kong awa pea we do ria reoa. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Yesusi kewio weya doyo, “Pi romi wau wo madupei, mana we engkutua empau wa. Impaina buewara we weneromi pai, imbaro demi weengkutu piromi wau empau ea.” <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Yesusi doyo, “Mendanto! Yemi mia membuwu neu Kawio mararisingne mamo, memparari domba antung we niai na Serigala we emamuna ene madukuira pa. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Mendeo mengko biningkeni pe, kaketa pe mae sapatu pe. Mendeo metoaweta na rangpai we mentopang tabea we nyontaraipei wa. <verse eid="LUK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Mae mesua na manu pei mamo, mengkawio metoyo, ‘Madori pibokipai we mia kuira na manu rarong nini pai.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Impaina na yana nyontarai we esane we madori, mamo kawio madoripa wata ko ya. Mae mene madoripa emaidaia mamo, mene madoripa ingkai taweri wu mia ma. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Menai na manu yani pai kio mia menda warui awa yani. Metampi kong metunung piwe nyontarai yasa etona we miapa. Wo nyontarai we meriwa mamo ingkai dedu awaweri pei tato. Mendeo menda waweriape. <verse eid="LUK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Mae metoyo mesua wu bendari pei, nyontarai na bendari yani etamang mia na we mai, interi metang roweang etona we miapa. <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />Mae metong we esui na yanapa empanang, mae mentopana we ya metoyo, ‘Allai ne riu we mananupe kikeu we miato.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Mana menda mesua na bendari pei mae nyontarai na yana endu mia wa, na yana mamo mendawu rang baba na bendari yani mae mesayau metoyo, <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />‘Wawu na bendari menempa wetata' na amasaemi ne amangkapa titetara na amandenawau, mae imbaro mendekamang nina ne, Allai riu we Mananupa piana kikeu to.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Yesusi kewio we ne nyontarai piatoru ea ura wau ya doyo, ‘Na a we nu ria niai wane, mambabati nyontarai Sodomi etadutapa, tapia raweina warui mambabati we nyontarai na bendari nini etadutapa.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bendari we endoawa we Yesusi</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 11:20-24)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />“Nyontarai Khorasimi kong nyontarai Betsaida mia mengkai memanaing rai! Impaina na Tirus kong Sidoni na a we rampa, Yau yong piwe tawa tantuma parari mene rabuangpa nina weya, piana esanetaweri warui ene sasari pa kong etadori. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Mana ingkai na a we nu ria niai wane, nyontarai Tirusi kong Sidoni ene mambabatipa ra tapia raweina warui mambabati menengpa. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Mae au Kapernaumi metorato ingkai weita sisu rora-marising pai e? Wereria, au ingkai empi au ra sisu do Karuari. <verse eid="LUK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Matei tarao mia mamo tarao Yau, mae matei sampi mia mamo sampi Yau kong sampi wedemi Yau pai.”<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">We etuara empiatoru ea ura entaweri</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 11:25-27, <ref loc="LUK 13:16-17">13:16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Toyana we etuara empiatoru ea ura wauya, entaweri na mararising mae etoyo, “Sen, semi-semi ya tato entuang we ama tutu amatadawa ya na Anomupa.” <verse eid="LUK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Interi Yesusi kewio weya doyo, “Erewo Nyombatang wadi sawa parari kewiewari na rora. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Piwe etopana nina ne we pitarai! Piana yong paya we mia to, impaina mentakepang piara kong aiyoai mana mentoyanea wa kong mempokai Nyombatang ne paya pa, mana dong we memoyawa pea we mia wa. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Mana toyana mendeo memararising wo semi-semi wau entuang we mia. Mana memararising wo piana Sen soi mesanomipa na rora-marising.<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kawio mararising kong piboki</para>
  <para style="r">(Matius. 11:25-27, <ref loc="LUK 13:16-17">13:16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Na a' yani, Yesusi merarising raweina tutu Duainunung Mamarang yumaoi, interi kewio doyo, “Yai eyomi we Au, Sen Au we ru na rora kong na nunei! Wo bonyuing taubai yana warui nyontarai we esanekurayang. Mana bonyawa we nyontarai we etadu anyau pea wa. Yai, piana pa waua anemurarompa. <verse eid="LUK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />Pitaupai piana Yai bona kai wu Yauma to. Mae nyontarai pei wa rearoang Kumai wadi, wo Yai mantauni. Kong nyontarai pei rearoang Yai pa wo mantau Kumai wadi. Kong nyontarai matei Kumai wadi diri we denyawi Yai we ya pa. <verse eid="LUK 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Interi Yesusi reweria wu ne manarua wauya mameari mae doyo, “Piboki we nyondekami we endeo piwe mendeoa nina pa. <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Wo ekawio we mia joyo, “Na pampongpa, nabi pe pitau kong mananu pitau, esane we endeo piwe mesaneoa na nina ne, mana endeoa wa. Mae esane we entarao piwe mentaraoa nina ne, mana entaraoa wa.<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyontarai Samaria we anewiwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Kuru akama Yaudi pei. Anemai mamo wiuwu kamang akama.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Weraung we Musai soi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hukum Taurat </char></note> Doa dutang tou Yesusi doyo, “Kurue, bonyau paina pipa totoi andi yoni mamo eweng piboki kio woroi-woroipa?”<verse eid="LUK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Yesusi riuwara wei ma doyo, “Pitoi entoi na kamang akama wadi pa, pitoi botora na wana pa?”<verse eid="LUK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Nyontarai wadi kewio we Yesusi ma doyo, “Bosaiwa Sen peidi, Allai aunemui pa na anemurarong tantenang, na dumuanunungpai tantenang, na nemu paya pa tantenang, na we anemutatuta pa tantenang, kong bosaiwa kawasa pandura kuira parari mantaung au.”<verse eid="LUK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Yesusi doyo, “We buaoapa mai, bompararia mamo wueng ki woroi-woroi.”<verse eid="LUK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Mana nyontarai nei do andi mei paina, dutang weri Yesusi ea doyo, “Matei di pandura kuira pa?”<verse eid="LUK 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Inte Yesusi riuwara wei ma doyo, “Muang pei wia na Yerusalemi wu Yerikho, ria aya nyontarai we emamuna wau embarararong, endorai, etawa piwe kiopa warui, interi empikari wiata, endawarui do keda wau kikeu. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Sen ne woming wau ei iwo Imami<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Imami wadi mamo na mandarong Lewi we kio piwe etona o Manu Mamarang.</char></note> dina tato, riana rang wawadi, reoi mana riawarui. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Nyontarai wau ei iwo nyontarai Lewi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lewi wemananu we riupata imami wauya na manu mamarang.</char></note>, itato riana rang siri wadi, dondeoi mana riawarui. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Interi nyontarai Samaria pei dondama, riama reoi mana aneoi kapari paina.<verse eid="LUK 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Ria wuria, yi angguri wau dindoipi kapapo wau, interi dong maning wau to apawau, interi pepati riuwari wu keledai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Keledai mamo pieung we eting kopi.</char></note> we yanai wadi, interi kiori wu manu we endama embai etena nai wadi, interi riuwai. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Ayari wadi, dong pe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pe Dinari wadi mamo pe Parenta Romawi. Dinari kodu mamo wiwai mariwa a kodu.</char></note> kodu wu wene manu wadia doyo, ‘Ruwai nyontarai nei mae bowayang raweing nina, mamo ingkai yona taweri na a we etawerima wane.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Yesusi yui arari nei doyo, “Matei di na nyontarai toru ne itoru ma boyo, pandura kuirapa na nyontarai we yua aya we emamuna wauya pai.”<verse eid="LUK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Kuru wadi daoa we Yesusi ma doyo, “We dosaiwari pai.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Yesusi doyo, “Ruanto! Bomparari we topanapa.”<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi riama wu Marta kong Mariai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Interi Yesusi kong ne weetuari pa ya enda topong ra sisu na awa pei. Na yana nyontarai wawing pei, anong pei Martai, dewari wu ne manu wadi. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Martai neta wawing pei anongpei Mariai. Mariai wo meoi kikeu Sen Yesusi mae tarao ne anyau wau. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Mana Martai yemupa tutu ra pitau we doyo donane dimbe sarawiri wau. Ria wu Yesusi interi doyo, “Sen impaina tui Mariai pika yau emariwa mameariki e? Bomie riupata yauwa e!” <verse eid="LUK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Sen kewio doyo, “Martaie, Martai wo! Au wekaeng kong womupa anemutatua pinini kong piwani. <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />Mae we pitaraipe katu koiriki. Impaina Mariai piana diri to, we ingkai ei kiori waruiwa.”<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s">Yesusi denyau parari tantandau</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 6:9-13, <ref loc="LUK 7:7-11">7:7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />A' peana Yesusi tendau na nupei. Tendaua kai mamo, ne manarua wauya koiri sopana we Yesusi doyo, “Sen bonyau ama tatuata amantandau parari Yoanisi denyau ne we etuari pa ya entandaupa“.<verse eid="LUK 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Topiana Yesusi daoa weya ma doyo, “Meto mentandau mamo mentopana topinina.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 11:2">‘Yai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">Sen Allai Au mueari kawawuru.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">Au amasomi we Au ma amataparanding Au.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">Amane mananu di Au pa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">Imbaro Au we mananu na nunei.<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Bona we ama na anemai roweang we maiyato.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Bupipira amane sasaripa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">tutu ama tato amatong warapi we etong we maiwa we ama pa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">mae remo tui amape na amasanesara ne naipe na a we pianea sou amapa.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Yesusi kewio we weenda konti wau ya doyo, “Parari nyontarai koiri na mia ria wu we umpandu asarupei na diru rabuang, doyo ‘Manetaiye! Bong rotipe botoru we yauwo, <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />tutu neu neta pei we riama, inte yua kong nyau mana neu roweangpea wei wa!’ <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Interi nemeta we rua wuriambadi doyo, ‘Remo woseung yaupe! Yau kong neu kumai piana amatenato. Aturarei amasuiri impaina etawa yong piwe buewarapa wa.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Yesusi kewio topong doyo, “Interi topino? Yau joyo! Auwo munpandura, mana meidai tewa dong piea we aupe. Mana momaya wa mae buewara pampang, impaina ingkai tewa mae dong piwe buewarapa.<verse eid="LUK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />Impaina etopana we mia, buewara mamo ingkai dona, mesera mamo ingkai metaduta, mento aturarei mamo ingkai aturarei yepari we mia. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Tutu weetewara ingkai ea etona, weesera ingkai etaduta, mae weento mamo ingkai esepa aturarei we mia. <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Yai matei na mia andi antungpai dewa diang mae dong piara wei pa? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Mae dewa aya newong mana dong ayoai wei pa. <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Impaina miawo nyontarai memamuna, mana mia tato metongpi weweng we mene kumai wauya, ea mamo Yai na rora dong weweweng raweina we mia! Ingkai I dong Duainunung Mamarang wu we etewara wuria“.<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi kong Beelsebuli</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 12:22-30; Markusi 3:22-27)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Na a peana Yesusi dedawa semi-semi pei meti warui nyontarai we woretamung wadi, semi-semi nei meti mae nyontarai wadi kewio. Dakami ria dekakaworeng, <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />mana ea etoyo, “I dedawa semi-semi na paya Beelsebuli,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Beelsebuli andi esawi we Nyombatang, </char></note> semi-semi ene mananu pina“.<verse eid="LUK 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Ea yati etoyo entou Yesusi, impaina etewa Yesusi doyao piwe denyauwa topino I riana Allai ma. <verse eid="LUK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Mana Yesusi ruradiduing pi we esane tatuata na esanerarong. Impaina Kewio weya doyo, “Parenta pei tebabau mae enta kakutui mae embe marowa mamo dandiruwa kong wemunamunai. Mae mandarong we tababau embemarowa waweria weya mamo, mandarong wadi dandiruwa kong wemunamunai. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Toyana tato na Beelsebuli ne mananupa. Ne we etuari wauya etoamuna we eaya mamo, ene mananu wau tababau manaing. Metoyo yedawa semi-semi na Beelsebuli ne paya pa. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Toyana mamo, we etua mia pa ya etadawa semi-semi na matei ne paya pa? We etua mia pa ya mantau yati engkamang parari memai wa pa! <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Mana Yau mamo yedawa semi-semi na Allai ne paya pa. Impaina Allai do Riu we mananupa piana naina mene rabuangpato.<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />Nyontarai wepiaya pei, kong ne pimamuna we mai, dong wido ne manupai mamo, pinempa wata mai. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Mae we piaya raweina pei riama miungtatiri doni kiara mamo, wepiaya wadi dewa ne pimamuna we anesara na ne manu wadi, interi wiwo wekiara wadi pi ne wau. <verse eid="LUK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />We engkong Nyau wa, embemarowa we Yau mae endupata Yau wa, etonane mariwa neune moya wa!”<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Semi-semi entaweri eya</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 12:43-45)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />Impaina semi-semi pei ria warui nyontarai pei, ria yera raora we kekawiri imbaro nyai nai, mana dedu nu pea wa. Topiana doyo, ‘Ingkai etaweri wu manu we piana epikari wanei!’ <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />A we ria sisu pai dedu nyontarai nei parari manu kekawiri kong wana we mai. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Interi ria kio semi-semi embe itu we emoyawa raweina, interi esua na nyontarai nei enai nai. Impaina nyontarai nei mioya wa raweing we pampongpa.<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyontarai we empiboki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Yesusi kewioa kai, interi wawing pei na nyontarai we empaupa ya kewio we Yesusi doyo, “Tarai! Wawing we dawing Au, dong u we Au pai, wieng kia.” <verse eid="LUK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Mana Yesusi kewio doyo, “We embeng raweina naria ea pa mamo, nyontarai we entarao Allai ne Arera pai we sopana mae etong pararia!”<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyontarai etewa Yesusi doyao piwe denyauwa we I riana Allai ma</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 12:38-42)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Na a we kawasa esambu Yesusi pai, kewio topong weya doyo, “Kawasa na a wepui ninane emoyawa kia. Etewa joyao piea imbaro esanesa Yau, mana imbe joyao piea wa mae parari we joyaoa tawa na nabi Yunusi pa.” <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Parari nabi Yunusi we kamang we nyontarai na bendari Niniwe, toyana tato Kumai Nyontarai ingkai we kamang we kawasa na a pui ninane. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Na a we nunei ria ki menai na wane, wawing mananu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">I mamo mananu Syeba. (I Raja-raja 10:1-13 mae I Tawarikh 9:1-12).</char></note> we riana wope wana sai ingkai tewa kong kawasa a ninane, ma i tato subakepang ya we etong we moyawa. Wo mananu wawing wadi ria woroi kia na nunei wope wanei, imbaro tarao anyau na Salomoi we ane kurayang. Mana na ninane eandi beba raweing Salomoi mana mentaraio wa. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Impaina na awe nu ria menaingna wane, we enai na Niniwe ingkai entawa kuira kong nyontarai na a pui ninane, kong entubakepang weya. Wo nyontarai Niniwe nea esanetaweri warui ene sasaripa, wo Yunusi wiuwu Sen ne kawio wea. Mana na nina eandi beba raweing Yunusi mana mentaraoi wa kong mesanetaweri warui mene sasaripa!”<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rengkamipa wo parari padamara we deao nentaraipai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat. 5:15</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6:22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />“Nyontarai peiwo kiai padamara pei interi kewuni na babeu pei wa. Mana i dong padamara wia na piwe etoni suranai wadi, imbaro nyontarai we esua endeo wedea wadi. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Rengkami wauwo parari padamara we nentarai wadi. Mae rengkamipa mamarang, nentaraipai dea tantenang. Mana rengkamipa pipapa mamo, nentaraipai tentenang tato berorang. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Impaina bosaiwa pi, imbaro dea wenyaina aupai berorangwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Impaina nentaraipai kiai dea, mae ea berorangwa, mamo nentaraipai dea tantenang parari padamara wewieriao au.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi yua nyontarai Parisi kong kuru akama</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 23:1-36; Markusi 12:38-40)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Yesusi kewioa kai, nyontarai embe Farisi pei dewara we Yesusi imbaro dampi konti na manu nempai. Interi Yesusi ria dampi na yana. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Nyontarai embe Farisi wadi arokutuya reo Yesusi dampi mae rioi warang pampong wa parari kamang akama Yaudi pai. <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Interi Sen kewio we nyontarai embe Farisi wadi doyo, “Nyontarai embe Farisi miawo metupi pirapi paruai ri wadiki, mana paruai rarong wadi keraria ma mia mentoyana pa. Meserai we nyontarai peaya etorato mia wo memai, mana mesanerarong wau wemoyawa. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Miawo mentata kia! Metaoa we Sen Allai niari riwadi pai, I kong nyari rarong wadi tato. <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Mana pi nai na paruai rarong wadi, metona we mempata nyontarai ene pieawa ya. Na toyanapa pi menempa kai ingkai kakawiri kong Sen Allai aneoa pa. <verse eid="LUK 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />Nyontarai embe Farisi ne mia, memanaing rai! Pi maiyeapa parari metong perpuluampa we Allai pai na pitantanang menempa ne bompa, metona na we mai. Mana pi baba pa parari mesanewiwu Allaipai kong mengkutu kawio na maipa, metong pararia wa. Impaina ne weweng raweina mamo, metong pi baba yana na mai kong menari ne mayeawa tato. <verse eid="LUK 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />Nyontarai embe Farisi ne mia, mia wo memanaing rai! Mia mesane we memayoi na karapesa na pong na manu esomi nai pa, kong mesanewe nyontarai enduwa mia na kawasa tau endenawau parari na nu manu awayang pa. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Manaing wemia, wo mia memparari aisata we dedu kamang wa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Parari na aunau akama Yaudi pai mamo, nyontarai Yaudi paya endana aisata ne wawongpa wa, wo na toyana etadu moyawa </char></note>, nyontarai endana wawongpa mana enduinariawa wo ne rarompa kangkong.” <verse eid="LUK 11:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Nyontarai kuru akama Yaudi pei kewio we Yesusi doyo, “Yai Kuruie!, Na kowio toyana pa mamo, Yai totipa ama tato!” <verse eid="LUK 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yesusi doyo, “Kuru akama Yaudi ne mia, mia tato memanaing rai! Metatura we nyontarai enari aseung pinini, enari piwani. Metong ami we memba we nyontarai kong metatura we etong pararia pa, mana mantaung mia tato memaidai mempataya na piwe etona yana. <verse eid="LUK 11:46" /><verse number="47-48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47-48" />Mia memanaing! Wo mene woriaipa ya na pampong yana emung nabipa ya mae na pui nina menari nabipa esane wawongpa. Pi menari we nabipa esane wawongpa toyana, we kamang we mantaung mia, mendeoao mene woriai pa pi etona na pampong yana pa. <verse eid="LUK 11:47-48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Aidona Allai ne anekurayang pa na pampong yana doyo, ‘Yau ingkai yemi nabipa ya kong rasuripa ya we nyontarai Yaudipa ya, mana eaya emungsa kong eaya etamei ya!’ <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Allai do nina imbaro nyontarai a' nina na mia tutu nabi tau nyontarai emungsa pa, na a' nunei retenangpa. <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />Weretenang na Habeli sisu Zakariai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aino imam Zakariai na Arera Tawa' pa.</char></note>, we emuni na Allai ne Manupai kong mesbah pai unerabuangpa. Mendoaoa! Nyontarai a' ninito ingkai deduami tutu tau ninapa. <verse eid="LUK 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />Kuru akama Yaudi ne mia, memanaing rai! Miawo mesaneaoa anyau we Musai soipa, mana mantau mia metong pararia wa. Kong metombawido nyontarai we eserai esaneaoapa ya!” <verse eid="LUK 11:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Interi Yesusi riawarui nu yani, kuru akama yaudi paya kong nyontarai embe Farisi etoya kangkuna we Yesusi. Ya esua Yesusi imbaro kewio pampang parari pitaupa. <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />Na yanato endekakepani na wemai imbaro entapu pitau we kewio arara pa.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s">Anyau we weetuaripa ya</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 10:26-27)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Toyana nyontarai tau enduraidora ya impaina ra ea yati entakakepang esaemipa. Na nyontarai esamburi, Yesusi denyau weapi ne weetuari wauya doyo, “Mesaneapong aiwara we nyontarai embe Farisi ene piwe etona unawa, aino etosajara we etong we mai wau.” <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Mana piwe anyuing wau ingkai nyontarai endeoa kong piwe pora wau ingkai nyontarai etanyawa. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />We mentopana na diru, ingkai entaraoa na raida, mae we mesoremaniniwa na nyontarai entarakambirei na mandarong we anyui ingkai esayauwa we kawasa tau.<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Memataitapi Sen Allaiki</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 10:28-31)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />Ekawio we mia, neu pandura pa mia! Mendeo mematai weemung menetaraipa mae ingkai ene paya we etong pianea we mia tato wa. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Impaina yenyauwa we mia matei di memataitipa. Memataitapi Sen Allai mantauni. Wo I ne paya we miung mia mae dingkai mia wu rawanang adia rarongpai. Impaina pitarai etopana we mia, I memataitipa. <verse eid="LUK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />Aya sumisumi embering, embo ya na manu awayang pe rekami we maiya wiri kodu. Mana toyana koiri ki Allai perandeni wa. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Dumuandaung na dungkami wau tato piana Allai detora kuira, impaina mendeo memataipe, wo mia mentadai raweing aya sumisumi wauya.<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mendeo mematai we mendoao metua Yesusi pe</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 10:32-33, 19-20)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />“Mesaneaoa aiwara pi ninane, nyontarai we na kawasa endena wau rioao we i tato dua Yau, mamo Kumai Nyontarai tato rioa oi na Allai ne mampang endena wau. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Mana nyontarai we rioao Yau wa na kawasa endenapa, ingkai Kumai Nyontarai rioa oi wa na Allai ne mampang endena wau. <verse eid="LUK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />Mae nyontarai we engkangkani Kumai Nyontarai nei, ne sasaripa tato ingkai Allai dupipira. Mana nyontarai matei di kengkani Duainunung Mamarang pai, ingkai Allai dupipira ne sasaripa wa.<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />Impaina nyontarai engko mia to manu akama Yaudi, imbaro etutangsaera mia na Kuru akama ete na we endu wang mananu pa ya tutu mendoao metua Yau, mendeo mesaneaera parari pitoi metonapa kong pitoi mentopana we metingba miawa pe. <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />Na yanapato ingkai Sen Duainunung Mamarang denyau mia na piwe ingkai mentopanapa.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sosiau parari nyontarai we nepi mana teta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Nyontarai koiri na weempau pa ya kewio we Yesusi doyo, “Yai Kuruie, topana we neu neta mantaung wanei, imbaro dong pi amanempa ea we yau na pi iyai dona wata we andu pa.” <verse eid="LUK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Mana Yesusi kewio ma doyo, “Netapa aune, matei di riuwa Yau we ekutu kawio ete ewe madukuira we maru e?” <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Interi Yesusi riuwara we kawasa tau we enpandura pa ya ma doyo, “Mesaneapong kong metamamang, mendeo mendewe mene ra pe.” Wo topitotoi nyontarai pi nempa pau raweina, mana dong weweng wei wa.” <verse eid="LUK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Interi Yesusi kewio na sosiau nini doyo, “Nyontarai wenepi pau pei. I ne kakopa we dong bong we pau. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Nyontarai we nepi pau nei anetatuata na anerarong doyo, ‘Piana nu peawa to, we yimbi neu roweangne na kakopane, Pipatotoi yoni naria eampa'. <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Interi anetatua ea mae kewio waweria wei, “Oh! Anetatua piea, yemi nyontarai entota neu manu we yingtong pi romi imbaro enari we beba era pei. Na yana yingtongkui neu pasibu wau kong piea wau. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Imbaromi etopana we mantau yau joyo, “Neu pitaubai kia, impaina yedu wewengpato kong pitaubai neu ne kai wa, wata we puda dediru. Interi ingkai erupiwa mae yampi, yunung emararising kia.” <verse eid="LUK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Mana Allai kewio wei doyo, “Aoa nyontarai we tota! Diru nini paito ingkai koda, interi matei di dedu pitaubai bong kuiri weau wadi. <verse eid="LUK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Toapeina tato we nyontarai yerai we riuri ra pau wei na nunei, mana na Allai renawau i tato yerai we riuri ra wei wa.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mendoaoa we Allai</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 6:25-34)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Interi Yesusi kewio we manarua wauya doyo, “Ai donane Yau joyo, mendeo mesaneriru we mene aseng waupe ete we menetarai waupe, we pitoai ingkai metang kong pitoi ingkai mesasuna waupe.’ <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Wo membeng wau tadai raweina warui roweang wau kong menetaraipa tadai raweina warui asung mesasuna pa. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Mendetuwa aya wawai wauya! Ya wo entantanangba kong etetang pianeawa kong ene manu pea wa we etisoni roweang, mana Allai deung ya! Miawo mentadai raweing aya wau ya. <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Na mia tato, mateidi na ne we aneriru wau piang ne aseng wau katea konta pa? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Piana piwe antitui wawauki mene paya pea wa we metonapa, pitoi mesaneaera mia tutu piea wau pa? <verse eid="LUK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Mendea parari pibopu na mapang wau wawa, endupi wa kong menyayang wa. Mana mananu Salomoi wenepi era tato, ne asung we yesuna wau weng wa parari pibopu wau pa. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Nanimpung we wawa na mapang wawa na anei mae kamai mamo enunumia kiai, mana Allai deung naningpung wadi impaina wiengkia. Mia tato Allai ingkai deung mia, we mendoaoa kairawa ne mia. <verse eid="LUK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Impaina, mendeo meseneriru kong mesanekaeng we piwe metang kong metunung waupe. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Nyontarai endearoang Allai wa, ea yati etadawa pampang we pi wawau. Mana Yai na rora-marising piana anemao piwe mia mesaneaoa kuira. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Mana meserai kangkuna imbaro Allai we mananu na mia, ingkai pitau eapa Allai dona we mia tato.’<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ra na rora-marising</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 6:19-21)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />Interi Yesusi kewio naria doyo, ‘Mia mentamami pai na anerarong merising riuwa mia we ne nyontarai na ne Riu we Mananupa. Impaina maidau we mempau wa ni mia mendeo memataipe. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Metawayang pitau menempa, metong pe' yana pa wu nyontarai ene pianea wa wauya. Toyana mamo menari biningkeni we mai na rora-marising we mia. Biningkeni wawau emananapi engko wa kong pue etang kakarawa. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Wo na totoi mene rapa wa na yana, na yana tato mesanerarongpa nai na yana.”<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">We riupatara we demang pampang</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 24:43-44)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />Yesusi kewio doyo, “Metamamang, mesarota pitaupa. Memparari mesasung mia pampang kong mene padamara mengkai dea pampang. <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />Mai pararia we endupatara we piana etamamang ene tuan wadi teweri na munara didau wadi ma so aturarei wadi, ingkai entawa kaparia esepa aturarei wadi. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Piboki kia we weendupata, we piana etamamang ene tuani na a weriama wane. Mesane sara kia, tuang wadi piana demamang mae ingkai demi we endupatara wau ya emayoi interi tuanei mantauni ingkai wesarawiri ya. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Piboki kia we weendupatara wau ya wo ene tuanei reo ya etamani na ria ma wane, na diru rabuang ete kikeu we ayarie. <verse eid="LUK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />Mesaneao ninane! Parari tuani we ne manu wadi, rekamang a we mananapiri nei ingkai riama wane, impaina peduawido ne manu wadi imbaromi we mananapi nei reo yua wu ne manu nei apuipe. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Toyana mia tato, metamamang pampang, wo Kumai Nyontarai ingkai riana a we menduinaria wa.”<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wepiata nukepana kong wepiata we nukepana wa</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 24:45-51)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Petrusi dutang doyo, “Sen ne Au, anyau nini Au boni we mantau amameari ete boni tato we nyontarai pea ya e?” <verse eid="LUK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Sen kewio wei doyo, “We riupatara matei di dong parari ne tuanei ne kawiopa na wemai kong anekurayang, ingkai ne tuanei riuwari we mampata we beba we mampata eaya pa, imbaro dong roweang we ya na a wane pa?. <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Piboki we mampata wadi, wo na a wane ne tuanei teweri naria ema deduti we riupi rai. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Ekawio we au joyo, “Wo tuang wadi ingkai riuwa wepiata wadi we dosaiwa pitau we tuang wadi nengpa. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Interi we riupata wadi mioyawa impaina kewio na anerarong doyo, ‘Neu tuang wanei woroi pi interi teweri mape, interi miungtati we endupata tau wauya engkai mae dampi dunung tutu meeru. <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />Interi tuang nei teweri na awe rekamana wa, impaina tuang nei ingkai miung tatiria keda kong doni parari nyontarai we entaraoi wa entuang we Allai wa. <verse eid="LUK 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />Wepiata piana aneao ne tuang nei pi we anewea wau, mae demamani kong dong parari piwe tuanei dona pawa, impaina riorai era membabati memba kangkuna. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Mana wepiata wadi riuinaria wa we dong parari tuang nei aneweapa wa, interi dosara pi impaina tuan wadi rioatatiri katea. Wo nyontarai we piana Allai dong pitau pa wei, impaina nyontarai wadi dona pau tato. Kong nyontarai we piana Allai rioaoi na pitaupai, ingkai i tato Allai dewa pi pau pea konti.”<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi kio marowa</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 10:34-36)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />“Erama nina imbaro etatuwa adia mamo marowa na nunei. Aneukangkona we marowapa piana tawato parari adia we dang! <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Mamambati baba pea ingkai yeduta to. Piyana tawa wa ingkai aneurarong nei dutang nyau pampang weya. <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Mana metorato yau erama we eko wemadori to nunei e? Wereria, eko wemadoriwa, wo eko marowa. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Na a nini pai topong, mandarong pei embering mamo ingkai embawaweria, itombe toru itombe marowa we umbe kodu tato, umbe kodu umbe marowawe itombe toru. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Yai ingkai embawari ne kumai muangpai kong kumai wadi ingkai embawari tamani. Nyani ingkai embawari kong ne kumai wawing pai kong kumai wawingpai ingkai embawari kong nyani. Neoni ingkai embawari kong rewang wadi, rewang wadi ingkai embawari kong neoni wawing wadi.”<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tandetatua kamang na awapui nina</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi. 16:2-3)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Yesusi kewio tato we nyontarai weempau wauya doyo, “Impaina mia mendeo nyontarai we deto mandipi weita na do wanangmarai, menduwara metoyo, ‘Ingkai miuna mamo taraie miuna pararia. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Mae mia menduradiduing wanang sai pai wia, metoyo, ‘Ingkai wo riata, ‘Tarai wo riata pararia. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Mia nyontarai we metong sambamboni we metong we mai! Mia metao mering, miuana, wanang kong wo riata pa, mendetatua pararia na rora kong nunei. Mana pitoi dona we kamang na awapui nina mendetatuata wa pa?”<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">We wemarowa wemiapa mempiboki wei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Mat. 5:25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />Topitotoi peino mengkutu kawio na wemai wa pa?. <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Mae Nyontarai pei dimbu au to manu we etingkutu kawio, werai kangkuna we imbaro bong kawio wau kai kongti na mune rang rabuangpa. Wo wereria mamo, ingkai kio au wu weendu wangka engko auwu purisi interi purisi etong au wua bui. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Ekawio we au joyo, “Au ruatori warui bui wa kio buai wiwaiwau ara kai.”<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s">Mesane taweri warui mene sasari wauwa mamo ingkai memanaing rai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Na a wawau nyontarai peaya endama engko arera we Yesusi, parari nyontarai Galilea we Pilatusi miungya pa ya. Pilatusi miungya na a we engkutu ene pieung we pikika we Allaipa. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Mana Yesusi kewio weya tonina, “Impaina metorato nyontarai Galilea wawau ya, etadu kaida towawa wau mamo, ene sasari baba raweing nyontarai Galilea eaya e? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Wereria wiria! Mae mesanekakepana, wo mesanetaweri wa na mene sasaripa mamo, ingkai mengkada tato parari ya. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Topitotoi tato na nyontarai esura ea injatoru we embe bemuna na Siloami, na a we kamoung pai tekai dedau kepang ya pa? Memananai na wawau subakamana we ene sasaripa baba raweina warui nyontarai tau we enai na Yerusalemi wau ya e? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Wereria! Mae etopana we mia naria ea. Mesanetaweri warui mene sasaripa wa mamo, ingkai mia kuira tato mengkada parari ya.”<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sosiau parari ai ara we wewiong wa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Interi Yesusi sopang arari pei we sosiau topinina doyo, “Nyontaraipei ne ai arapei na ne romi angguri pai. Apeana ria yera ne bongpai na ai wadi, mana dedu koiripara wa. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Impaina kewio we weriupi na ne rominei doyo, ‘Remoa, pudape toruto erama eyera ara bongpai na ai ara nei, mana yedu koiripara wa. Rowang ai ne ki! Wo mantau doa pinoma na kakopanei dang pinong roweang na kakopanei!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Mana we riupi na romi wadi kewio wei doyo, “Tuane! Tuntui doa puda koiri nini eambo, ingkai etara kakopanei wari mae yong pupuki pea oi. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Imbaromi pitau yona oi ninane donane wewiong na puda we riaema neipe. Mae wereria mamo, interi bomi ya endowani ki!”<figure style="fig" alt="pohon ara" file="LB00382B.TIF" size="col" ref="13.9">ai ara</figure><verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi dong panang we wawing we karubu na a' we nyontarai Yaudi endupi wa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Na apeana a we nyontarai Yaudi endupiwa nai pai, Yesusi denyau na manu esomi nai pei. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Na yanapa wawingpei, we piana pudape uraya injatoru yui, wo semi-semi esapopari. Wawing wawadi karubu mae doatera wa. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Toyana Yesusi reo wawing wadi, yawima kewio wei doyo, “Na nina piana ponang warui nemu uipa.” <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Interi Yesusi dong warang wau wata na wawingnei waradarawau, na wawau to doatera ma deparanding Allai. <verse eid="LUK 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Mananu na manu esominai wadi keyou, wo Yesusi dong nyontarai empanang na a we nyontarai Yaudi endupi wa pai, impaina kewio we nyontarai tau wauya doyo, “Ape bowonang we tandupi, impaina menda na a we yana ma we Yesusi dong mia mempanang. Mana mendeo na a we Yaudi endu piwa nai nei pe.” <verse eid="LUK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Yesusi daoa weya doyo, “Nyontarai metosajara ne mia! Na a we Yaudi endupiwa nai pai, pitoi memati mae mene pieung sapi kong keledaipa ya metong ya etampi kong etunung. <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Mana, na ninane wawingpei na mandarong Abrami, we piana manyonapei pudape uraya injatoru, nyombatang dawiti. Impaina i mamo epikari warui ne uine na a we Yaudi endupiwa tato e?” <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />We Yesusi daoa wau donara we emarowa we Yesusi wauya emamaya kia, mana nyontarai ea wauya engkai emararising we endeo pitantuma Yesusi donapa.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sosiau kodu parari piana Sen riu we Mananu wau</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 13:31-32; Markusi 4:30-32)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Interi Yesusi dutang doyo, “Na a we Allai riu we mananupa mamo topitotoi, pitoi andi Yoni we yintatua pininane pa? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />I parari pikami we engkoria endayani na ene romipai. Pikaminei kirinti kangkuna warui pi na romi, mana kemamaia we ai mae ayane esapoma engko enekaraini na arawang wau.”<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Mae Yesusi kewio naria doyo, “Na pipatotoi di yoni we yintatua nari Sen riu we mananupa ne? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />I wo perari ragi we wawing engkori etingpau tepung rotang maserere pe toru na bokori baba pei donane weita mai tokoiri.”<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aturarei we kiepang</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Mat. 7:13-14</ref>, 21-23)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Interi na awe Yesusi ria wu na bendari Yerusalemi pai, ria denyau na bendari pei to bendari pei eaya kong na awa pei to awa pei eaya. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Nyontaraipei dutang Yesusi doyo, “Nyontarai maidau nisati ingkai etadu wengki woroi-woroi pa ne?” <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />Yesusi kewio wei doyo, “Mesera kangkuna imbaro mesua na aturarei we kiepang wanei. Etopana we mia! Madupea yati esera kangkuna we esua, mana etaduta wa.” <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Mae parari tuani wene manunei tewa peremang aturarei wanei mamo, ingkai mento metewara, Tuane wepa aturareinei we amawo, mana wene manu wadi riuwara we mia ma doyo, ‘Yau eruinari mia wa na menda na pa wa. <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Impaina ingkai metoyo, ‘Piana amatampi amatunung kong au mae rua bonyau na rang na bendari amanene to'. <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Mana ingkai riuwara we mia doyo, ‘Erui nari menda naima pa wa. Mendawarui yau, we menari we moyawa mia!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />Na a we mendeo Abrami, Isaki, Yakupi kong nabi pitau emayoi emararising na Sen ne riu we Mananu na wane mamo, mesai mengkarikakapa menderemi tutu miati memeari engkai mia toripa. <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Mae ingkai nyontarai pitau we endama, na do wanang ba, na do wanang sai, wope murang kong wope wanang marai. Etong anani baba na Sen ne riu we mananu rarongpa. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Impaina nyontarai we empipui yati empampong mae nyontarai we empampong wauya ingkai empipui ea.”<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi anengyai we Yerusalemi</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 23:37-39)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Na a wawau tato nyontarai embe Farisi pea ya enda wu Yesusi ma engkawio wei etoyo, “Remo nuai na ninape! Rua wu nu pea weiya ra, wo Herodesi anewe miung Au.” <verse eid="LUK 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Yesusi daoa doyo, “Menda mentopana we nyontarai wemei wa pai, a nini kong kamai yedawa semi-semi kong yong nyontarai we esui empanang, mae na a we botoru piwe erama yonapa ingkai yonara kai. <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Mana topiyana era pampang, anei, kamai, ayariaea, wo moyawa we nyontarai nabi pei emuni na Yerusalemi riwane. <verse eid="LUK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />Yerusalem, Yerusalemi! Au mung nabipaya. Nyontarai we Allai demi ya we aupa ya, woya na kamia engkada. We bototoi aneu we eruwa nemu nyontarai paya, parari mangkuei wawingpei warakepang ne kumai paya na warapemapa wawa, mana muayawa. <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:35">To wawau mamo Allai derara miawa to. Mesanekamana, na nina tato ingkai mendeo Yau eawa ra sisu awe mentopang metoyo, “Piboki we I, we ria na Sen anompai.”<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s">Yesusi dong we yui pei penang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Na apeana, a we Yaudi endupi wa, Yesusi ria wu nyontarai we mananu we nyontarai embe Farisi paya pei to ne manupaia we dampi konti. Na yanapa nyontarai pitau endetatua Yesusi na pitarai, na piwe ingkai dona wau. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Interi nyontarai we warang aeng babara pei ria wu Yesusima. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Interi Yesusi dutang wu kuru akama Yaudi paya kong nyontarai embe Farisi we enai na yana paya doyo, “Parari kawio we Musai soipai mamo, tampika nyontarai empanang na a we Yaudi endupiwa nai nei ete wereria e?<verse eid="LUK 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Kuru akama paya kong nyontarai Farisi wauya aidisa. Interi Yesusi riu na nyontarai we yui wadi warangwau, doni penang interi demi ria. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Impaina Yesusi kewio weya doyo, “Topitotoi, na mia nyontarai pei ne kumai ete ne sapi pei, sawa wu parigi pei rarongpa na a we Yaudi endupi wa, mamo ingkai merarua riuwari warui parigi rarompai maei rai.<verse eid="LUK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Mana parari pi wawau nyontarai pei dao pianea we Yesusi wa.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi denyau nyontarai imbaro esane aiwaya kong esanewiwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Na yana Yesusi reo we esau ya wauya, etiri nu we piboki we emayoinai. Impaina dong anyau nini weya doyo, <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />“Nyontarai esau mia wu munara didau peia mamo, mendeo metiri kadera wepiboki we memayoi nai pe. Wo nyontarai ne munarapai donane yau nyontarai baba pei ma pe. <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />Imbaro we ne munara yau maru kuira wadi, riama sopang we au doyo, ‘Aune! Nu piboki nini empikari we nyontarai eyauwi yani pai'. Mana mumaya kia, kong boa rua to wapui wanei. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Wo toyana parari etewa mia, metiri nu we naina wapui wiri wane, imbaro tuani we ne manu wadi ingkai riama kewio we au doyo, Netai ye! Ruama moyoi na nu we piboki nina. Towawau mamo, nyontarai etuang we mia na nyontarai tau we esau ya ne endena wau.<verse eid="LUK 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Wo nyontarai matei di doyo tedaipa ingkai rianyaung, mana we ria nyaung pai ingkai ria tedai ea.<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Interi Yesusi kewio we tuani we ne manunei doyo, “Impaina wau nyontarai peaya we metampi kuira na raida ete na diru mamo, remo wau nemeta paya, ete nemu aririrapa ya ete nemeta mantaung paya ete manu kiria we ene ra pau paya pe. Wo yati ingkai esau au ea, mamo na toyana au boduta taweri na piwe bonapa to. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Impaina parari bo bong munara pei mamo, wau nyontarai we engkiaripi, nyontarai we netarai maiwa, nyontarai we empaya kong nyontarai we endepipu. <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />Au ingkai bodu muang na Allai, wo nyontarai yasa embai weri nemu wewengpa wa. Nemu weweng wau ingkai Allai mantauni biaita na a we nyontarai we embeng entawa taweri na ene kaida pa.<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sosiau parari munara we beba</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 22:1-10)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Na a we nyontarai pei dampi kuira na wawau tarao Yesusi kewio wau, inte kewio wu Yesusia doyo, “Myuangkia nyontarai we ingkai dampi kong Allai, na a we riama we we mananupa!”<verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Mana Yesusi kewio we nyontarai wadi doyo, “Na apei, nyontarai pei dong munara we beba mae yau nyontarai tau. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Toyana na a we munara wadi ne ape mai we etonipa, nyontarai ne munara wadi demi ne patarapei ria wu dakami tau we yau ya pa mae doyo, ‘Mendama to, pitaupe piana manyena to!’ <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Mana ya engkai, koiri, koiri etoyo emaidai endamape. We retenang wadi kewio we patara wauya doyo, ‘Yau katene ewori kakopa rabuang pea, impaina yo era ereutatuata. Koyou yau pe.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Eandi na ea kewio doyo, ‘Katene kai ewori rembupe embe ura impaina yo aneu we era yongtatua ya wo. Piana koyou yau pe.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Eandi na ea kewio doyo, ‘Katene kai edidau impaina imbe eramantu wa.’<verse eid="LUK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />Patara wadi teweria mae sopang pitau yana we ne tuang wadi. Impaina ne tuang wadi keyou kia, inte kewio we patara wadi doyo, ‘Rua moraru wu rang baba kong rang maiya na bendari wane. Ko kuiyama nyontarai we engkiari pi, nyontarai we enetarai meiwa, nyontarai we endepipu kong nyontarai we empaya wa. <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Interi patara wadi kewio we ne tuanei doyo, ‘Tuane, worentuwarapa piana yonato, mana nu madu peai ne rai.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Interi tuang wadi kewio ea doyo, ‘Rua wu rang baba pa kong rang saora we wana na bendarinei riwane, imbaro neu manunei donung na kawasa'. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Mesane kakepana! Wo nyontarai pitau eyau ya pampongpa, koiri tato wa dang roweang munara neu nei wa.”<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pitau we nemupa pikara mae bua Yesusi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Mat. 10:37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Interi nyontarai madupei enda kuira etua Yesusi. Yesusi reweria interi kewio weya doyo, <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />“Impaina nyontarai pei riama do derua Yau, mana aneokapa inyani, tamani, ne wawing, ne kumai paya, neta paya kong mantau waweri, mamo i berui we dua Yau wa. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Nyontarai we meidai yedo ne aitabapai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wodo aitabapai mamo: anemuatakara we bua Senia koda</char></note> mae dua Yau wa, mamo i meiwa we dua Yaupe. <verse eid="LUK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />Parari na mia, nyontarai pei nyari manu we tedai pei mamo meyoi deto parari pe bototoi ingkai nyari ne manu wane nai pa, imbaro ane kamang we ne pe' maiatone ete wereria raie. <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Wo pararia deto na we mai wa mamo, nyari manu amang wadi mameari mae piaya we nyari manu wadi kiai wa, wo pe wau maiya wa. Mamo ingkai nyontaraipa endeo pi wawau ingkai emari. <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />Kong ingkai engkawio etoyo, ‘Eh, Topitotoi! Nyontarai nini piana ne paya we nyari manu amangnei mameari, mana ne paya wa we nyari manupaia kiai wa'.<verse eid="LUK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />Parari mananu baba we wedung na nupei we ne raipe piaura weura (10.000), eto emamuna we mananu pei ea ya. Mananu yani ne raipa embe piaura weura wekodu (20.000). Mamo mananu wadi ingkai meyoi anetatuata parari ne rai wauya, we empaya emamuna we mananu ne raipa empau pa ya ete wereria e? <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Mae parari mananu pai anetatuata we piaya wa mamo, na a we ne marowa wane ya enai woroi rai, ingkai demi ne mampaing peaya imbaro etutana we pitoi etona we epandurapa kong endu na embarami pa.” <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Yesusi kewio kai toyana, mae sopang doyo, “Topiyana tato na mia kuira. Nyontarai pei na mia, doyo dua Yau, piana anetatuata aiwara. Wo pika pinempa kuira wa, kong perandenia wa mamo, meiwa we dua Yau.”<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ai we maria</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 5:13; Markusi 9:50)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />“Ai wadi wieng, mana parari ria yeiwe maria, ingkai na pitoi kai ria yei masuasung naria eampa? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Ne weweng pea ea wa to, weng we etingpau pianea ea wa. Impaina ingkai engkai pinomi. Mentarangkambirei pea mamo mentaraoa!”<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s">Sosiau parari Domba we nyai</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 18:12-14)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Na a peana, nyontarai esau wiwai we mananu Kaisari kong nyontarai etong sasari endawu Yesusi ma entarao denyau wau. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Impaina nyontarai embe Farisi wauya engkong kuru akama Yaudi etoya we Yesusi etoyo, “Pendu nyontarai wesasari wauya dampi kong sa!” <verse eid="LUK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Interi Yesusi kewio na sosiau wauei wea doyo, <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />“Na mia matei di ne piaung domba empiaring (100) interi koiri nyai, mamo pika piamanua ea uraya injatang (99) enai na mapang mae ria yerai we nyai wadi kio dedutipa? <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Mae deduti mamo merarising kia riuwari yedowi kiori teweri. <figure style="fig" alt="Domba yang hilang didapat kembali" file="GT00075.tif" size="col" ref="15.5">Domba we nyai dedutiea merarising</figure><verse eid="LUK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />Ria sisu manu wane mamo yau we empandu ya wauya kong yau we manu wararei wauya mae sopana weya doyo, “Mendama tamararising kuira, wo neu domba we nyaipi piana yeduti taweri to. <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Impaina etopana we mia, na rora-marising tato mararising baba we nyontarai sasari koiri we pika ne sasari wau, baba raweing warui empia manua ea uraya injatang we etoyo ya wo embe sasari wa.<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sosiau parari pe we nyai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />“Wawo wawing matei ne pe minape ura. Toyana mamo koiri nyai impaina pitoi doni pa? I ingkai kiairao padamara mae dira aerai yerai na we pitarai kio deduti. <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Yeraia deduti mamo yau we empandu ya kong aiwaiwari paya inte doyo, ‘Memararising kong nyau, wo neu pe mina koiri we nyai pi yeduti to'. <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Impaina etopana we mia, toapeina tato nyontarai wesasari koiri teweri warui ne sasari wau impaina Sen Allai ne mampang wau emararising kia.”<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sosiau parari kumai we nyai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Yesusi kewio sosiau pei naria ea doyo, “Paituang pei ne kumai muang pe kodu. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Kumai maiya wadi kewio we tamani ma doyo, ‘Yaie, wiwo piwe tanempa to imbaro bong neupa ma. Impaina tamani wiwo piwe enempa we ne kumai wau asaru. <verse eid="LUK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Apeasaru kumai wayangpui wadi wio pitau we nempa interi donta to nu we woroi. Na yana demei pe nempa na deinunung kong dong pi wemai wa ma denakong wawing we emamota tutu anetatuata aiwarawa. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Interi ne pe wau piana kai kuira, mamo piwawi baba deduta na raora yani pai. Na peinato dedu pikatu yanei wa. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Interi ria riupi kong we ne nupei we demi wu raora we eteung tapui wau yanai wadi, imbaro deiwai ne tapui wauya. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Mana wewi kapara paina, anekangkong we dang roweang tapui wau, wo nyontarai pei tato dong roweang pea wei wa. <verse eid="LUK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Sisu yana aneaiwari ma doyo, ‘Nyontarai we endupi kong iyai esarirang roweang, mae na nine wawinei dona kia yo ekadane kikeu. <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Yau interi etawa mae era wu yaia ekawio wei joyo, “Yaie, yau piana yong sasari we Allai kong yai au pa. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Yau wo emaiwa we wau yau we nemu kumai wa. Bong yau parari nyontarai we erupi we au“. <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Interi tewa mae ria wu tamania. Toyana na woroi tamani reaoi mae anengyai, impaina depai mamani. Interi tamani tepuri mae wopeoi.<verse eid="LUK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Kumai wadi kewio wu tamania doyo, “Yai piana yong sasari we Allai kong we yai au, neu wemaipea wa we wau yau we nemu kumai pa wa“. <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Mana' tamani yau weendupatari wauya mae doyo, “Memararu! Mengko asung wewengpei ma metoni yesuna. Metong sarakapei na warakeapai kong sapatu na aengpa. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Toyana mengko sapi antung we piung pei, mengkutui mae mendama tatampi kong tamararising. <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Wo neu kumai nei piana kedato mana wieng ea! Piana nyaito mana yeduti taweri naria ea. Interi etong munara wau kia. <verse eid="LUK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />Toyana kumai retenangpi nyai na romi wane. Na yana teweri riama kikeu manu wau, interi tarao endoi emayai. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Yau nyontarai wepiata pei ma, interi dutani doyo, “Pitoi ai naina manupe nina?” <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Wepiata wadi kewio wei doyo, “Nemeta maiya pai interi teweri ma ne. Impaina tamamui demi ama amangkutu sapi antung wepiung, wo i piana dedu ne kumai we nyai pai teweri na wepiboki“. <verse eid="LUK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />Kumai retenang wadi keyou era, impaina meidai yua wu manu wau ampe. Interi tamani meti ria kewio ayari imbaro yua wu manupui ya. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Mana kewio we tamani doyo, “Puda dediru taupa erupi pitarai we iyai au. Kowio piea we yau mamo ebateta au wa, mana pitoi iyai boni we yau pae? Bong kambing pei we yau wa, imbaromi yomararising kong neu aririra nea. <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Mana nemu kumai wadi dong pitau paiya menaing kong wawing emamota, mae toyana teweri ma iyai kutu sapi antung we piung pai wei'. <verse eid="LUK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Tamani kewio wei doyo, ‘Kumai pa au,’ nuai pampang kong nyau. Pitau we neu nina pi nemu pina tato. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Mana nina ne, nemeta nei piana parari keda, mana wieng taweri ea, nyai mana tataduti ea, impaina topitotoipa tatong munara kong tamararising.”<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s">Mampata we menyayang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Yesusi kewio we ne manarua wauya doyo, “Nyontarai we ne ra pau pei, ne mampata pei. Nyontarainei riuwari we deiwai ne pe kong pi we neng wau. Mana na a' pei taroa we mampatanei yemboing ne pe wau. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Impaina nyontarai we ne ra paunei yau mampatanei ma kewio wei doyo, ‘Piwe tarawoa we aune moyawa na mariwa we bonapa. Bonyawa we yau tarai parari mariwa we rupa. Na a ninito, au monaing warui neu mariwa we yona rupa'. <verse eid="LUK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Impaina mampata we riu pe wadi anetatuata doyo, “Ingkai pitoi yona pa? Neu tuanei doyo, dong nyau emanaing. Etara kakopa, epaya wa, yeiwiewa, emamaya. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Oh! Neu manyayang pea to, imbaro na awe dong yau emanaing warui neu mariwanei mamo, nyontarai pea empandu yau na ene manupa ki. <verse eid="LUK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />Impaina mampatanei yau nyontarai we embenyaki we ne Tuane ema. Kewio we nyontarai we pempong nei doyo, Nemu nyaki pe bototoi we neu tuangnei? <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Nyontarai nei daoa wei doyo, ‘Maning saituni babeu piaring.’ Interi mampatanei kewio wei doyo, ‘Nemu weraung nyaki dinini. Moyoito mae toi kaparia na yana, piakodu ea ura'. <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Toyana mampata nei kewio ea wu nyontarai we kodu wadi doyo, ‘Netapa au ne, nemu nyaki bototoi?’ Nyontarai wadi daoa wei doyo, ‘Potang kadu piaring we ura (1.000)'. We riu pe nei kewio wu ria doyo, ‘Toi we piaring we injatoru (800)'.<verse eid="LUK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />Impaina tuang nei deparanding ne mampata nei tutu ne anekurayang wau. Wo nyontarai nunei embe kurayang raweina na etong pi eneng wau warui nyontarai endea wauya“.<verse eid="LUK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Interi Yesusi kewio nariaea doyo, “Mentarama! Ra Sen dona we mia na nunei nini, menari na wemai we mempata nyontarai eaya, imbaro parari mene ra nini nyai mamo, metadu nu wemai yuwi na rora-marising. <verse eid="LUK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Nyontarai we nyari piwe we maiya na wemai, ingkai esanesari we nyari piwe baba pa na wemai konta. Mana nyontarai nyari piwe mayea na wemoyawa mamo, ingkai esanesari wa we nyari piwe baba pa wa. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Impaina parari na piwe mene na nunei, piana metadu aminduya pea wato, matei di doyo dong aminduya we mia na piwe na mamarang waupa? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Mae parari nyontarai peaya ne rapa anesara we mia metona na wemai, mana metosaiwara wa. Toyana mamo Allai dong ra mene na rora-marising pawa impaina membengki woroi-woroi wa.<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />Nyontaraipe koiri meriwa we tuanpe kodu wa, wo nyontarai wadi ingkai aneweng tuang pei mae meidai asaru ei. Toyana parari mia tato, memariwa we Allai kong we pe wa.<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kawio Yesusi sopanapa</para>
  <para style="r">(Matius 11:12-13, <ref loc="LUK 5:31-32">5:31-32</ref>; Markus 10:11-12)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Nyontarai embe Farisi wauya entarao piwe Yesusi sopana yana kia. Mana emari Yesusi tutu yawo nyontarai endekami baba we pe diya. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Mana Yesusi kewio weya doyo, “Miawo nyontarai meserai we nyontarai peaya etaparanding mia, mana Allai rebau mesanerarongpa. Tutu piwe nyontarai meto tadai na nunei, Sen Allai aneunawa kong taubai we mai wa.<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />Weraung we Musai soi pai kong anyau nabi paya, ne paya enduti ma sisu a Yoanes Pembaptisi pai. Na a yani topong, Arera Mamarang parari pipatotoi Allai riu we mananupa, yati nyontarai ne etintanyaua pampang. Kong nyontarai etamuna kangkuna we esua na Allai ne mananu rarongpa. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Mana rora kong nunei wo mawa we nai mae kamang antintui na weraung Musai soipa ea nai wa.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />Muang mateidi dedawa wawinia menaing interi riau wawing peiea mamo dong tata mamota. Mae muang we didau kong wawing we awani meidai pai mamo, dong tata mamota tato“.<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyontarai we ne ra pau kong Lasarusi we kiaripi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />Interi Yesusi tato deniau ya na sosiau nini: “Nyontarai we ne ra pau pai anemai mamo yesung asung weuna, mae yerandiki. Anemai mamo merarising na ne ra wau. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Mae nyontarai pei we ne pieawa anong pei Lasarusi. A nemai mamo wiata dewiewa na nyontarai we ne ra pau wadi ne aturarei manu wadi repong. Netarai wadi donung na kapapo we remananing wemoyawa. <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Lasarusi wewi kapara impaina dodampi, mana demangpi roweang kangkenai we nyontarai wadi keiaya wau. Mana piwe meidia naria ea, ne kapapo wau wona endama endare.<verse eid="LUK 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />Interi nyontarai we kiaripi wadi keda, mampang wauya endama engkori to raora we tadai kikeu Abrami na rora-marising. Nyontarai we ne ra pau wadi tato keda interi esirai. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Na maring karuari, nyontarai we ne ra pau nei yeseung yui mambabati kia. Na woroi reo Abrami kong Lasarusi meoi na raora wetadai kiria Abrami. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Nyontarai we ne rapau wadi yau we Abrami doyo, ‘Yai Abrame!’ Anemo yau, yau eyui kapara na adianei! Bomi Lasarusi yoang warangpa na mariapai rarong riama dona wawao woreupanei. Wo eyui na adianei rarong paina“.<verse eid="LUK 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />Mana Abrami kewio wei doyo, ‘Kumaipa aune anemuaoa! Wuengpa piana bodu wewengpato, mae Lasarusiwo dedu we moyawa. Impaina i merarising na nina, mae au wui na yana. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Tutu berarong baba pei dawe ama kong au, imbaro nyontarai pa matei ea na nina emberawa na ninipa sisu wani kong nini.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />‘Nyontarai wene ra pau nei kewio we Yai Abrami doyo, ‘Toyana mamo, Yai, Yau yewara kongtau Yai bomi Lasarusi wu neu yai ne manu paia. <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />Wo netaneu pe embering yati enai yanapa. Bomi Lasarusi yuaya, imbaro endeo entawa wu raora ui nini pe'.<verse eid="LUK 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />Abrami kewio wei doyo, ‘Piana ene anyau na weraung Musai soi kong nabi entoi pa. Impaina ya etong parari piwe enduru na weraung pa. <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Mana nyontarai we ne ra pau wadi kewio we Abrami doyo, ‘Yana maiya wa, Yai Abraham. Nyontarai we keda pei wieng taweri interi riawu yara, mamo ya entaweri warui ene sasaripa'. <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Abrami doyo, ‘Ea endoaoa wa anyau we Musai soi kong we na nabi paya, ya ingkai endoaoawa tato, nyontarai we keda wieng taweriea.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s">Piwe donane nyontarai etong sasari</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Mat. 18:6-7</ref>, 21-22; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Mrk. 9:42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Yesusi kewio we ne manarua wauya doyo, “Pi pau donane nyontarai nea ingkai enari sasari. Mana manaing we weetona nyontarai enari sasari paya! <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />We dong sasari toyana pai, piboki wei mamo engkae kamipei na raukanangpai mae engkai to rawanangrau. Imbaro donane koiri na we etua Yau ya, ei piaya wa esanesa Yau wa pe. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Impaina mempapi miaki!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">Parari menetapai dong sasari mamo mesuari, mae do anetaweri warui ne sasaripa mamo metupirandenia. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Mae parari dong sasari we mia we boitu na a koiri kong anemai ma ria wu miama kewio doyo, ‘Yau yewara metupirandeni yau,’ mamo metupirandeni.”<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Parari sisara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Rasuripaya engkawio we Yesusi etoyo, “Sen, bong amasanesarane paya“. <verse eid="LUK 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Yesusi kewio doyo, “Parari mendoaoapa baba parari sawi kami nei mamo, mengkawio we ainei tepating warui reine mae ria suwa na rawanangdau, mamo ainei ingkai rioao mia“.<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tuani kong woming</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />“Tuanpe koiri na mia ne womingpei, i deiwai ne pieung tutu ne romipa sisu rawandeng imbaromi teweri to manupa. Pipatotoi ne tuang wadi ingkai nyari roweang wei we dang rai e? <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Wereria rai! Mana ingkai kewio we ne woming wadi doyo, ‘Moraru wosung asung weweng, interi nuari roweang we yau. Imbaro au tato buampi ea. <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Woming wadi dong parari piwe ne tuang wadi doyoa wei wau na wemai, mana ne tuang wadi deparandini wa. Wo woming wadi pine riupa toapeina to. <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Parari mia tato piana metong pitau we etami mia weapa, mamo mentopana metoyo, ‘Ama wo woming di ama paina, amatong parari piwe amatonapa kuira'“.<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyontaraipe esura, Yesusi dosa empanang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Yesusi kong ne weetuari paya enda wu Yerusalemi na raora we dawe Samaria kong Galilea. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Na a we esuana awapei mamo nyontaraipe esura, weesui pado endawu Yesusi ma. Mana etoana woroi. <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />Interi esau Yesusi etoyo, “Yesuse! Tuanie! Anemoao amawo!”<verse eid="LUK 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Na awe Yesusi reo ya pa, kewio weya doyo, “Menda metanyau menetaraipa we imami paya. Enda rai mae na rang rabuang ene uipa panang warui ya. <verse eid="LUK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Nyontaraipe koiri na ya reoa we penang to, impaina teweri na mararising mae deparanding Sen Allai. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Interi nyontarai nei riama suang yomi na Yesusi renawau kong sopang piboki wei, nyontarai nini mamo nyontarai Samaria dina. <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Impaina Yesusi kewio doyo, “Nyontaraipe esura yati yong sa empanang to? Embe injatangpe yatino? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Pitoai donane nyontarai Yaudi wa nini memeari tewerima dong piboki we Allai nina?” <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Interi Yesusi kewio we nyontarai wadi doyo, “Towato, mae rua. Wo anemusara we Yau, donane wueng.”<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Awe Allai riama riu we mananu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 24:23-28, 36-41)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Nyontarai embe Farisi wau ea ya etutang Yesusi we apatotoi Allai riama riu we mananu pa. Yesusi daoa doyo, “Allai do riu we mananu ne kamang pea wa we mendeoapa, <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Impaina nyontarai ingkai entopana wa etoyo, ‘Mendama mendeo, andi nini!’ Ete, ‘Andi wani!’ Wo Allai piana riu we mananu wau ainai na menerabuampa kuira.”<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Interi Yesusi kewio we ne weetuari wauya doyo, “Ingkai rama a we na mia mesane kangkuna metoyo mendeo a koiri na Kumai Nyontarai riama wau mana mia metadutawa.” <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Ingkai nyontarai peaya engkawio we mia, ‘Mendea I nyai wana!’ Ete, ‘Mendema I nyai nina!’ Mendeo menda ampe. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Wo mai parari kewiewari we dea wieria na mandipi na wope koiri wu wope eaya, toyana tato na a we Kumai Nyontarai nei riama wane. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Mana pi yanapa tawa tantuma wami mamo, ingkai Kumai Nyontarai deiwau kong nyontarai na a we pui nina ingkai entampiri. <verse eid="LUK 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />Na a we Kumai Nyontarai teweri nai pai, parariapi na a we tawana Noaki a pampongpa. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Nyontarai etampi etunung, endau waweri ya, ra sisu awe Noaki yua wu ne ta weria baba mantaung we nyari pai rarong, interi poa baba pai dutu nu wadi mae miung nyontaraipaya kuira. <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />Nina tato parari a na Loti pa. Nyontarai etampi etunung, etawayang kong entantanang mae enari manu. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Mana awe Loti meti riawarui Sodomi, na a yanito adia kong kami adia wiana mandipi dosa emanaing kuira. <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Toyana tato we a yana parariapi na awe Kumai Nyontarai riama wane.<verse eid="LUK 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />Na a yani nyontarai we enai na manu wawuang paya, endeo embia we engko pi enei we wa na manu rarongpa pe. Kong we enai na romi paya tato endeo entaweri we engko pi enei we wa na manu rarongpa pe. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Mesaneao piwe dedu Loti wawinipa! <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Nyontaraipa matei di yemupa we derara wiengpa, ingkai wieng pa nai warui. Mae nyontaraipa matei di wengpa nai warui ingkai dedu wieng ki woroi-woroi. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Impaina etopana we mia: na dirupa nyontarai kodu urena kuira mana koiri engkori mae koiri wiata <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Nyontarai wawingpe kodu untuta potangpai kuira, koiri engkori mae koiri niai.” [<verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />Nyontaraipe kodu tato unai umariwa na romipa, koiri engkori mae koiri niai.”]<verse eid="LUK 17:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Weetuari paya etutang we Yesusi etoyo, “Na nu totoi pei pi nina ingkai denyauwapa? Yesusi doyo, “Na totoi wekadapa embatapa mamo aya wawai pa enai na peina.”<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s">Sosiau parari mananu wedong wemaiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Yesusi denyau ne weetuari wauya na sosiau nini, imbaro entandau pampang we Sen Allai kong endeo emadope. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Kewio doyo, “Na bendari pei mamo nyontarai wekiutu kawio pei, iwo metai Allai kong suang we nyontarai pei ea wa. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Interi na bendari wadi mamo wawing kabong pei, andi na a nemai ma ria wu wekiutu kawio wadima mae kewio doyo, ‘Bong wido pineune warui weembemarowa we yaune.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Manyona katea wekiutu kawio wadi deini. Mana interi kewio na anerarong doyo, Yauwo ematai Allai wa mae etuangbe nyontarai pei eawa. <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />Mana kabong nei ria pampangma reoria yaupa mamo, yong parari ne awapa, ekutu ne kawio pa na wemai imbaro reoria yau naria ea wa.”<verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Seni kewio doyo, “Mesanena pitoai mananu we meiwa nei sopanapa! <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />I wo nyontarai we kiutu kawio meiwa mana piata kabongpai, mamo Allai ne weweweng wau raweing we kiutu kawio pai. I ingkai piata nyontarai we diri ya pa, we esauwei pampang diru raida. Seni piana ingkai pika a ne warui ya we piata yapa. <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Mendoaoa! Wo Allai ingkai meraru piata ne nyontarai paya warui ene kawiopa! Mana a we Kumai Nyontarai nei ria wu nunei ma, piana ingkai dedu nyontarai peaya endoaoa we I ete wereria e?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sosiau parari nyontarai we riuri pe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Yesusi sopang sosiau nini we nyontarai we endetatua nyontarai peaya we etadu pi katuyanea wa, mae etoyo yati embengpa. <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />Yesus kewio doyo, “Nyontarai umbe kodu undawu Allai ne Manu we untandau. Eiwo nyontarai embe Farisi, eia iwo nyontarai weyau wiwai. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Nyontarai embe Farisi pai doa tendau mameari doa woroi warui ea wauya doyo, Sen Allai, yau yeparinding Au tutu yauwo eparari nyontarai tau eaya wa, we eserai we ene ra pa, yongamunawa, yona we ei ne wawing pei wa kong eparari weriuri wiwai nei wa. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Yau ewe puasa we kodu na ari mingku pei, kong na pi we yedutapa, yong perpuluampa we Au. <verse eid="LUK 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />Mana we riuri wiwai nei doana woroi, iwo metai kong ne barui pea we reto rora peidi. I dipu arokawei anetaweri mae doyo, ‘Sen Allaie, anemo yau nyontarai we yong sasari ne yau.’<verse eid="LUK 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Yesusi doyo, “Anemusara, na awe entaweri to manu wane pa mamo, weriuri pe wadi Allai anewenipa mae nyontarai Parisi wadiwo wereria. Nyontarai pa matei deparanding mantauni ingkai Allai piritoung, mae nyontarai pa matei saubaborai ingkai Allai riuwaria tedai.<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi myuang kumai wauya</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 19:13-15; Markusi 10:13-16)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Interi nyontarai we endama paya engko ene kumai mararia paya wu Yesusi, imbaro warawawu ya. Mana ne manarua wauya endeo piwawau paina esua nyontarai wauya. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Mana Yesusi yau kumai wauya interi kewio we ne weetuari wauya doyo, “Mempika kumaipa ya endawu yauma! Mae mendeo mesua yape. Tutu nyontarai yasa yati embe kawasa na Allai ne mananu rarongpa. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Ekawio kangkuna! Nyontarai mateidi demangwa we Allai ne mananu ne parari nyontarai kumai mararianei pa, i piana yua wa to Sen Allai ne mananu rarompa.”<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyontarai we nepi pau kong Allai ne mananu wau</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 19:16-30; Markusi 10:17-31)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Mananu Yaudi peandina dutang Yesusi doyo, “Kuru wuengpa au, pitoai yona imbaro yedu weweng piboki kio woroi-woroi wane pa?”<verse eid="LUK 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Interi Yesusi dutang taweriea doyo, “Pitoai wau yauwe ewengpa? Ei wiengba mantau Allaiki. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Piana remuaroang Allai ne anyau wauto, “Remo buena kong wawing pampinoma pe, remo mung nyontarai pe, remo monanapipe, remo weangkakaripe, mae tuang we tamamui kong nyamui.”<verse eid="LUK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Nyontarai wadi kewio doyo, “Arera tau wawau piana yong pararia na ewaworupa ma sisu a nina.”<verse eid="LUK 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Yesusi tarao towawau paina doyo, “Pi koiri andi imbere bonie ampa: Bowayang pitau we nemupa, bong pe pa we weengkiaripi paya, imbaro bodu ra wemai na rora-marising. Interi ruama bua yau. <verse eid="LUK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Mana na a we nyontarai wadi taraoa kawio we Yesusi sopana toyanapa mamo, anerarong papea tutu i wo ne pi barui paina.<verse eid="LUK 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Yesusi reo nyontarai wadi anerarong papea, tutu ne pi barui pa, wo sopang doyo, “Nyontarai ne pi pau pai, mawa wa we yua to Sen ne riu we Mananu rarong pa! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Mawa kia we untape koiri yuana wairui ne kambirei, warui nyontarai we nepi barui pei yua to Sen Allai ne riu we Mananu rarongpa“.<verse eid="LUK 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Nyontarai we entarao Yesusi kewio towawau ya etutang etoyo, “Toyana mamo mateidi ingkai dedu pariri pa?”<verse eid="LUK 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yesusi doyo, “Pi mawa wa we nyontarai etonapa, we Allai mamo mawa kia.”<verse eid="LUK 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Interi Petrusi doyo, “Yai e remuma! Ama piana amanda warui mandarong amane we amatua Au.”<verse eid="LUK 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Yesusi doyo, “Mendoaoa! Nyontarai we piana pika ne manupai, ne wawingpai, inyani, ne kumai paya tutu piata Allai, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />nyontarai yani ingkai Allai dona taweri wei pi pau raweina, na a nina kong na awe rama wane dedu wieng ki woroi-woroi.<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi kewio wetoru parari ne kaida wau</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 20:17-19; Markusi 10:32-34)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Yesusi penduikui nyontarai esura ea kodu we etuari wauya emeari, interi kewio doyo, “Mentaraoa! Tata nina tanda wu Yerusalemi. Na wana pitau we nabipaya entoi pararia we Kumai Nyontarai, ingkai tawa paraia. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />I wo ingkai empikari wu nyontarai we embe Yaudi wa ya, ingkai engkawioi, entatipari, kong engkanyukikai. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Ya ingkai etong pampinomi kong emuni, mana a wetorupai ingkai tewa warui kaidapa. <verse eid="LUK 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Mana weetua Yesusi paya esanekaeng kawio we Yesusi sopana wau. Ya enduinaria we aneaoapa wa. Kawio kapung wau denyuina wea.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Werepipu wadi Yesusi doni penang</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 20:29-34; Markusi 10:46-52)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Awe Yesusi ria kikeu we bendari Yeriko pai, werepipu pei meoi dewiewa na rang wadi arawapa. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Na yana tarao kawasa we empau wau enda engkawio impaina dutang doyo, “Pieape?”<verse eid="LUK 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Nyontarai na yana pei kewio doyo, “Oh! Yesusi nyontarai Nasaretipai piana ria na nina pa.”<verse eid="LUK 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Topianapa werepipu wadi yeau doyo, “Yesuse, Dauti ne kumaipa Au, Anemo yau“.<verse eid="LUK 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Nyontarai we na pong wauya empapayaoi mae etami aidini. Mana denana kangkuna ea doyo, “Dauti ne Kumaipa Au anemo yau!”<verse eid="LUK 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Yesusi doa weta, interi demi nyontarai pa engko werepipu wadi wuria. Ria kikeu Yesusi dutang doyo, <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />“Pitoi anembea yona we au pa?” Werepipu wadi rioa doyo, “Tuane, yau aneuwe erewoa.”<verse eid="LUK 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Interi Yesusi doyo, “Toyana mamo remoa! Tutu au roao Yau pa au ponang.<verse eid="LUK 18:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Na a peinato i reoa. Interi dua Yesusi mae deparanding Sen Allai. A we nyontarai tau paya endeoa pi we Yesusi nyari yana pa, eaya kuira etaparanding Sen Allai tato.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s">Zakeusi kong Yesusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Yesusi yua na bendari Yerikho, ria rire rang na bendari yani. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Na yana nyontaraipei anong pei Zakeusi, iwo mananu weyau wiwai kong ne ra barui. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />I ane we reo Yesusi, mana nyontarai paya empau mae mantauni wo tedaiwa, impaina dosaera we reo Yesusi mana reoi wa. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Impaina depai pampong nyontarai we empau paya, interi wieita na aipei, imbaro reo Yesusi we ingkai riakutua na peina ma. <verse eid="LUK 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Interi Yesusi ria kikeu ai wadi, reaeio Zakeusi, kewio wei doyo, “Zakeusie! Wia moraru maweu, wo yo erama eyua konta au na nemu manu pai.” <verse eid="LUK 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Impaina Zakeusi wia warui ai wadi, interi demang we Yesusi na mararising. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Kawasa tau we endeo we toyana paya engkawio uara mae etoyo, “Ye! Pitoi dona, ria yua to nyontarai we sasari ne manu pai pa?”<verse eid="LUK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Mana Zakeusi tewara doa kewio we Yesusi doyo, “Yai Sen e! Piwe neu ne, eai ewiwobaua we kodu we engkiari pi paya, mae parari ea yati eweangkari ya na a we rangpa ingkai yona taweri wemanua weya.” <verse eid="LUK 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Interi Yesusi kewio doyo, “Na a nei au kong mandarong nemu nei, Allai riuwa mia warui ne moyawa pa, tutu autato Abarami tapung diau. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Wo Kumai Nyontarai nei, riama we yera kong riuwa nyontarai etong sasaripa warui ene sasaripa.<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sosiau parari woming we embeng kong woming emoyawa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mat. 25:14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Na yana nyontarai we empau eto entarao Yesusi kewio wau rai. Tutu I piana kikeu Yerusalemi, impaina nyontarai ne etorato Allai riu we mananu na nunei piana kikeu to. Impaina Yesusi kewio nariaea na sosiau pei. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Yesusi kewio doyo, “Nyontarai nyapong peana i riato nu weworoi we enduwari we mananu, interi teweri ea. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Donta wami mamo yau ne we empatari pe esura, interi i dong pe mina pa koiri-koiri tate ya. Doyo, ‘Metawayang na pe nina kio etaweri ema.’ <figure style="fig" alt="uang mina" file="HK00168B.TIF" size="col" ref="19.13">pe mina</figure><verse eid="LUK 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Mana kawasa we enai na nu yani esane uniwa. Na a we donta rampai, etanatu nyontarai peaya enda tuwari imbaro entopana we mananu na yana pai etoyo, ‘Ama, amamaidai nyontarai ninipai we mananu we amape.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />Mana nyontarai nyapong wadi enduwari we mananu baba, interi teweri wu nu nempai ema. Demi nyontarai esau ne woming etawayang ne pe pa, ma esarotari tutu pe we dona weya pa, imbaro dutang ya we pe bototoai etadutapa. <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Woming we pempongma pai doyo, ‘Tuane, pe mina koiri we bonipai yoni wedaya pe minape ura.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Mananupai kewio wei doyo, ‘Piboki kia, auwo woming we bosaiwa pi di au. Impaina piana muaya na piwe maiyapato, topiyana eruwarau rukui bendari ura ne.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Woming bokodu wadi ria ema doyo, ‘Tuane, pe mina koiri we bonipai eyoni wedaya boring.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Mananunei kewio we nyontarai wadi doyo, ‘Auwo rukui bendari boring.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />Interi woming wetorunei riama doyo, ‘Tuane, pe mina koiri pai anini, ekawuni na asung rabuang. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Tutu yau wo ematai tuani au, tutu auwo nyontarai we nemu kawio paya. Auwo ko piwe mantau nemuwa peawa kong ruri piwe mantau tuanang peawa. <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Mananu wadi kewio doyo, ‘Auwo woming we moiwa! Yau ingkai yong mambabati we au parari kawio we topanapa. Auwo piana anemuaoa yau wo nyontarai ekawio paya, yau eko piwe mantau neu peawa kong eruri piwe etanangwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Toyana mamo na a yani neu pe pa bona wana banki, imbaro na a we etaweri manina eko pe yani kong ne we dawing eampa. <verse eid="LUK 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />Interi mananu wadi kewio we nyontarai we etoa na yanapa doyo, ‘Mengko pe mina koiri yanipai warui mae metoni we nyontarai we ne pe urapai'. <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Mana nyontarai paya engkawio wei etoyo, ‘Tuane, i piana ne pe ura.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />Mananu wadi kewio doyo, “Etopana we mia joyo, ‘Nyontarai we dosaiwa piwe etona weipa mamo ingkai etona pau raweina ea wei. Mae nyontarai we dosaiwa pi nei we dedutapa wa mamo, piwe wata kontipa ingkai engko warui. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Mae na ninato mengko we embe marowa we yau paya ma we eto emaidai ewe mananu pa. Memungsa engkai na reunane!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kawasa na Yerusalemi etamang we Yesusi na mararising</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-9">Mat. 21:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-10">Mrk. 11:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-15">Yoh. 12:12-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Yesusi kewio sosiau pei weya, interi ria topong to Yerusalemi. I ria pampong na wapong, mae ea paya etuari. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Ria kikeu awa Betfage kong Betania na wi Zaituni, demi ne manarua pa kodu unda pampong. <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />Yesusi kewio doyo, “Munda wu awa we na musaropong na wane, munda musua na wana mamo, ingkai mundeo keledai menanang pei wai kei. Keledai yani nyontarai esanai wami. Mungketu waipai mungkorima. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Parari nyontarai pei dutang maru doyo, ‘Pitoi dona mungketu keledai yani pa?’ Muntopana muroyo, ‘Seni aneweipa.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Interi nyontarai kodu we demi asaru, uraduta parari pitau we Sen sopana we asarupa. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Uro ungketu keledai wadi mamo, we nei wadi kewio we asaru ma doyo, pitoi dona mengketu keledaipai pa? <verse eid="LUK 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Interi asaru uroyo, “Seni anewei.” <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Impaina ungko keledaipai wu Yesusia. Interi umporare une asung baba pa urona wana keledai karupuang wadi, mae undupata Yesusi wieita nai. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Na yana Yesusi yao keledai pai mae riatuturi, interi nyontarai paya emboi ene asung baba pa na rang rarong pa. <verse eid="LUK 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Piana ria kikeu we Yerusalemi, na rang we depai toung na wi Zaituni pai, marandang we duaripai emararising mae esomi Sen Allai na endaupui wuwara tutu pitau we donapa rama endeoapa. <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />Interi endoa etoyo, “Amataparanding Au, mananu we rua na Sen anongpa! Madori na rora-marising kong amasomi we Allai au na raora wetadai!” <verse eid="LUK 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Nyontarai embe Farisi peaya etua we empau pa ya engkawio etoyo, “Kuruie, wua nemu weetua Aupa ya aidisa.” <verse eid="LUK 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Yesusi kewio weya doyo, “Etopana we mia, nyontarai nea aidisa mamo ingkai kamine etanana.” <verse eid="LUK 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Interi Yesusi ria kikeu na Yerusalemi, I reo bendari wadi interi yai wei. <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />Yesusi kewio doyo, “Aroo! Piboki keto na a nei mamo au remuaroang we kio we madoripa! Mana ninawo piana we madori anyuing warui auto. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Ingkai a wau rama, na yana we embemarowa we au etariwari au ya etong ami wari au. Ya ingkai etong amuna topong na kapungpa kai. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Yerusalemi! Ya ingkai etong aua wemunamunai, mae emung kawasa nemu paya kuira, kong empika kami pa koiri entauwi na duenang pai wa. Nina denyauwa tutu au remuaroangna wa, a we Allai riama we periri aupa.<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi yua to Sen ne Manu pai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Mat. 21:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-18">Mrk. 11:15-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-16">Yoh. 2:13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Interi Yesusi yua to Allai ne Manu pai mae I dedawa nyontarai we etawayang na manu wararei pai. <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />Yesusi kewio weya doyo, “Na Weraung Mamarang pai entoi tonina, Allai doyo, ‘Neu Manu wadi wo Manu we entandaunai dina. Mana mia metoni we manu mananapi.” <verse eid="LUK 19:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Anemai mamo Yesusi denyau na Allai ne Manupai. Na yana we embedung na imami kong kuru akama Yaudi, we embe mananu we Yaudi esanewe emuni. <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />Mana ya etadu rang peawe etimung Yesusi wa, wo nyontarai we empau enai kiriari paya esanewe entarao kawio we sopanapa.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s">We embe mananu we Yaudi paya etutang parari Yesus ne paya pa.</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 21:23-27; Markusi 11:27-33)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Na a pei, Yesusi denyau kong wiuwu Kawio Mararisingpa we kawasa na Allai ne Manupai. Denyau toyana ma we embedung we imami paya, kuru akama Yaudi paya, kong mananu Yaudi paya, enda wu Yesusia <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />mae engkawio wei etoyo, “Topana we ama, na matei anongpa nuari pitau ninipa? Matei di dong paya we Aupa?”<verse eid="LUK 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Yesusi daoa weya doyo, “Yau tato yo yutang mia. Mentopana we Yau, <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />na awe Yoanesi webaptisi kawasapai, na paya matei? Na paya Allai ete na paya nyontaraipei e?”<verse eid="LUK 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Impaina etutang waweriya wea etoyo, “Tatoyo, ‘Na paya Allai,’ I ingkai doyo, ‘Toyana mamo, pitoai mendoaoawa wei pa?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Mana parari tatoyo, ‘Na paya nyontarai, mamo kawasa tau ingkai eso tata na kami, wo endoaoa we Yoanesi nabi dina.” <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Impaina endeoa we Yesusi etoyo, “Amasaneaoa wa.”<verse eid="LUK 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Interi Yesusi kewio weya doyo, “Toyana mamo Yau tato etopana we miawa, na paya matei enari pitau nini pa.”<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sosiau parari we etong romi angguri</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 21:33-46, <ref loc="LUK 22:15-22">22:15-22</ref>; Markusi 12:1-17)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Yesusi sopana we nyontaraipaya sosiau nini, doyo, “Nyontaraipei sanang ne romi angguri pei.<figure style="fig" alt="buah anggur" file="HK00111B.TIF" size="col" ref="20.9">Angguri bong</figure></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:9">Interi doni wu nyontarai peaya we etawuti kio romi we tarai mamo, ingkai tambiwo bau tarai wau. Impaina donta to raora peaya kong nyaina yana woroi kia. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Na a we etetang angguri wadipa, tuanio wene romi wadi demi ne mampata pei donta wu we etawu ne romipai ya we kio ne tuani wadi nempa. Mana weetawu romipai ya endora wepatara wadi mae etami teweri na warakakawiri. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Interi weneromi wadi demi mampatara koiri naria ea, mana endorai konti mae ekangkani kangkuna interi etami teweri na warakakawiri ea. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Weneromi wadi demi mampata wetoru pai naria ea. Mana mampata yani tato endorai kangkuna kong engkabariri tori warui romi pai. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Interi weneromi pai doyo, ‘Yong pitotoi naria ea pa? Yemi mantau neu kumai we aneuweni nei. Ingkai esomi wei rai!’ <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Mana weetawu romipai ya, endeo weneromi nei ne kumai pai, impaina entopang waweriya etoyo, ‘Kumai we ingkai dedu tamani pinengpa andi nini, tamunia keda imbaro tatadu pine ne.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Impaina entapuri engkori tori warui romipai mae emunia keda.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">Interi Yesusi dutang doyo, “Impaina, weneromipai teweri ma, ingkai dong pitoi weya pa? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />I ingkai riama miung weetawu romipai paya, mae doni we ea embeiya ea.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Kawasa na yana pa entarao pi Yesusi sopanapa, impaina entopana we Yesusi etoyo, “Topitotoio wengki!”<verse eid="LUK 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Yesusi reo ya interi doyo, “Toyana mamo, Sen ne Weraung Mamarang ne rirang we riotu tonina pa, parari pitoi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">‘Kami weenari manu paya engkaipiri pai, ria ea we kami retenang to.’ <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Masmuri 118:22-23 </char></note><verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Kawasa tau we entawa to kamipai ingkai embe munamunai. Kong matei di kamipai sawa miuni pa, i ingkai tepapesing ea we wawu.”<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Kuru akama Yaudi paya kong we embedung we imami paya, endeaoa we sosiau yani riotu weya. Dona mamo eto entapu Yesusi na a' yani pato, mana ematai kawasa tau paya. <verse eid="LUK 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Impaina eserai a' we mai we etintapuri. Embai nyontarai we etosayara parari nyontarai we empiboki, mae etami nyontarai yasa we etutang autang pea we Yesusi. Imbaromi kewio arara mamo etimburi wu Mananu Gubernuri. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Interi nyontarai embaiti pai kewio we Yesusi doyo, “Yai Kuruie! Amasaneoa we pitau Yai topanapa kong bonyawapa pi wetarai pina. Amasaneoa tato we Yai bonyau na mai parari pi Allai daoa we nyontarai neya pa, wo Au kowio mamo tou nyontarai wa. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Impaina Yai topana we ama, parari arera na akama tanempai mamo, tambai wiwai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pe nei mamo tatongni we tambai p</char></note> we Kaisari ete wereria e?”<verse eid="LUK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Mana Yesusi rebauo ene wasireripa. Aidonapa sopang doyo, <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />Metanyauwa we Yau pe mina pei, interi I dutang taweri weya doyo, “Matei enduruwi nini kong anong peo?” Etoyo, “Kaisari dina.”<verse eid="LUK 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Yesusi doyo, “Toyana mamo, metona we Kaisari pi Kaisari nempa, kong we Allai pi Allai nempa.”<verse eid="LUK 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Mae na kawasa renawau etaduara piea wa we etimbu Yesusi. Impaina aidisa mae esarokutuya we Yesusi ne daoa wau.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyontarai embe Saduki etutang parari nyontarai esuwi warui kaida wau.</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 22:23-33; Markusi 12:18-27)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Nyontarai embe Saduki peaya, enda wu Yesusi ma. Ea mamo endoaoa we nyontarai engkada paya esuwi wa. Etutang Yesusi etoyo, <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />“Yai Kuruie! Musai soi kawio nina we tata doyo, ‘Muangpei didau, mana dawing kumai pei wa mae keda, mamo netapai riau ne kabongpai imbaro dawing kumai pei we neta baba we piana keda pai.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ul 25:5 </char></note><verse eid="LUK 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Netape embeitu. Neta baba pai riauti, interi keda mana ne kumai pei wa. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Impaina kabongpai riau neta kodupai ea, mana neta yani tato keda mae ne kumaipei wa. <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />Pi towawau dedu neta toru pai ma sisu neta itu pai. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Interi wawing wadi keda tato. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Na a we nyontarai engkada esuwi na ene kaida pa, na mambeneta itu paya, matei di ne wawing pai pa? Wo wawing wadi riau neta embeitu ya pa.”<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yesusi daoa weya doyo, “Nyontarai enai na nunei nini ya endidau, <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />mana na awe ramapa toyana wa. Wo nyontarai we Allai anesu yapa, ingkai esuwi kong enai na nu we riama yani pai, ea tato endidau wa. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Emparari mampang, kong engkada wa. Yatino Allai Antung diya, wo piana esuwi warui ene kaida pa to. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Parari nyontarai eyuwi warui kaida wau, Musai denyawa na kawio soi parari papea dangpai, i yau Sen pai we Allai Abrahami, Allai Isaki kong Allai Yakupi'.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kel 3:16 </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Toyana mamo denyawa we Allai wadi, Allai na nyontarai weengkeda wauya wa, wo Allai we nyontarai we embengpa ya! Wo Abarami itoru itorarang itomayoi na rora-marising pai to. Tutu we Allai, nyontarai nea tantenang embeng.<verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Kuru akama Yaudi peaya etoyo, “Yai Kuruie! Kawio topanapa piboki kia.” <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Impaina ene paya peawa we etutang Yesusi naria ea.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kawio parari Yesusi, Mananu Pariri dina.</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 22:41-46; Markusi 12:35-37)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Yesusi dutang weria weya doyo, “Topitotoi pa nyontarai etoyo Mananu Pariri nei mamo Dauti ne Kumai dina? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Mana Dauti mantauni sopang na ne Arera Masmuri doyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">‘Sen Allai kewio we neu Senpai doyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42">Moyoi na warau dowatangne,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Meyoi na dowatang, parari Yaudi ne ya mamo, nyontarai we entuang wei wo mananu dina.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />kio Yong nemu marowa paya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:43">etuang esomi na renawau.”'<verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Impaina Dauti yau Mananu Pariri pai we ‘Seni', topitotoi pa etanyauwa we I ria na ne woriai Dauti pa?<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arera we esaneapong we Kuru Akama paya.</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 23:5-7; Markusi 12:38-40)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Kawasa tau entarao Yesusi kewio wau ma, I sopang we ne manarua wauya doyo, <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />“Mesaneapong we kuru akama Yaudi paya. Ea mamo esane we esasung asung pampang pa enda na nu we kawasa empau pa, imbaro kawasa esomi weya. Ea kong esane we emayoi na kadera pong pa na manu esomi nai pa kong na manu munara pa. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Embe angkari kabong paya we engko pi enengpa. Engkawung ene sambamboni pa na entandau woroi kia! Nyontarai entoyasa ingkai etadu we mambabati raweina na Seni warui ea ya.”<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s">Pikika na wawing kabong</para>
  <para style="r">(Markusi 12:41-44)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Na Sen ne Manu Mamarangpai, Yesusi reo nyontarai we ene pi wepau paya esoni pikika enempa na kayang pikika pai. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />I tato reo wawing kabong we nepiewa pei yoni pe kobang kodu na kayang pai. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Interi Yesusi kewio doyo, “Pitarai, ekawio we mia joyo, wawing kabong we ne pieawa nei, we donapa wake pau raweing warui nyontarai tau wasa kuira. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Tutu ya kuira etong pikika na piene wepaupa, mae wawing kabongnei dona na ne piea wa pa, kong dong piwe nempa kuira.”<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi kewio kamang Sen ne Manu ingkai metota</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 24:1-2; Markusi 13:1-2)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Na yanapa nyontarai pea yati etaparanding Sen ne Manu pai ne wiengpa. Etoyo, Manu Mamarangpai wieng antumba, emarandini na kami we waweria kong pitau we weanong etona we pikika we Allai pa. Mamo Yesusi kewio weya doyo, <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />“Na a' wane pitau we mendeoi nini ingkai nyontarai entotaia menaing, mae andi kami koiri wiatiana kamipei wawong nea wa.<figure style="fig" alt="Tuhan Allah punya Rumah di Yerusalem" file="LB00250B.TIF" size="col" ref="21.6">Sen Allai Ne Manu na Yerusalemi</figure><verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi kewio parari piwe tawa na a we pui wana</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 24:3-14; Markusi 13:3-13)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Interi Yesusi ne weetuari etutani etoyo, “Kuruie! Apa totoikai we toyana ingkai tawa pararia pa? Kong pitoai we kamang parari we toyana tawapa?” <verse eid="LUK 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Yesusi kewio doyo, “Mesaneapong kong metamangki, wo donane ea embeangkari miape. Nyontarai empau endama embo anoune, mae etoyo, ‘Mampariri we metamamanipi di Yau!’ Kong a nei maito.’ Mana mendeo mendoao ya pe. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Mae mentarao arera parari kawasa emusa kong embemarowa waweria weya mamo mendeo memataipe. Taubai nina andi tawa pampongwo. We toninane mentaraoa mana nunei menaing peina wami.” <verse eid="LUK 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Interi Yesusi kewio naria ea doyo, “Ingkai, mandarong pea engkong mandarong pea ea emung waweria, kong negara pea kong negara pea ea emung waweria. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Na wana nina ingkai mundi baba weriu, piwawi kong ui miung kawasa tau. Ingkai na rora tawa kamang baba we dong nyontarai ematai kia. <verse eid="LUK 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />Mana tau nina tawa pararia wami, ingkai entapu mia kong etamei mia. Mae ingkai etutang aera mia na manu nyontarai Yaudi esomi nai kong etong miato wangka rarong. Nyontarai ingkai engko miato mananu paya kong we endu wang mananu paya, tutu mia metua Yau. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Wetopiana pa we rang we mia imbaro membuwu Arera we Mai na Allai pa. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Mengkutu na mesanararong we mesanekaeng wa we pi mentopana we memati warui we etimbu miapa. <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />Tutu mantau Yau ingkai yong kurayang we mia we mengkawio, imbaro we embemarowa we mia enebarui pea we etimba kawio we mentopana pa wa. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Mae ingkai mene paituang paya, menetapaya, mandarong meneng paya kong we mempandu mia paya, embo mia wu nyontarai weembemarowa we mia pa, kong ingkai eaya na mia emung ya. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Nyontarai ingkai esaneung mia tutu metua Yau paina. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Mana menduandaungpa koiri na mendukamipa nyai wa. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Impaina mia mempaya na mendoaoapa na menduenang aiwaraki, mamo ingkai mia membempa.”<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi kewio kamang parari bendari Yerusalemi menaing wau</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 24:15-21; Markusi 13:14-19)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />“Na awe mendeo Yerusalemi we pimamuna paya esoriwari, mamo piana mesaneaoa we a wawau kekiu we bendari wadi we munamunai. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Na a yani, we menai na Yudea membawu to raora wewipa. Mae mia we menai na bendari Yerusalemi andi memati warui bendari yani. Kong mia we menai na bendari ripai, mendeo mesua taweri eampe. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Tutu a yani pai mamo, a we Allai ingkai dong mambabati wu Yerusalemi pai yana, imbaro taubai we nabi pa entoi na arerapa tarai pararia to. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Na awe didiwapa tawa tantuma pa, wemoyawa pitarai we wawing we etaiyoa kong we etong u we ene kumai paya! Ya ingkai etaiwau tutu emawa we etapaiwa. Nu nini ingkai dedu aseung we baba, tutu Sen ingkai denyau ne kayoupa we rai wadi. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Madupei yati ingkai emusa na sondu, mae madupei tato engko ya we endukepasa to raora nyontarai we embe Yaudi wa. Interi kawasa yasa tato we endeweroan Seniwa ya ingkai embido Yerusalemi kio a we Sen derekamana weya wau kai.”<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kamang we Kumai Nyontarai riama wane.</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 24:29-31; Markusi 13:24-27)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />Ingkai na wo pai, yembai pai kong na piori pa, tandeo kamangpea nai. Mae kawasa engkai na nunei, ematai kong esaneao we esarota tarowa rawanang we baba uira ingkai rotu parari kaidu. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Nyontarai ingkai ematai kia tutu esane riru we piwe tawa tantuma na nunei, wo we embe mananu enduwai papusi na rora ingkai we ampamponia. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Na a yani nyontarai na nunei endeo Kumai Nyontarai ne Yau, erama na mandipi rarong, kong donung na paya mae kong dea mamarang ria wieria. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Mae na awe pi yana pa do tawa tantuma, mentawa mae mesanerarong maitui, tutu woroiwa mae Allai periri mia!”<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Interi Yesusi kewio na sosiau nini doyo, “Mendeo ai ara nei kong ai totoi eampa. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Mamo mia mendeoa ai weraungpa tendu mae diana ea yana mamo, mantau mesaneaoa we maring wadi doriama kikeuto. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Yanapa mamo mia mendeo kamang yana tawa', menduradiduing a we Allai ne mananu na nunei piana kikeuto. <verse eid="LUK 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />Piwe etopana nina wepitarai: Nyontarai na awa pui nina ne engkada engkai wami, mae kamang we tonina tawa pampong. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Rora kong nunei ingkai nai, mana Sen ne anyau ne wata we yuwisopisoane.”<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Metamang anemai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />“Metamamang! Mendeo memananai na roi kong memaeru pe, mae mendeo mesaneriru we pi metaduta anemaipa, imbaro na a wane tawa tantuma mamo piana metamang to. <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />Wo a wane rama ingkai tantuma miung nyontarai na nunei engkai. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Impaina metamamang! Mae mentandau anemai imbaro mempaya metamang mae mentapira warui piwe ingkai tawa mamo, miawo memai metoa metamang na Kumai Nyontarai renawau.”<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Yesusi denyau na Allai ne Manu wadi na raida, mae na diru I riato Wi Zaituni mae nyaina yana. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Na ayarima wau mai, nyontarai enda to Allai ne Manu pai we entarao Yesusi denyau wau.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s">Apa we emung Yesusi</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 26:1-5, 14-16; Markusi 14:1-2, 10-11; Yohanesi 11:45-53)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Anani baba roti weragi wa, weesawi we Paska, dokikeuto. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />We embedung we imami kong kuru akama Yaudi paya esanetatuata eserai rang we emung Yesusi aididina, tutu ematai wawido nyontarai we empau wauya engkayou kong etoamuna.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yudasi wio Yesusi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat. 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mrk. 14:10-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Interi Nyombatang wadi yepopa Yudasi, we esawi konta na anong Iskarioti, i tato koiri na we esura ea kodu we etua Yesusipaya. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Tutu Yudasi ria kewio mai kong we embedung we imami kong maninuing na Sen ne Manu, we kewio mai kosa, we pika Yesusi weya. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Ya emararisingkia mae etarekamana we etong pe wei. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Yudasi rioa oa kong yerai rang we pika Yesusi weya na aidina, imbaro we empaupa enduinariawa.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Enduasasoni we anani Paska</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 26:17-19; Markusi 14:12-16)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Interi a wau ra mai we a retenang na anani Roti weragi wa, na a we ea engkutu pieung domba Paska. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Impaina Yesusi demi Petrusi kong Yoanisi asaru doyo, “Munda munari roweang Paska wau manyena we tata.” <verse eid="LUK 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Impaina untopana we Yesusi naria ea uroyo, “Na totoi Yai bomi andu we urong roweang wau manyenapa?” <verse eid="LUK 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Yesusi doyo, “Na awe musua to bendaripai, muang we kio karabasapei we yoni maria nai ingkai muraduti, muruari wu manu we yuanai pai, <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />mae muntopana we wene manu wadi muroyo: Kurui dutang we au, ‘Na rerawuanipa totoi Yau kong neu weetua Yau nea ingkai amatang Paska nai pa?’ <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Tuan we ne manu wadi denyau rerawuani na padai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Padai “nina mamo etingtatua na manu Yaudi enempina we empandua weentadau nai.”</char></note> we menyena tutu piwawinta. Na yana murong roweang Paskapa ra manyena na wana.” <verse eid="LUK 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Topiana Petrus kong Yoanisi unda uraduta parari we Yesusi sopana wau. Interi asaru urong roweang Paska waua manyena.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kamang anani mamarang na Diru</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 26:20-29; Markusi 14:17-25; Yohanesi 13:21-30)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Ra dedu a yani wo sawa ra berorang to we eto etang roweang Paska pai, Yesusi mioi kong ne nyontarai uraya kodu we etuari paya, na rerawuani perjamuan wadi. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Interi kewio wu ya doyo, “Eyaseune ramawami mae aneuweakia we yang roweang Paska ne kong mia kuira. <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Tutu mentarama! Yau wo yang roweang Paska ninane wa, kio ra sisu piwe denyauwa parari roweang Paska nini ingkai tawa pararia na a we Allai riama riu we Mananu pa.”<figure style="fig" alt="Yesus makan Paskah bersama murid-muridNya" file="WA03909b.tif" size="col" ref="22.16">Yesusi dang roweang Paskah pai kong ne weetuari wauya</figure><verse eid="LUK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Interi Yesusi riuwa nyopi esoni angguri pai, mae tendauoa dewa piboki kong Allai, interi doyo, “Mengko nina mae membiwo mai mia. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Tutu mesaneaoa: Na anei Yau yunung angguri nei wa, kio Allai riuwe mananu ne rama denyauwa na nunei. <verse eid="LUK 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Interi kio roti mae tendauoa dewa piboki we roti wau, interi piobabau roti na warang wau dona dimbiwoya mae doyo, “Neutaraipi nini, andi yoni yimpariri mia. Metong pinina we metingtaroang Nyau.” <verse eid="LUK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Topiyana tato etampia kai dong nyopi angguri wu weetuari wau ya mae doyo, “Nyopi angguri nini arera Allai we waworu, we kemang kepana na ne ria pai, ai tawowu we mia. <verse eid="LUK 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />Mana mendeoa! Nyontarai wio Yau pi meoi dampi kong Yaune. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Kumai Nyontarai ingkai keda parari Allai kiutu pa, mana moyawa we nyontarai wewiowi pai. <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Interi etutang waweria etoyo, “Matei na ya ingkai dong wetoyana pa.”<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aminduya we matei beba raweina na yapa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Na weetua Yesusi wauya, mantau etaminduya we matei beba raweingna na yapa. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Yesusi kewio weya doyo, “Kawasa we endearoang Seni wa ene mananu paya, endu ene kawasapaya na paya. Mae kawasapaya esau ene Mananu paya we empata kawasa. <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Mana mia mamo mentopiyana wa, tutu ei dobeba na mia mamo ria meia ea, kong do dara mia mamo ria wemampata. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Matei di beba raweina pa, we meoi dampi na meja pai, ete we wesarawiri pai e? Tasaneao wemeoi dampi pai. Mana enai na mene madu nina ne ewemampata. <verse eid="LUK 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />Mia wo menai kepang kong Yau na neu weaseungne. <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />Topiyana Yau ingkai yong paya nina we mia membe mananu kong Yau, parari Yai piana dona we Yau, paya we erune. <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />Topiyana mia tato mengkonta memararising kong Yau, na a we ewe mananu pa. Mae mia ingkai memayoi na pata mananu uraya kodupa, we metindu marandang uraya kodu Israeli paya.<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petrusi ingkai piora Yesusi</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 26:31-35; Markusi 14:27-31; Yohanesi 13:37-38)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />Yesusi kewio we Petrusi doyo, Simon, Simoni, taramuma! Nyombatang piana dewarakong Seni we sou mia, parari diri pasibu tarai warui rerawa pai, impaina we wieng pai diri warui we yunawa. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Mana piana etandau we auto imbaromi anemusarao Yau pampang. Mae Nyombatang wadi sou aupa akai, au toweri roaoa pitarai weapi Yau, imbaro puami nemetai ya we esanesarapa.” <verse eid="LUK 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Petrus kewio doyo, “Sen Au, yau emanyena we erakontau pampang, eyua bui ete emung nyau kontauo yuarau.” <verse eid="LUK 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Mana Yesusi kewio we Petrusi doyo, “Petruse, ekawio weau, pitarai topino, ayarima ketua we mangkuei etona wami, piana pora Yau we botoruto.”<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Biningkeni, kaketa ete sondu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Impaina Yesusi kewio we ne nyontarai uraya kodu paya doyo, “Mesaneaoa, na a we yemi mia membuwu kawio wewengpa, mengko biningkeni wa, kaketa wa, ete sapatu wa, na yanapa metadu we aseung pea wa e?” Mana engkawio etoyo, “Wereria.” <verse eid="LUK 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Interi Yesusi kewio weya naria ea doyo, “Mana na a nini, na mia matei ne biningkeni pei ete kaketa mamo mengko. Kong mate au nemu sondupei wa mamo, membo mene asungpa ea we membori sondupei. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Wo mendoaoaki, waya na Weraung Mamarang nini riotu topinina, ‘I esaneatori we nyontarai wememuna dina.’ Kawio parari Yau nina, ingkai wetarai pararia ki. Wo pipatotoi entoi kamana na Weraung Mamarangpai, yeduta na a ninato.” <verse eid="LUK 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Interi ya engkawio etoyo, “Sen, sondu pe kodu ainina.” I kewio doyo, “Mainato!”<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi tendau na wi Zaituni</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 26:36-46; Markusi 14:32-42)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Interi parari siripa, Yesusi kong ne manarua paya empika Yerusalemi mae endato wi Zaituni. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Enda sisu raora yani, I kewio weya doyo, “Mentandau imbaro mia kuira metong sasari pa na awe nyombatang wadi aneangkari miapa.” <verse eid="LUK 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Interi Yesusi ria woroi katea warui ne weetuari wauya, waketo sara woroipa piareia ura. Na yana suang tendau doyo, <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />“Yai au muaya mamo, ko mambabati nini pa warui Yau; mae parari we aneuaoane wa, mana parari Yai anemuaoa pa.” <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Interi mampang koiri riawuri ma, dong paya wei. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Yesusi ruradiduing didiwa we mambabati na anerarong pa, impaina tendau pitarai. Awiang wau parari ria we yero tekakutu to kakopa wadi. <verse eid="LUK 22:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Yesusi tendaua kai interi teweri wu ne manarua paya. I ria taweri mamo dedu ya embaetena tutu etaidu paina. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Interi Yesusi kewio we ya doyo, “Pitoi dona metenapa? Mentawa kong mentandau imbaro mendeo metadu auwape.”<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Entapu Yesusi</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 26:47-56; Markusi 14:43-50; Yohanesi 18:1-11)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Yesusi kewio rai mamo, nyontarai we empau paya endama. Yudasi di wedung naya endama ne. Yudasi tato kiong nyontarai etua Yesusi paya. Yudasi ria kikeu Yesusi, interi wopeoi. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Mana Yesusi kewio wei doyo, “Yudase, impaina wompemo yau nina mamo wo Kumai Nyontarai ne Yau e?” <verse eid="LUK 22:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Interi weetua Yesusi weenai na yanapa endeo piwe ingkai tawa tantuma, ya engkawio etoyo, “Sen, amatamang we amatoamuna na sondu!” <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Interi nyontaraipe koiri naya yuara doamuna, sekutu Imami Baba pai ne woming pai tarakambirei paia tekutu. <verse eid="LUK 22:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Mana Yesusi kewio doyo, “Wento!” Interi I dekara samu nyontarai wadi tarakambirei wadi mae doni penang. <verse eid="LUK 22:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Interi Yesusi kewio we weembedung na Imami wauya, we embe maninuing na Allai ne Manu, kong nyontarai mananu Yaudi, we endama we entapuri wau ya doyo, “Metorato Yauwo nyontarai we emoyawa e? Impaina mendama mengko sondu kong aisoi nina e? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Anemai mamo enai kong mia na Allai ne Manu, mana mentapu Yauwa. Mana a menempeinato, kong a berorang we Nyombatang denyau paya nempa peina to.”<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petrusi piora Yesusi</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 26:57-58, 69-75; Markusi 14:53-54, 66-72; Yohanesi 18:12-18, 25-27)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Interi ya entapu Yesusi, engkori to manu Imami Baba pai. Mae Petrusi duaya na woroi. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Na manu wararei piana enduri adia pei mae Petrusi ria meoi kosa, kong nyontarai we emayoi wari adia paya. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Nyontarai woming wawingpei perama Petrusi meoi kikeu adia wadi, impaina kewio doyo, “Nyontarai ninipai tato dua Yesusi.” <verse eid="LUK 22:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Mana Petrusi piora Yesusi doyo, “Yau ereuaroang nyontarai yani kateawa!” <verse eid="LUK 22:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Woroi wami, nyontarai pei wieiya reo Petrusi interi kewio doyo, “Au tato bua nyontarai wani.” Mana Petrusi doyo, “Wereria, yau wa!” <verse eid="LUK 22:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Wake saraka riora we koiri naria ea mae, nyontarai pei weiya ea kewio kangkuna, “Tarai, nyontarai nini tato dua Yesusi, wo i mamo nyontarai Galilea dina.” <verse eid="LUK 22:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Mana Petrusi doyo, “Tamane, yau wo aneukaeng piwe tamani topanapa.” Ayanito, na kewio rai mamo, mangkuei dona. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Interi Yesusi dedai weria reo Petrusi. Mamo Petrusi aneao Sen kawio we piana sopana weipa, “Mangkuei dona na anei, au piana pora yau we botoru.” <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Interi Petrusi meti warui yana mae yaia miungbaweri.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyontarai etamei Yesusi</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 26:63-68; Markusi 14:60-65)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Interi nyontarai we endukepang Yesusi, entatipari kong endorai. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Ya engkawung rekamiwau na asung mae etutang nindiwani etoyo, “Auwo nabi tarai Diau mamo, topang kamang we riora Aupai.” <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Entopang kawio madupei nariaea we etintatipari.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi engkori to Mananu Akama nyontarai Yaudi</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 27:1; Markusi 15:1; Yohanesi 18:19-24)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Na ayarima yani we embe mananu we Yaudi, we embedung we Imami pa ya, kong kuru akama Yaudi empandura, interi engko Yesusi to Mananu Akamapa ya. <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />Interi ya engkawio etoyo, “Topana we ama: Impaina taraie au wo Mananu Weperiri di au e?” Interi Yesusi doyo, “Impaina Yo etopana we Yauwo Mananu Weperiri, mamo mia mendoaoa wa. <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />Mae parari yo yutang mia, mamo ingkai metaoa wa. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Na aneito Kumai Nyontarai ingkai meoina Allai we piaya waradowatang<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.69 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Meoina waradowatang Mamo Nu weweng raweina kong wemananu tutu nyowa dina. </char></note>.” <verse eid="LUK 22:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Ya engkai engkawio etoyo, “Toyana mamo, Allai Antung diau e?” Yesusi daoa doyo, “Parari we mentopanapa.” <verse eid="LUK 22:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Interi ya etoyo, “Tandeo taserai nyontarai pei we sopana eampe! Piana tantaraoa na mantauni to!”<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s">Yesusi na Pilatusi renawau</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 27:1-2, 11-14; Markusi 15:1-5; Yohanesi 18:28-38)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Interi mayoi akama wauya entawa etoa kuira mae engko Yesusi wu Pilatusi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pilatusi mamo Parenta Roma enduwari we Kubernuri na raora Yudea na puda 26-36 M.</char></note> renawau. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Na yana emburi etoyo, “Nyontarai nini amataduti kewio ayara, weangkari kawasa kong yua rai amaneng wau ya we embai wiwai wa we kaisari, kong doyo iwo Kristusi, Mananu Baba dina.”<verse eid="LUK 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Interi Pilatusi dutang wu Yesusi doyo, “Auwo we mananu we nyontarai Yaudi wauya pane?” Yesusi kewio doyo, “Mantau au topanapa.” <verse eid="LUK 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Pilatusi kewio we embedung we imami kong nyontarai we empau paya doyo, “Yau yedu dosara pi koiri wa, we nyontarai nini weembe wangkaipe. <verse eid="LUK 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Mana ya etairora Pilatusi mae etoyo, “I kewioaya nyontarai paya engkai na raora Yudea tantenang we etoamuna we parenta Roma. Ne anyaupa dona retenang na Galilea kong piana ra sisu nina. <verse eid="LUK 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Mana Pilatusi taraoa entopana toyana pa, interi dutang doyo, Impaina nyontarai ninipai nyontarai Galilea dina e?” <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Na awe Pilatusi rearoangna we Yesusi ria na raora Herodesi we mananu nayapa. Impaina Pilatusi denatu Yesusi wu Herodesia, Na a yani Herodesi nyaina Yerusalemi. <verse eid="LUK 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Herodesi merarising tutu reo Yesusi, tutu piana manyona pei taroi kong anewe reoi. I anewea kangkuna we reo Yesusi dong piwe tawa tantuma wau. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Herodesi dutani na autang taubaipa, mana Yesusi we raupui katea wa. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Interi we embedung we imami kong kuru akama Yaudi esarota Herodesi tato na yana, mae etimbu Yesusi kangkuna we dosarapi. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Herodesi kong ne pimamuna pa ya etameiri kong entatipa Yesusi, interi etoni yesung asung we mananu baba, mae etoni tawerito Pilatusi. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Na awe rangpa Herodesi kong Pilatusi umbe marowa waweria, mana ayani untaweria undu umbarami umbe koiri.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pilatusi pika Yesusi imbaro embe wangkai we keda</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 27:15-26; Markusi 15:6-15; Yohanesi 18:38-19:16)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Interi Pilatusi riurikui we embedung we imami pa ya, kong weendu wang mananu, kong kawasa paya, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />interi kewio we ya doyo, “Mia mengko nyontarai nini pai we yau kong metoyo I denyau nyontarai etong amuna we parenta Roma pai. Na mendenane piana yiri, mana yauwo yedu dosara pianea wa parari we metimburipa. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Mae Herodes we anetatuata toyana tato, wo i piana woretuwa Yesusi teweri we ama. Nyontarai ninipai dosara pi koiri wawiria we wangka riuti we kedapewa. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Toyana yau ingkai erarubati interi epikari.” [<verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />Na anani Paskapei mamo, Pilatusi imbe pika nyontarai we embe wangkai pei we kawasa paya.] <verse eid="LUK 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Nyontarai tau we empanduya na yana paya etanana etoyo, “Memuni! Mempika Barabasi we ama!” <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Barabasi aitamu riuti tutu pera nyontarai we etoamuna we parenta Roma pai kong miungbemuna.<verse eid="LUK 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Pilatusi do anewe pika Yesusi, impaina kewio naria ea we nyontarai we empaupa ya. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Mana nyontarai we empaupa ya etanana etoyo, “Yeroi na aitabapai! Yeroi na aitabapai“<verse eid="LUK 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Interi we botoru pai Pilatusi kewio weya doyo, “Toyana mamo pitoai dosararapa? Yauwo yeduti we dosara pi koiri naiwa imbaro wangka riuti we keda! Impaina yauwo ingkai erarubati mae epikaria.”<verse eid="LUK 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Mana ya etanana kangkuna imbaro etong Yesusi yeroi na aitabapai. Mae toyana etananapa piana taoato. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Impaina Pilatusi kiutu we Yesusi wangka riuti ki keda parari nyontarai pa eneawapa. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Interi empika nyontarai we nyaina wangka rarong wadi wedoamuna tutu miung bemuna. Mae Yesusi empikari weya etoni topitotoi parari we esaneaoa pa.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi yeroina aitaba</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 27:33-44; Markusi 15:22-32; Yohanesi 19:17-24)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Toyana pimamuna Roma paya engko Yesusia. Interi na rang rabuang pa etadu nyontarai we ano Simoni, riana raora Kirine, we yuato bendari wadi. Pimamuna wau endu kepang Simoni, mae etairorai yedo aitaba, riana Yesusi karupui pa.<verse eid="LUK 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Kawasa we empau etua Yesusi na karupui, kong na kawasa yani, wawing pea enda konta. Wawing yana paya esai esaneao Yesusi tutu ne ui deduta wau. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Mana Yesusi reweria weya mae doyo, “Wawing Yerusalemipa mia! Mendeo mesai yaupe. Mae mesai waweri mia kong mene kumai paya. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Wo a wane ingkai rama nyontarai engkawio etoyo, ‘Piboki we wawing we anekarawai we etaiwawingwa, ete we weetong u we ene kumaipa wa.’ <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Na a yanito nyontarai ingkai engkawio we wipa etoyo, ‘Tuawa mung ama!’ Mae we wi rewowai, ‘Tuawa wawawu ama!’ <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Toyana Yau eparari ai we doa mekae, nyontaraipa piana etona toapeina, mamo ingkai pitoai etona we nyontarai we embe sasari emparari ai wememanei pa?”<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Mae nyontaraipe kodu tato umamuna, ya empapa asarua we wangka riu asaru we ungkada kong Yesusi. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Interi enda sisu nu we esawi ano “Wekadadung neina“ mae ya empaku Yesusi kong nyontarai kodu we umamuna, asaruei yeroi na wara dowatang mae asaruei yeroi na wara dowiri pai. <figure style="fig" alt="Yesus di gantung di kayu salib" file="WA03925b.tif" size="col" ref="23.33">Yesusi yeroi na aitaba</figure><verse eid="LUK 23:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Interi Yesusi tendau doyo, “Yai bupirandeni ene sasaripa! Tutu ya enduinari piwe etonapa wa.” Mae embiwo Yesusi ne asungpa mai ya, impaina empiwa we matei dedutapa. <verse eid="LUK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Nyontarai pa etoa mae esayo, na yana Mananu Baba Yaudi entatipa Yesusi mae etoyo, “I piana periri nyontarai peayato. Toyana mamo mantauni periri wawerito, tutu I wo Mananu weperiri dina, nyontarai we Allai diri.”<verse eid="LUK 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Nyontarai pimamuna wauya tato etongtatipa Yesusi. Ya endama etong angguri weya' wadi wei, <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />interi etoyo, “Auwo Mananu Baba we nyontarai Yaudi diau mamo, poriri mantau Au!” <verse eid="LUK 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Na aitaba we Yesusi yeroinai wawong yei wadi entoi topinina, “Nyontarai ninipai Yaudi ene Mananu Baba pina.”<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Nyontarai we umamuna usaroi na aitaba pa, asaru ei tetipa Yesusi. I kewio doyo, “Au we Mananu poriripi di aue? Toyana mamo, Poriri mantaung au kong andu!”<verse eid="LUK 23:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Mana we memuna ei wadi yua asaru ei pai doyo, “Auwo motai Allai wae? Au bodu wangka we koda parari I. <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Taru wo turadu wangka tutu piwe turonapa. Mana I wo dong sasari kateawa!” <verse eid="LUK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Interi i kewio doyo, “Yesuse! Anemuao yau, na a we ruama we Mananu Baba wane!” <verse eid="LUK 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yesusi kewio wei doyo, “Roaoa! Na aneito piana au nuai kong Yau na rora-marising<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Firdausi andi tasawi we rora-marising. Yani mamo Raora we kawasa we endoao Allai yati engkada mamo enainapeina.</char></note>.”<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi keda</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 27:45-46; Markusi 15:33-41; Yohanesi 19:28-30)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Wa' awau ra kikeuwe saraka riora uraya kodu, wo wadi deawa, mae raora wadi berorang tentenang sisu rawandeng, saraka riora botoru. <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />Irei we yeroi na Manu Mamarang wadi, teabu we kodu. <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Interi Yesusi denanaera doyo “Yai! Towaramu rarong pa neu tarai nei kiai yoni tentenang weau!” I kewioa kai na yana, ne asengpa takutu na peinato. <verse eid="LUK 23:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Na awe yewoi we pimamuna wadi reo pitoai tawa tantuma, I deparanding Allai. Interi i kewio doyo, “Tarai, I dong sasaripea wa!” <verse eid="LUK 23:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Nyontarai we empau endamapa ya tato esayori, endeo piwe tawa tantumapa. Ya kuira entaweri esarokutuya na esanerarong. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Nyontarai tau endearoang Yesusi pa ya, kong wawing etuari na Galilea pa ya, etoa na woroi mae endeo pitaubai we tawa na Yesusi pa.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Etaisata Yesusi</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 27:57-61; Markusi 15:42-47; Yohanesi 19:38-42)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50-51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50-51" />Nyontarai pei anong pei Yusupi, i riana bendari Arimatea na raora Yudea. I nyontarai we mei, nyontarai endoaoi, kong demangpi awe Allai riama riu we Mananu pa. I tato Mananu Akama Yaudi, mae i rioaoawa we kawio engkutu kamana we Yesusi pa. <verse eid="LUK 23:50-51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Yusupi ria arota Pilatusi mae dewara imbaro engko Yesusi we etaisatai. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Interi i pi Yesusi warui aitabapai, mae yesani na irei we remimoma mae ne awayang baba. Impaina i kioria doni wiata na kambirei we nyontarai piana esiraia na wi we kamipa. Kambirei yani esoni wekadapei nai wami. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Ayani a Jumati dina, piana do rawandeng we a Sabati<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.54 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sabati, “Awe nyontarai Yaudi endupiwanai wa. A nini mamo na nini tasauwi we a Sabtu.”</char></note> piana kikeuto.<verse eid="LUK 23:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Mae wawing we enda kong Yesusi na Galilea paya, etua Yusupi mae endeo etaisatai wau. Ya endeo topino Yesusi etoni wiata na kambirei rarong paipa. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Interi ya entaweri etong kui maning weairowu we etisepu Yesusi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:56">Na a yani awe Yaudi endupiwa nai, ya emanaing warui mariwa we etonapa etong parari mamba akama pai.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s">Yesusi tewa warui kaidapa</para>
  <para style="r">(Matiusi 28:1-10; Markusi 16:1-8; Yohanesi 20:1-10)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Na arimingku ayarima kakepang, wawing wauya endato aisata pa, engko pi weairowu we piana etona manyena. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Na aisatapa, ya etadutapi kami aturarei piana keidui torito. <figure style="fig" alt="batu pintu kubur sudah terguling" file="GT00088.tif" size="col" ref="24.2">kami aturarei piana keidui torito</figure><verse eid="LUK 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Interi wawing wauya esua to aisata rarong apui, mana etadu Yesusi netarai wadi na yana wa. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Na yana etoa mae embekaeng esanetatua piwawau, na tantuma nyontarai pe kodu usasung asung wewaweria uroa kikeu ya. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Wawing wau ematai kangkuna kia, impaina entuang esomia sisu kakopa wadi, interi nyontarai wau asaru ungkawio wu wawing wauya uroyo, “Pitoi dona meserai nyontarai we wieng nei na weengkada wau ene madukuira pa? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />I wo nyaina ninane wa, I wo piana tewato. Mesaneao pitoi piana sopana we mia na awe nyaina Galilea pa. <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />Sopana topino, “Kumai Nyontarai imbere etoni wu nyontarai embe sasari pa ya. Interi emuni na aitabapai mae na awe botoru I wo ingkai tewa na kaidapa.” <verse eid="LUK 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Topiana wawing wau ya esaneao Yesusi ne kawio pa. <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Interi entaweri na aisata wau, embuwu tau wawau we ne rasuri uraya koiri wau ya kong taubai we etuari ea wauya. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Wawing we entopang tau wawau wu weetua Yesusi mamo: Mariai, weriana bendari Magdala pai, Yoanai kong Yakobusi nyani Mariai kong wawing peaya weengkongsa pa ya. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Mana rasuri wauya etorato wawing wau ya embuwu kawio tarai wa, impaina endoaoa wa. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Mana Petrusi tewa mae depai to aisata wau. Tentuang mae reto kambirei aisata rarong. Mana reao asung webua etisasani wau. Petrusi arokutuya kia impaina teweri anengdutangbaweri tutu piwe to wawau.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi denyauwi na rang we na Emausi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Mrk. 16:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />A' yani tato, nyontarai kodu na we etua Yesusi, undato awa wena Emausi. We tantuata mamo wake kilo pe uraya koiri woroi warui Yerusalemi. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Na rang rarongpa unda mae ungkawio parari Yesusi ne kaidapa, kong pitau wawau we tawapa. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Na ungkawio urutangbaweri asaru, Yesusi riatantuma ma ria kong asaru. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Undeo Yesusi, mana pieai dona undeweroani wa. <verse eid="LUK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Interi Yesusi kewio doyo, “Pitoi andi munda mungkawiori na randarong neipa. Uroa weta mae unde asasona. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Interi asaru we anong Keriopasi dutang wu Yesusi doyo, “Wawo Yai momeari rua waworu to Yerusalemima e? Wo ruinari piwe tupa na anisaru ne?” <verse eid="LUK 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Interi Yesusi dutang doyo, “Wawo pitoina?” Uroyo, “Piwe dedu Yesusi nyontarai Nasareti pai. I wo nabi dina. Piwe sopana wau kong piwe dona wau barui kia, na Allai rena wau kong na kawasa we pau endenawau. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />We embedung we imami kong mananu tanene empikari wu parenta Romapai, we embe wangkai na aitabapai ya keda. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Impaina I mamo na awe rampa amasanesari we ingkai andi periri Israeli ne tata warui tane marowa pa ya, mana toyana wa, a nini a we botoru na pitau we radea pa. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Naria ea, wawing peaya na ama etonane amantantuma. Ayarima kakepang enda to aisata wau. <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />Mana etadu wekada wadi na wana wa. Impaina entaweri kong entopana topino amandeo mampang pe kodu ungkawio uroyo Yesusi yuwi eampa. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Eaya na ama interi endawu aisata wau mana etaduta parari piwe wawing bau entopana pa toapeina, mae yawo endeo Yesusi wa. <verse eid="LUK 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Interi Yesusi kewio we asaru, “Maruwo muntata! Musaneaponawa we mundoao pitau we piana Allai demi nabipa ya entopana pa. <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Topino Mananu we Periri imbere dedu we moyawa pampong. Impino dedu ne dea marising wanepe. <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Interi Yesusi sopang aiwara we asaru pitoi entoi na Weraung Mamarang wadi tantenang we I pa. Retenang na weraung we Musai soi pai ra sisu weraung we Allai demi nabi wau ya entoipa.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Topiana engkikeu we awa endawuri wadi to. Yesusi domparari we doyo ria topong. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Mana usua weti uroyo, “Nuaiko andu na nina piana do diru to, kong do berorang pa mamo.” Interi Yesusi yua kong asaru to une manupai rarong. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Na itoroyo itomayoi itorampi kuira pa, Yesusi kio roti wau tendau oa wu Allai, piobabau roti wau na warang wau interi dona we asaru. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Interi usaneaiwa asaru topino Yesusi ina. Mana I nyai warui asaru na undena wau. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Ungkawio waweria we asaru, Aoa tusanerarong ayaa na kewio kong taru na rang rabuang kong kewio anyau Weraung Mamarang wadi we taru pa. <verse eid="LUK 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Na yanato untawa mae untaweri to Yerusalemi. Na wana asaru uradu we esuraya koiri weetua Yesusi enda empadura kong eaya. <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />Ya etoyo, “Katu tarai Sen piana wieng taweri! I piana denyau netarai pai we Simoni!” <verse eid="LUK 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Kodu we urua Yesusi we undama wau asaru, urontopana parari weuraduta tato na rangdarongpa, kong undeweroang Seni na I piobabau roti pa.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi denyau netarai pai we ne weetuari paya engkai</para>
  <para style="r">(Yohanesi 20:19-23)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Emayoi engkawio piwe tawa wau, Yesusi doa tantuma na ene rabuang mae doyo, “Piboki mararising we mia.” <verse eid="LUK 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Ya entantuma kong ematai, tutu etorato endeo wekada duainunung. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Mana Yesusi doyo, “Pitoi dona memataipa? Pitoi dona mesanerirupa? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Mendema waraune kong aeune. Mesaneao we mantau yauna, metakama kong mesairi tutu wekada duainunung wadi we netarai wa, we neina wa, parari we mendeoa na Yaune.<figure style="fig" alt="Yesus bangkit dari kematian dan menyatakan diriNya" file="WA03932b.tif" size="col" ref="24.39">Yesusi tewa na kaida wau, denyau ne tarai pai</figure><verse eid="LUK 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Yesusi kewio towawau mae denyau warang kong aeangwau. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Mana na yana endoaoa wami, tutu emarising kong etariaera, Yesusi dutang ya doyo, “Mene roweang pea e?”. <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Ya etona wu Yesusia diang we esora wope pea. <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Yesusi dekara kio diang wau, interi dangna endena wau. <verse eid="LUK 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Impaina kewio wu yara doyo, “Pi ninane aino piana eweroana we mia na awe tanpandura pa. Tutu pitoiai entoi pararia we Yau na weraung we Musai soi pa, nabi pa entoipa kong na Weraung Masmuri wo piana tawa to.” <verse eid="LUK 24:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Interi Yesusi yepa we esane tatuata wau imbaro esane babau Weraung Mamarang wadi. <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />Yesusi kewio weya doyo, “Na Weraung Mamarang wadi soi topino, Mananu Baba we periri pai, imbere yeseung kong tewa warui kaida wadi na awe botoru pai. <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />Kong na Mananu Periri nei Yau Anoune, membuwua we kawasa tau na nunei, we entaweri warui ene sasaripa. Mae we Allai dupirandeni sasari pa to. Mae arera yana, membuwua retenangra na pei Yerusalemi. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Miati menda membuwua parari pitoai mendeoa na mendekamipa. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Ingkai mantau Yau yenatua we mia pitoai Yai dererapa. Mana mia menai metamang na bendari nini kio paya we rana Allaipa domu mia.”<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusi wieita to rora-marising</para>
  <para style="r">(Markusi. 16:19-20; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Kis. 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Kai na yana pei Yesusi kio ya toriwarui bendari yani wu Betania. Na yana I riuwa warang wau mae myuang ya. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Kaiki dong muangpa weya, I piowari wieita to rora-marising interi teriai warui ya. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Ya entuang esomi Yesusi interi entaweri to Yerusalemi na esanerarong we mararising kia. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Kong etaparanding Allai pampang na Ne Manu pai.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>